window.VASLIX_I18N = {"en":{"about.eyebrow":"About","about.lede":"One person, two games on Google Play, no office. <strong>Small apps, made carefully, that respect your device and your attention.</strong> Nothing to sign into, nothing of yours on a server of ours, and no investor asking why the monetisation is so quiet.","about.stats.apps":"apps shipped","about.stats.langs":"supported languages","about.stats.people":"person in the studio","about.stats.since":"shipping since","about.title":"A small studio with a long view","also.cta":"Back to the shelf","also.eyebrow":"Also from the studio","also.title":"The rest of the shelf","card.blocklix.desc":"Drop shapes into an 8×8 board, clear lines and squares, chain combos for big multipliers. Six difficulty levels, 38 themes, 60 ranks across 21 achievement chains, four boosters, daily and weekly missions with a streak chest, and a cosmetics wardrobe. Optional ad-free Premium with 2× stars and a daily gift.","card.blocklix.genre":"Puzzle","card.gridlix.desc":"A 4×4 merge puzzle for Android. The Daily is seeded from the date, so every player worldwide gets the same board, graded out of three stars; a streak with shields survives a missed evening, and a finished month is worth a medal. Five boosters, three uses of each per game, five colour themes, tuned haptics, and an optional Premium that removes the ads.","contact.btn":"Send an email","contact.eyebrow":"Contact","contact.text":"Bugs, ideas, press questions and partnership offers all land in the same inbox. For anything that crashed, include your device and Android version.","contact.title":"Write, and a person answers","cta.play":"Get it on Google Play","diff.eyebrow":"Six difficulty levels","diff.intro":"Only the piece generator changes. Scoring, boards and ranks stay the same on every rung — harder just means the pieces stop helping you.","diff.note":"Higher rungs pay more stars per point. Easy pays fewer, and never pretends otherwise.","diff.title":"Pick the length of your game","f.boosters":"boosters","f.daily":"graded Daily","f.difficulties":"difficulty levels","f.languages":"languages","f.ranks":"ranks","f.themes":"themes","faq.a1":"Cancel from <strong>Google Play → Subscriptions</strong>, or use the \"Manage\" button inside the app — it deep-links to the same page. Cancellation takes effect at the end of your current billing period.","faq.a2":"Progress lives on your device. In Blocklix, Android’s own backup copies it into your Google account, so reinstalling on the same account usually brings it back; in Gridlix:2048 that backup is switched off, so there a save is lost on uninstall unless you use the Play Games cloud save. We never upload a save to a server of ours. Premium restores by itself once you reinstall and sign in to the same Google account.","faq.a3":"Not us. Our own code never touches it — the advertising SDKs inside the app do, so that ads can be frequency-capped and installs attributed. With Premium, or the Remove Ads purchase in Blocklix, it is no longer used for banners, interstitials or app-open ads; it is still processed if you choose to watch a rewarded video. The <a href=\"./privacy-policy.html\">Privacy Policy</a> names every SDK that reads it.","faq.a4":"Android 8.0 (API 26) and up. That is on purpose: a phone handed down twice should still run these.","faq.a5":"Blocklix ships in 12: English, Russian, German, Spanish, French, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese (Brazil), Turkish, Arabic and Simplified Chinese. Gridlix:2048 covers a smaller set. The system language is auto-detected on first launch and can be overridden in app settings.","faq.a6":"Write to <a href=\"mailto:vaslixofficial@protonmail.com\">vaslixofficial@protonmail.com</a> with a short description. Screenshots and device model help a lot. We read every message.","faq.a7":"Not on the roadmap. One person can keep two Android games updated for years; two platforms would mean neither of them got that. If the catalogue grows enough to change the arithmetic, it will be said here.","faq.a8":"No. Premium removes banners and interstitials, doubles the stars a run pays and adds a daily gift and the premium themes. Every level, rank and mission is the same for everyone.","faq.eyebrow":"FAQ","faq.q1":"How do I cancel my subscription?","faq.q2":"What happens to my game progress if I uninstall?","faq.q3":"Who reads the Advertising ID?","faq.q4":"Which Android versions are supported?","faq.q5":"Which languages do the apps support?","faq.q6":"I found a bug or want to suggest a feature.","faq.q7":"Will there ever be an iOS version?","faq.q8":"Does Premium change how the game plays?","faq.title":"Common questions","footer.builtWith":"Hand-written HTML. No trackers on this site.","footer.contactTitle":"Contact","footer.copyright":"© Vaslix Games · Independent Android studio","footer.games":"Games","footer.gamesAria":"Games","footer.made":"Made in one room, played in twelve languages.","footer.privacyLink":"Privacy Policy","footer.replyTime":"Usually answered within five business days.","footer.studio":"Studio","footer.studioAria":"Studio links","g.blocklix.blurb":"Drop shapes into an 8×8 board, clear lines and squares, chain combos for big multipliers. Six difficulty levels, 38 themes, 60 ranks across 21 achievement chains, four boosters, daily and weekly missions with a streak chest, and a cosmetics wardrobe. Optional ad-free Premium with 2× stars and a daily gift.","g.blocklix.boosters.eyebrow":"Boosters","g.blocklix.boosters.intro":"Each one is bought with stars you earned by playing. None of them can be bought with money on its own.","g.blocklix.boosters.note":"Stars come from finished games, missions and ranks. Premium doubles what a run pays; it does not sell the boosters directly.","g.blocklix.boosters.title":"Four ways out of a bad board","g.blocklix.chip.1":"8×8 board","g.blocklix.chip.2":"Plays offline","g.blocklix.chip.3":"No account","g.blocklix.difficulty.eyebrow":"Six difficulty levels","g.blocklix.difficulty.intro":"Only the piece generator changes. Scoring, boards and ranks stay the same on every rung — harder just means the pieces stop helping you.","g.blocklix.difficulty.note":"Higher rungs pay more stars per point. Easy pays fewer, and never pretends otherwise.","g.blocklix.difficulty.title":"Pick the length of your game","g.blocklix.genre":"Puzzle","g.blocklix.how.1.d":"Three pieces at a time. Any of them can go anywhere it fits; nothing rotates, nothing falls.","g.blocklix.how.1.t":"Drop","g.blocklix.how.2.d":"Fill a row or a column and it vanishes. Fill both at once and the board tells you so.","g.blocklix.how.2.t":"Clear","g.blocklix.how.3.d":"Clear on consecutive drops and the multiplier climbs. One quiet tick warns you when a line is about to go.","g.blocklix.how.3.t":"Combo","g.blocklix.how.eyebrow":"How it plays","g.blocklix.how.intro":"Blocklix is the 8×8 drop-and-clear you have seen before — tuned until every one of these feels right in the hand.","g.blocklix.how.title":"Three moves you already know","g.blocklix.openAria":"Open the Blocklix page","g.blocklix.palettes.eyebrow":"38 themes","g.blocklix.palettes.free":"Free from install","g.blocklix.palettes.intro":"Four are yours from install. The rest are earned with stars or come with Premium — and each one changes the sky, the blocks and the way a cleared line lights up.","g.blocklix.palettes.tap":"Tap a theme to dress the board","g.blocklix.palettes.title":"Every board wears a palette","g.blocklix.playAria":"Blocklix on Google Play","g.blocklix.premium.1":"Banners, interstitials and app-open ads switch off","g.blocklix.premium.2":"A run pays twice the stars","g.blocklix.premium.3":"A daily gift, and the premium themes","g.blocklix.premium.4":"Every difficulty, rank and mission stays exactly as it was","g.blocklix.premium.eyebrow":"Premium","g.blocklix.premium.intro":"Premium removes what gets in the way and speeds up what you already earn. It does not unlock a level, a rank or a mission.","g.blocklix.premium.note":"Rewarded videos stay opt-in for everyone: they only play when you tap the button that asks for one.","g.blocklix.premium.title":"What money changes — and what it never touches","g.blocklix.progress.eyebrow":"The long game","g.blocklix.progress.families":"The fifteen families","g.blocklix.progress.intro":"Everything below is earned by playing. Nothing here is sold.","g.blocklix.progress.missions.d":"Thirteen daily kinds that scale with your rank, two weekly ones, and a chest for the week you keep at it.","g.blocklix.progress.missions.t":"Daily and weekly missions","g.blocklix.progress.quests.d":"Five steps each, from the first clear to the ones almost nobody reaches.","g.blocklix.progress.quests.t":"21 achievement chains","g.blocklix.progress.ranks.d":"Fifteen families of four. Points are your score, weighted by the difficulty you chose.","g.blocklix.progress.ranks.t":"60 ranks","g.blocklix.progress.title":"A road, not a treadmill","g.blocklix.tagline":"Drop three pieces, clear the line, keep the combo alive.","g.gridlix.blurb":"A 4×4 merge puzzle for Android. The Daily is seeded from the date, so every player worldwide gets the same board, graded out of three stars; a streak with shields survives a missed evening, and a finished month is worth a medal. Five boosters, three uses of each per game, five colour themes, tuned haptics, and an optional Premium that removes the ads.","g.gridlix.boosters.delete.d":"Removes one tile you point at.","g.gridlix.boosters.eyebrow":"Boosters","g.gridlix.boosters.intro":"The cap is per game, not per day, so a booster is a decision inside a run rather than a resource to hoard.","g.gridlix.boosters.note":"For a free player each use is paid with a rewarded video you choose to watch; Premium skips both the video and the counter. Using none is the third Daily star.","g.gridlix.boosters.shuffle.d":"Rearranges what is already there, without adding anything.","g.gridlix.boosters.swap.d":"Trades the places of two tiles.","g.gridlix.boosters.title":"Five, three uses each","g.gridlix.boosters.undo.d":"Takes back the last move, spawn included.","g.gridlix.boosters.value_clear.d":"Sweeps every tile of one value off the board.","g.gridlix.chip.1":"4×4 board","g.gridlix.chip.2":"Daily + endless","g.gridlix.chip.3":"Home-screen widget","g.gridlix.daily.eyebrow":"The Daily","g.gridlix.daily.intro":"A dated seed builds the opening position and the whole spawn stream, so the board you are staring at is the board everyone else is staring at.","g.gridlix.daily.seed.d":"The opening is played out in advance by a scripted bot, and its move count sets the par you are measured against. Several attempts a day; the best one counts.","g.gridlix.daily.seed.t":"One seed, one board","g.gridlix.daily.star.1":"Reach the target tile inside the move cap.","g.gridlix.daily.star.2":"Do it inside par — the bot's own move count.","g.gridlix.daily.star.3":"Inside par with no booster touched all game.","g.gridlix.daily.title":"The same puzzle as everyone else","g.gridlix.genre":"Puzzle","g.gridlix.how.1.d":"One direction moves every tile on the board at once. There is no partial move.","g.gridlix.how.1.t":"Swipe","g.gridlix.how.2.d":"Two equal tiles that touch become one, worth double. A tile merges once per move.","g.gridlix.how.2.t":"Merge","g.gridlix.how.3.d":"In Endless the goal is your own record. In the Daily it is a stated tile inside a stated number of moves.","g.gridlix.how.3.t":"Reach the target","g.gridlix.how.eyebrow":"How it plays","g.gridlix.how.intro":"There is nothing to learn beyond the swipe. Everything after that is arithmetic and nerve.","g.gridlix.how.title":"One gesture, all the way down","g.gridlix.month.eyebrow":"The month","g.gridlix.month.intro":"One missed evening should not erase four months. Shields absorb a miss, and the calendar keeps the whole month in view.","g.gridlix.month.legend.done":"Played","g.gridlix.month.legend.miss":"Missed","g.gridlix.month.legend.shield":"Shielded","g.gridlix.month.medals.d":"Finish a month and it is graded once, kept forever, and shown in the trophy case next to your best streak.","g.gridlix.month.medals.t":"Monthly medals","g.gridlix.month.streak.d":"A shield is spent automatically on the day you miss, and you earn them back by playing. The streak survives an ordinary bad week.","g.gridlix.month.streak.t":"Shields","g.gridlix.month.title":"A streak you can actually keep","g.gridlix.openAria":"Open the Gridlix:2048 page","g.gridlix.playAria":"Gridlix:2048 on Google Play","g.gridlix.premium.1":"No banners and no interstitials, anywhere","g.gridlix.premium.2":"Boosters without watching anything first","g.gridlix.premium.3":"Continues when the board fills up","g.gridlix.premium.4":"The four locked palettes open up","g.gridlix.premium.eyebrow":"Premium","g.gridlix.premium.intro":"A subscription through Google Play, monthly or yearly, with a free trial on the yearly plan. Cancel from Play at any time.","g.gridlix.premium.note":"The Daily, its stars, the streak and the medals work exactly the same whether you pay or not.","g.gridlix.premium.title":"Play without the interruptions","g.gridlix.tagline":"One board, one daily puzzle — the same one for everyone.","g.gridlix.themes.eyebrow":"Palettes","g.gridlix.themes.free":"Free","g.gridlix.themes.intro":"The palette changes the tiles, the accent and the glow — never a rule. These are the real colours, straight out of the app.","g.gridlix.themes.premium":"Premium","g.gridlix.themes.title":"Five palettes, one board","g.words.chip.1":"Word puzzle","g.words.chip.2":"Prototype","g.words.tagline":"A word puzzle, still on paper. Same shape: small, quiet, offline.","g.words.when":"No date yet","gd.blocklix.booster.bomb.desc":"Clears a 3×3 area instantly","gd.blocklix.booster.bomb.name":"Bomb","gd.blocklix.booster.hammer.desc":"Smashes any one block","gd.blocklix.booster.hammer.name":"Hammer","gd.blocklix.booster.lightning.desc":"Zaps a full row and column in one strike","gd.blocklix.booster.lightning.name":"Lightning","gd.blocklix.booster.shuffle.desc":"Swaps your pieces for three new ones","gd.blocklix.booster.shuffle.name":"Shuffle","gd.blocklix.diff.easy.desc":"Long, relaxed games. Fewer stars.","gd.blocklix.diff.easy.name":"Easy","gd.blocklix.diff.expert.desc":"Every new set of pieces is a puzzle.","gd.blocklix.diff.expert.name":"Expert","gd.blocklix.diff.hard.desc":"Bigger pieces show up sooner.","gd.blocklix.diff.hard.name":"Hard","gd.blocklix.diff.insane.desc":"Pure luck of the draw. Pieces might not fit at all.","gd.blocklix.diff.insane.name":"Insane","gd.blocklix.diff.master.desc":"Only the sharpest survive. No easy pieces.","gd.blocklix.diff.master.name":"Master","gd.blocklix.diff.normal.desc":"The classic pace — about ten minutes.","gd.blocklix.diff.normal.name":"Normal","gd.blocklix.rank.bronze":"Bronze","gd.blocklix.rank.celestial":"Celestial","gd.blocklix.rank.cosmic":"Cosmic","gd.blocklix.rank.diamond":"Diamond","gd.blocklix.rank.emerald":"Emerald","gd.blocklix.rank.eternal":"Eternal","gd.blocklix.rank.gold":"Gold","gd.blocklix.rank.grandmaster":"Grandmaster","gd.blocklix.rank.legend":"Legend","gd.blocklix.rank.master":"Master","gd.blocklix.rank.mythic":"Mythic","gd.blocklix.rank.platinum":"Platinum","gd.blocklix.rank.ruby":"Ruby","gd.blocklix.rank.silver":"Silver","gd.blocklix.rank.stone":"Stone","gd.gridlix.booster.delete.name":"Delete","gd.gridlix.booster.shuffle.name":"Shuffle","gd.gridlix.booster.swap.name":"Swap","gd.gridlix.booster.undo.name":"Undo","gd.gridlix.booster.value_clear.name":"Cleanup","gd.gridlix.medal.bronze":"Bronze","gd.gridlix.medal.gold":"Gold","gd.gridlix.medal.silver":"Silver","gp.back":"All titles","hero.cta.games":"Our games","hero.cta.studio":"About the studio","hero.kick":"Independent Android studio","hero.lede":"Two puzzle games, made by one person. No accounts, no servers of ours, twelve languages — and a Premium that does exactly one thing: it removes the ads.","hero.scroll":"Scroll","hero.t1":"Small games.","hero.t2":"Built to last.","how.eyebrow":"How it plays","how.intro":"Blocklix is the 8×8 drop-and-clear you have seen before — tuned until every one of these feels right in the hand.","how.s1d":"Three pieces at a time. Any of them can go anywhere it fits; nothing rotates, nothing falls.","how.s1t":"Drop","how.s2d":"Fill a row or a column and it vanishes. Fill both at once and the board tells you so.","how.s2t":"Clear","how.s3d":"Clear on consecutive drops and the multiplier climbs. One quiet tick warns you when a line is about to go.","how.s3t":"Combo","how.title":"Three moves you already know","meta.blocklix.desc":"Drop three pieces into an 8×8 board, clear rows and columns, chain combos. 38 themes, 60 ranks, six difficulty levels, twelve languages. No accounts.","meta.blocklix.title":"Blocklix — an 8×8 drop-and-clear puzzle | Vaslix Games","meta.description":"Vaslix Games is an independent Android studio shipping small, focused puzzle games. Gridlix:2048 and Blocklix are both live on Google Play.","meta.gridlix.desc":"A 4×4 merge puzzle with a seeded Daily that is identical for every player, streak shields, monthly medals and five boosters. Endless mode never ends.","meta.gridlix.title":"Gridlix:2048 — one daily puzzle for everyone | Vaslix Games","meta.home.desc":"Vaslix Games is an independent Android studio shipping small, focused puzzle games. Gridlix:2048 and Blocklix are both live on Google Play.","meta.home.title":"Vaslix Games — small Android puzzle games, built to last","meta.notFound.desc":"That address does not lead anywhere. The shelf does.","meta.notFound.title":"Page not found — Vaslix Games","meta.press.desc":"Blurb, fact sheet, icons and contact for writers and partners. Answered within about five business days.","meta.press.title":"Press kit — Vaslix Games","meta.privacy.desc":"How Vaslix Games handles data in Gridlix:2048 and Blocklix. Plain-language summary, the full policy, what each game stores, and GDPR/CCPA/COPPA notes.","meta.privacy.title":"Privacy Policy — Vaslix Games","meta.studio.desc":"One person, small Android apps, no accounts and no servers of ours. What we build, the rules we keep, and what comes next.","meta.studio.title":"Studio — Vaslix Games","meta.title":"Vaslix Games — small Android puzzle games, built to last","nav.aria":"Main navigation","nav.brand":"Vaslix Games","nav.games":"Games","nav.langLabel":"Change language","nav.menu":"Menu","nav.press":"Press","nav.privacy":"Privacy","nav.skip":"Skip to content","nav.studio":"Studio","nav.theme.auto":"Switch to automatic theme","nav.theme.dark":"Switch to dark theme","nav.theme.light":"Switch to light theme","nf.body":"The address does not lead anywhere. The shelf, on the other hand, is right where you left it.","nf.eyebrow":"404","nf.games":"See the shelf","nf.home":"Home","nf.title":"This square is empty","nums.accounts":"accounts required","nums.games":"games on Google Play","nums.langs":"languages","nums.person":"person","nums.servers":"servers of ours","nums.since":"shipping since","nums.title":"The studio in numbers","p.changed.body":"We read this policy against the source of both apps and corrected it where the two disagreed. Google AdMob is named no longer, because neither app ships it. The claim that the Android device ID is read to verify your subscription was wrong and is gone. Advertising SDKs that arrive inside the Appodeal mediation bundle — Adjust, AppsFlyer, Meta Audience Network, Sentry and Yandex AppMetrica — are now named in §2, as are the Play Install Referrer, the installed-app query and the Privacy Sandbox permissions. §1a now lists everything the apps actually store, including the coin ledger and the record of which ads you were shown. Backup and cloud save differ between the two games and are now shown per game rather than claimed for both. Audio and podcast apps are no longer described: none exist.","p.changed.title":"What changed in this revision","p.hero.chip.billing":"Google Play Billing","p.hero.chip.gdpr":"GDPR / CCPA / COPPA aware","p.hero.chip.updated":"Last updated","p.hero.eyebrow":"Plain-language summary, full legal text below","p.hero.lede":"How Vaslix Games handles information across our Android apps. The policy applies the same way to everything we release. No accounts, no servers of our own, no nonsense. <strong>It covers Gridlix:2048 and Blocklix, both live on Google Play — and §1 shows where the two differ.</strong>","p.hero.title":"Privacy Policy","p.sec1.backup":"<strong>Android’s own backup is enabled in Blocklix and switched off in Gridlix:2048</strong> — the table above says which is which. Where it is on, and where backup is on for your device, Android copies the local data listed in 1a into your personal Google account and restores it when you reinstall on the same account. That copy belongs to you: Android handles and encrypts it, and we can neither read it nor delete it. You control it in <em>Android Settings → Google → Backup</em>. Separately, both games have a cloud save built on Google Play Games Saved Games: one save file in your own Play Games storage, so progress can follow you between devices. It never runs without a Play Games sign-in, it carries game progress only — never subscription state or purchase data — and it is served by Google, not by a server of ours. In Blocklix it ships switched off and is being enabled gradually. In Gridlix:2048 it syncs whenever you are signed in to Play Games; that app has no sign-out of its own, so stopping it means signing out of Play Games from the Google Play Games app. Gridlix:2048 also unlocks Play Games achievements and submits your scores to two Play Games leaderboards.","p.sec1.body1a":"Each app stores the following in a local Room/SQLite database (or an equivalent local store) on your device. We never upload it to a server of ours; where Android’s own backup is enabled for the app, it may copy this into your personal Google account, as described in 1d:","p.sec1.body1b":"The third-party services described below may collect technical and advertising-related information automatically:","p.sec1.callout":"<strong>What is not stored locally:</strong> payment details, purchase tokens, and Google account identifiers. None of this leaves Google Play.","p.sec1.deviceIdCallout":"<strong>Why we disclose this:</strong> Google Play's Data safety form requires every read of the Advertising ID and the Android device ID to be declared, regardless of whether the value leaves your device. You can reset the Advertising ID at any time from <em>Android Settings → Privacy → Ads</em>, and the Android ID is regenerated when you factory-reset the device.","p.sec1.firebase":"Both apps include <strong>Google Firebase Analytics</strong> and <strong>Firebase Crashlytics</strong>; Blocklix also includes <strong>Firebase Remote Config</strong>. Analytics collects a random app-instance ID, device and OS information, and aggregated in-app events — a game finished, a purchase completed, an ad shown, together with the revenue and network name reported for that impression — so we can understand overall usage and balance the game economy. We do not use it to build advertising profiles. Remote Config downloads a small set of feature flags and game-balance numbers and sends no personal data beyond the technical request metadata. Crashlytics sends a report when the app crashes or freezes: the stack trace, the device model, the OS and app version, and a random installation identifier — enough to find the bug, and nothing you typed or played. Crashlytics is not the only error reporter present in the builds; see §2. Details: <a href=\"https://firebase.google.com/support/privacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">firebase.google.com/support/privacy ↗</a>.","p.sec1.h3a":"1a. Stored locally on your device","p.sec1.h3b":"1b. Collected by third parties on our behalf","p.sec1.h3c":"1c. Analytics, crash reports and remote configuration (Google Firebase)","p.sec1.h3d":"1d. Backup and cloud save","p.sec1.intro":"Our apps do not require account creation and we do not knowingly collect personal information directly. Information falls into two groups.","p.sec1.list1a.1":"App-specific state: the board as you left it, your score, boosters and continues","p.sec1.list1a.2":"Your best-game history and best score, kept as a local-only record","p.sec1.list1a.3":"App settings: sound on or off, haptics on or off, theme, notifications, and similar per-app preferences","p.sec1.list1a.4":"A first-launch flag, used to send you through the onboarding the first time you open the app","p.sec1.list1a.5":"A cached summary of your subscription status — active or not, which plan, the product ID, whether the free trial has been used, and when it expires — so the app applies your entitlement at launch without waiting for the network","p.sec1.list1a.6":"Your progress and in-game economy: the coin balance and the full ledger of coin transactions, daily and weekly missions, achievements, rank progress, play streaks, unlocked themes and cosmetics, difficulty progress, each day’s Daily result and the monthly medals","p.sec1.list1a.7":"A record of the ads you were shown — which type, when, and the daily counters that pace them — and, in Gridlix:2048, the hours of the day you usually play, so a reminder notification arrives at a plausible time rather than at random","p.sec1.list1b.1":"Google Advertising ID (GAID) — read so ad networks can deliver ads, frequency-cap them, and attribute installs. While Premium or Remove Ads is active it is not used for banner, interstitial or app-open advertising; it is still processed when you explicitly choose to watch a rewarded video.","p.sec1.list1b.2":"Device-scoped identifiers, including the Android device ID (SSAID). Our own code reads neither this nor the Advertising ID; both may be read inside the advertising SDKs described in §2, for delivery, frequency capping and invalid-traffic signals. They play no part in your subscription — that entitlement comes from Google Play Billing directly.","p.sec1.list1b.3":"IP address and approximate geographic location derived from it","p.sec1.list1b.4":"Device model, operating system version, language, and time zone","p.sec1.list1b.5":"App version, session timestamps, and crash diagnostics","p.sec1.list1b.6":"Aggregated, non-personally-identifying usage events, used only in aggregate form","p.sec1.list1b.7":"The Play Install Referrer — how you arrived at the app’s store listing — read so an install can be attributed to the campaign that produced it","p.sec1.list1b.8":"The list of apps installed on your device that can be launched, and checks for a small set of known root-management packages. Neither is read by our code: both come from advertising SDKs bundled with the mediation, which use them for targeting and for device-integrity signals.","p.sec1.list1b.9":"Android Privacy Sandbox signals — Topics, Attribution Reporting, Protected Audience and the Ad ID service. The apps declare permissions for these so the advertising SDKs can use interest and attribution data supplied by the operating system rather than assembled by us.","p.sec1.title":"Information we collect","p.sec10.body":"For privacy questions about any of our apps, write to us at <a href=\"mailto:vaslixofficial@protonmail.com\">vaslixofficial@protonmail.com</a>. We try to reply within a reasonable time.","p.sec10.title":"Contact","p.sec2.appodeal1":"We use <a href=\"https://www.appodeal.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Appodeal</a> as our primary advertising mediation partner. Appodeal's privacy policy is at <a href=\"https://www.appodeal.com/privacy-policy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">appodeal.com/privacy-policy ↗</a>.","p.sec2.appodeal2":"Appodeal mediates demand from a large number of advertising networks, and the active set evolves as Appodeal updates its SDK and as we change our build configuration. The current, authoritative list is published by Appodeal:","p.sec2.appodeal3":"Each network on that page links to its own privacy policy. Privacy questions specific to ad personalisation can be raised directly with Appodeal at the same site.","p.sec2.bundled":"The Appodeal package bundles more than ad networks. The components below are compiled into our release builds, register their own services and receivers, and are started by Appodeal rather than by our code — we neither call them nor configure them. Google Play’s Data safety form asks what is collected, not who initialised it, so they are named here in full:","p.sec2.bundledList.1":"<a href=\"https://www.adjust.com/terms/privacy-policy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Adjust ↗</a> — install attribution","p.sec2.bundledList.2":"<a href=\"https://www.appsflyer.com/legal/services-privacy-policy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">AppsFlyer ↗</a> — install attribution, with its own install-referrer receiver","p.sec2.bundledList.3":"<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/privacy/policy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Meta Audience Network ↗</a> — advertising demand and measurement","p.sec2.bundledList.4":"<a href=\"https://sentry.io/privacy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sentry ↗</a> — error and crash reporting, sent to Appodeal’s project rather than to one of ours. It is a second crash reporter alongside Firebase Crashlytics (§1c).","p.sec2.bundledList.5":"<a href=\"https://yandex.com/legal/confidential/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yandex AppMetrica ↗</a> — analytics, arriving with the Yandex advertising adapter","p.sec2.callout":"<strong>Premium subscribers — and, in Blocklix, anyone who bought Remove Ads — are not shown banner, interstitial or app-open ads.</strong> Rewarded videos are never forced on anyone: free or paying, they start only from an explicit tap on a watch-to-earn offer. Limited initialisation traffic to the ad providers still occurs when the app starts, before your entitlement has been resolved.","p.sec2.h3a":"Appodeal mediation","p.sec2.h3c":"What ships inside the mediation SDK","p.sec2.intro":"Our apps display banner ads, occasional interstitial ads, and rewarded video ads that you explicitly choose to watch in exchange for an in-game perk — a booster, a continue after game-over, bonus coins and similar. Blocklix also shows app-open ads when you come back to it; Gridlix:2048 does not. A Premium subscription turns off banner, interstitial and app-open ads in both games, and in Blocklix the one-time Remove Ads purchase does the same. Rewarded videos stay available to everyone and only ever play after you tap their offer.","p.sec2.title":"Advertising partners","p.sec3.intro":"Both apps offer an optional Premium subscription, sold and processed by Google through Google Play Billing. Blocklix offers weekly, monthly and yearly auto-renewing plans; Gridlix:2048 offers monthly and yearly. Eligible new subscribers get an introductory free trial on the yearly plan. Premium turns off banner, interstitial and app-open ads and unlocks premium features specific to that app — for example x2 coins and a daily gift. Blocklix also sells one-time products: coin packs, a starter bundle, a piggy-bank payout, and a permanent Remove Ads unlock with the same ad scope as Premium. Gridlix:2048 sells no one-time products at all.","p.sec3.list.1":"All payment, billing, account, and tax information is collected and processed by Google. We do not see, store, or transmit your payment method, your Google account email, or any government identifiers.","p.sec3.list.2":"The app receives only a non-identifying entitlement signal from Google: whether an active subscription exists for your installation, which product it is, and — in Blocklix — which one-time products have been purchased. This signal is cached locally as described in §1a.","p.sec3.list.3":"Subscription management, cancellation, refund requests, and renewal dates are handled entirely on Google Play. The \"Manage\" button inside the app deep-links to the Google Play subscriptions page.","p.sec3.list.4":"Google Play's privacy policy applies to all billing-related processing: <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">policies.google.com/privacy ↗</a>","p.sec3.title":"Subscriptions and in-app purchases (Google Play Billing)","p.sec4.body":"If you are located in the EEA, the UK, or Switzerland, the legal basis for advertising-related processing is your consent, collected through an IAB Transparency &amp; Consent Framework (TCF) dialog. That dialog is presented by the Appodeal mediation SDK itself, when your region requires one; we do not operate a consent platform of our own. You may withdraw or change your consent at any time. Blocklix can reopen the dialog from its in-app privacy settings; Gridlix:2048 has no such screen, so there the way is to clear the app’s data (Settings → Apps), which presents the consent dialog again on the next launch. The legal basis for processing subscription data via Google Play Billing is the performance of the contract you enter into when purchasing a subscription.","p.sec4.title":"Legal basis and consent (GDPR / EEA, UK, Switzerland)","p.sec5.body":"If you are a California resident, or in another applicable US state, you have the right to opt out of the \"sale\" or \"sharing\" of your personal information for behavioral advertising. The in-app consent dialog provides this opt-out where required. Subscription processing by Google Play is not a \"sale\" of personal information.","p.sec5.title":"CCPA / US state privacy laws","p.sec6.body":"Our apps are not directed at children under 13 (or the equivalent minimum age in your jurisdiction). We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. The Premium subscription is intended for adult purchasers; in-app purchases require a Google Play account with the appropriate purchase permissions.","p.sec6.title":"Children's privacy (COPPA)","p.sec7.body":"Locally stored data described in §1a is retained on your device until you clear the app’s data or uninstall the app. We do not retain personal information on our own servers. Where Android’s own backup is enabled — Blocklix, not Gridlix:2048 — the copy it makes lives in your own Google account and is removed under Android Settings → Google → Backup. A Play Games cloud save lives in your Play Games account and is removed from there. The advertising partners and Google Play retain data per their own policies.","p.sec7.title":"Data retention","p.sec8.body":"Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the right to access, correct, delete, restrict, or port your personal data, and to lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority. Because we do not directly hold this data, requests should be directed to the advertising partner concerned, or — for billing data — to Google Play.","p.sec8.callout":"To remove all locally stored data for either app, uninstall it or clear its storage from your device’s settings (<em>Settings → Apps → [the app] → Storage → Clear data</em>). That clears the copy on the device. A backup Android has already taken — Blocklix only — is removed under <em>Android Settings → Google → Backup</em>, and a Play Games cloud save from your Play Games account.","p.sec8.title":"Your rights","p.sec9.body":"We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time — for example when we add new titles, change advertising partners, or update subscription mechanics. The \"Last updated\" date at the top of the page indicates when the most recent change was made. Material changes will be reflected in-app on next launch.","p.sec9.title":"Changes to this policy","p.summary.1.desc":"Game state, settings, best scores, your coin balance and a cached premium flag. None of it reaches a server of ours. In Blocklix, Android’s own backup may copy it into your own Google account (§1d).","p.summary.1.title":"What stays on your device","p.summary.2.desc":"Payment details, your Google account email, account IDs, contacts, photos, or location beyond the IP-based estimate ad networks use.","p.summary.2.title":"What we never see","p.summary.3.desc":"Free players see banner and interstitial ads through Appodeal mediation, plus app-open ads in Blocklix. Premium — or, in Blocklix, the one-time Remove Ads purchase — turns those off. Rewarded videos are opt-in for everyone: they play only when you tap a watch-to-earn offer.","p.summary.3.title":"Ads vs Premium","p.summary.4.desc":"The advertising SDKs may read your Google Advertising ID and the Android device ID to serve and frequency-cap ads. Our own code reads neither, and neither has anything to do with your subscription. Both IDs are resettable in Android Settings.","p.summary.4.title":"Device identifiers","p.summary.heading":"The short version","p.table.cloud.onSignIn":"On once you sign in to Play Games","p.table.cloud.optional":"Optional, off by default","p.table.col.what":"Feature","p.table.fb.all":"Analytics, Crashlytics, Remote Config","p.table.fb.core":"Analytics, Crashlytics","p.table.intro":"This policy covers every app we publish, and the apps are not identical. Where they differ, they differ here — everything else in this document applies to both.","p.table.no":"No","p.table.oneTime.yes":"Coin packs, starter pack, piggy bank, Remove Ads","p.table.plans.2":"Monthly, yearly","p.table.plans.3":"Weekly, monthly, yearly","p.table.row.appOpen":"App-open ads","p.table.row.backup":"Android's own backup","p.table.row.cloudSave":"Play Games cloud save","p.table.row.firebase":"Google Firebase","p.table.row.oneTime":"One-time purchases","p.table.row.plans":"Subscription plans","p.table.row.settings":"Privacy settings inside the app","p.table.title":"What differs between our games","p.table.yes":"Yes","p.toc.1":"1. Information we collect","p.toc.10":"10. Contact","p.toc.2":"2. Advertising partners","p.toc.3":"3. Subscriptions & Play Billing","p.toc.4":"4. Legal basis (GDPR)","p.toc.5":"5. CCPA / US state laws","p.toc.6":"6. Children's privacy","p.toc.7":"7. Data retention","p.toc.8":"8. Your rights","p.toc.9":"9. Changes to this policy","p.toc.aria":"Table of contents","p.toc.title":"On this page","press.aboutBody":"Vaslix Games is an independent Android publisher founded in 2025. We build small, focused puzzle games with a privacy-first stance: no accounts, no proprietary servers storing user data, no in-house analytics. Two titles are live on Google Play: Gridlix:2048 and Blocklix, an 8×8 block puzzle with six difficulty levels, 38 themes and 60 ranks, localised into 12 languages.","press.aboutEyebrow":"Press kit","press.aboutTitle":"About the studio","press.assetBlocklix":"Blocklix icon","press.assetGridlix":"Gridlix:2048 icon","press.assetLockup":"Logotype","press.assetLockupDark":"Logotype, for dark backgrounds","press.assetMark":"Studio mark","press.assetsEyebrow":"Downloads","press.assetsIntro":"Icons and the logo exactly as they ship. Use them as they are — please do not recolour or crop them.","press.assetsTitle":"Brand assets","press.contactEyebrow":"Press kit","press.contactTitle":"Press contact","press.copied":"Copied","press.copyBtn":"Copy blurb","press.eyebrow":"Press kit","press.fact.contact":"Contact","press.fact.founded":"Founded","press.fact.langs":"Languages","press.fact.money":"Business model","press.fact.money.v":"Free with ads · optional Premium through Google Play Billing","press.fact.people":"Team","press.fact.platform":"Platform","press.fact.studio":"Studio","press.fact.titles":"Titles","press.factsEyebrow":"Fact sheet","press.factsTitle":"The numbers, already checked","press.lede":"Everything a writer needs, in one place and free to use.","press.sla":"A person answers, usually within five working days. Tell us your outlet, your deadline and what you need — that is enough to get a useful reply the first time.","press.title":"For press & partners","principles.eyebrow":"Principles","principles.intro":"They are cheaper to keep than to explain away, and they are the reason the apps stay small.","principles.title":"Four rules that do not move","privacy.eyebrow":"Your data","privacyCta.btn":"Read the policy","privacyCta.text":"Everything a game knows about you sits in your phone. The policy says exactly what that is, which ad networks load for a free player, and why every payment goes through Google rather than through us.","privacyCta.title":"We do not run a single server","road.eyebrow":"The long game","road.families":"The fifteen families","road.intro":"Everything below is earned by playing. Nothing here is sold.","road.missionsD":"Thirteen daily kinds that scale with your rank, two weekly ones, and a chest for the week you keep at it.","road.missionsT":"Daily and weekly missions","road.questsD":"Five steps each, from the first clear to the ones almost nobody reaches.","road.questsT":"21 achievement chains","road.ranksD":"Fifteen families of four. Points are your score, weighted by the difficulty you chose.","road.ranksT":"60 ranks","road.title":"A road, not a treadmill","roadmap.cta":"The whole roadmap","roadmap.eyebrow":"Roadmap","roadmap.intro":"Two shipped, one on paper. Nothing here starts moving until the thing before it is finished.","roadmap.note":"Dates are the one thing that will not be promised here. Order will.","roadmap.r1.desc":"Live on Google Play. A 4×4 merge puzzle with a Daily that is the same for everyone, monthly medals, five boosters and an optional ad-free Premium.","roadmap.r1.meta":"Shipped · 2026","roadmap.r1.title":"Gridlix:2048","roadmap.r2.desc":"Live on Google Play. An 8×8 drop-and-clear puzzle with six difficulty levels, 38 themes, 60 ranks, four boosters, daily and weekly missions, and an optional ad-free Premium.","roadmap.r2.meta":"Shipped · 2026","roadmap.r2.title":"Blocklix","roadmap.r3.desc":"A word puzzle, still on paper. The same shape as the other two: small, offline, no account, and a Premium that only removes the ads.","roadmap.r3.meta":"Later","roadmap.r3.title":"Wordlix","roadmap.title":"Where we're going","shelf.count.idea":"on paper","shelf.count.live":"on Google Play","shelf.count.open":"slots kept open","shelf.count.soon":"in the works","shelf.eyebrow":"The shelf","shelf.intro":"One panel per title, in the order they were built. The last panel is empty on purpose — the shelf is sized for what comes next, not for what is already on it.","shelf.more":"Open the page","shelf.next":"Next title","shelf.open.body":"When a title is ready it takes this slot, keeps the same frame, and pushes the empty one along. Nothing about the page has to change.","shelf.open.meta":"Not named yet","shelf.open.title":"The next one lands here","shelf.prev":"Previous title","shelf.railAria":"The studio shelf","shelf.title":"Two on the shelf. Room kept for more.","status.dev":"In the works","status.idea":"On paper","status.live":"On Google Play","status.open":"Empty slot","story.eyebrow":"The short version","story.p1":"Vaslix Games is one person. That is not a hardship story — it is the constraint that decides everything else. A studio of one cannot maintain a login system, a server fleet and a support desk, so it does not build them, and the games are better for it.","story.p2":"What is left is the part players actually touch: the board, the timing, the feel of a piece landing. Every hour that would have gone into an account flow goes into the difficulty curve instead.","story.p3":"The catalogue grows slowly and on purpose. A title ships when it is finished, gets updates for years, and never quietly turns into a service you have to log into.","story.title":"Why the apps stay small","themes.eyebrow":"38 themes","themes.free":"Free from install","themes.intro":"Four are yours from install. The rest are earned with stars or come with Premium — and each one changes the sky, the blocks and the way a cleared line lights up.","themes.tap":"Tap a theme to dress the board","themes.title":"Every board wears a palette","trust.1.desc":"Nothing to sign up for. Your progress never leaves the phone it was made on.","trust.1.title":"No accounts","trust.2.desc":"Google Play takes the payment. Your card never reaches us, because it never passes through us.","trust.2.title":"No payment data stored","trust.3.desc":"Consent before the first ad loads, an opt-out where the law asks for one, and a policy that names every company involved.","trust.3.title":"GDPR · CCPA · COPPA","trust.4.desc":"Premium switches off banners, interstitials and app-open ads. Rewarded videos stay available to everyone and start only when you tap one. That is the whole deal.","trust.4.title":"Premium removes ads"},"ru":{"about.eyebrow":"О студии","about.lede":"Один человек, две игры в Google Play, никакого офиса. <strong>Небольшие приложения, сделанные аккуратно, уважающие ваше устройство и ваше внимание.</strong> Никуда не нужно входить, ничего вашего нет на наших серверах, и нет инвестора, который спрашивает, почему монетизация такая тихая.","about.stats.apps":"выпущенных приложений","about.stats.langs":"поддерживаемых языков","about.stats.people":"человек в студии","about.stats.since":"выпускаем с","about.title":"Маленькая студия с длинным горизонтом","also.cta":"Вернуться на полку","also.eyebrow":"Ещё у студии","also.title":"Остальная полка","card.blocklix.desc":"Кладите фигуры на поле 8×8, очищайте линии и квадраты, собирайте комбо ради больших множителей. Шесть уровней сложности, 38 тем, 60 рангов и 21 цепочка достижений, четыре бустера, ежедневные и недельные задания со стрик-сундуком и гардероб косметики. Опциональный Premium без рекламы, с удвоением звёзд и ежедневным подарком.","card.blocklix.genre":"Пазл","card.gridlix.desc":"Головоломка-слияние 4×4 для Android. Ежедневная задача строится из даты, поэтому доска одна и та же у всех в мире и оценивается тремя звёздами; серия со щитами переживает пропущенный вечер, а закрытый месяц стоит медали. Пять бустеров по три применения за игру, пять цветовых тем, настроенная вибрация и Premium без рекламы — по желанию.","contact.btn":"Написать письмо","contact.eyebrow":"Контакт","contact.text":"Баги, идеи, вопросы прессы и предложения — всё приходит в один ящик. Если что-то упало, добавьте модель устройства и версию Android.","contact.title":"Напишите — ответит человек","cta.play":"Доступно в Google Play","diff.eyebrow":"Шесть уровней сложности","diff.intro":"Меняется только генератор фигур. Счёт, доска и ранги одинаковы на каждой ступени — «сложнее» значит лишь, что фигуры перестают вам помогать.","diff.note":"Верхние ступени платят больше звёзд за очко. Лёгкая платит меньше и не делает вид, что иначе.","diff.title":"Выберите длину партии","f.boosters":"бустеров","f.daily":"оценка дейли","f.difficulties":"сложностей","f.languages":"языков","f.ranks":"рангов","f.themes":"тем","faq.a1":"Отменить можно в <strong>Google Play → Подписки</strong> или через кнопку «Управление» внутри приложения — она ведёт на ту же страницу. Отмена вступает в силу в конце текущего периода оплаты.","faq.a2":"Прогресс живёт на устройстве. В Blocklix собственный бэкап Android копирует его в ваш аккаунт Google, поэтому переустановка на том же аккаунте обычно всё возвращает; в Gridlix:2048 этот бэкап выключен, и там сохранение теряется при удалении — если не пользоваться облачным сохранением Play Games. На свои серверы мы сохранения не выгружаем. Premium восстанавливается сам, когда вы переустановите игру и войдёте в тот же аккаунт Google.","faq.a3":"Не мы. Наш собственный код его не трогает — читают рекламные SDK внутри приложения, чтобы ограничивать частоту показов и атрибутировать установки. С Premium (а в Blocklix — и с покупкой «Без рекламы») он больше не используется для баннеров, межстраничных и app-open объявлений; он всё ещё обрабатывается, если вы сами решите посмотреть видео за награду. В <a href=\"./privacy-policy.html\">Политике конфиденциальности</a> названы все SDK, которые его читают.","faq.a4":"Android 8.0 (API 26) и выше. Это намеренно: телефон, дважды перешедший по наследству, должен их тянуть.","faq.a5":"Blocklix выходит на 12 языках: английский, русский, немецкий, испанский, французский, итальянский, японский, корейский, португальский (Бразилия), турецкий, арабский и упрощённый китайский. У Gridlix:2048 набор меньше. Системный язык определяется при первом запуске и переключается в настройках приложения.","faq.a6":"Пишите на <a href=\"mailto:vaslixofficial@protonmail.com\">vaslixofficial@protonmail.com</a> с коротким описанием. Скриншоты и модель устройства сильно помогают. Мы читаем каждое сообщение.","faq.a7":"В планах нет. Один человек может годами обновлять две Android-игры; две платформы означали бы, что ни одна такого не получит. Если каталог вырастет настолько, что арифметика изменится, здесь об этом напишут.","faq.a8":"Нет. Premium убирает баннеры и межстраничную рекламу, удваивает звёзды за партию и добавляет ежедневный подарок и премиум-темы. Уровни, ранги и задания одинаковы у всех.","faq.eyebrow":"FAQ","faq.q1":"Как отменить подписку?","faq.q2":"Что будет с прогрессом, если я удалю приложение?","faq.q3":"Кто читает Advertising ID?","faq.q4":"Какие версии Android поддерживаются?","faq.q5":"Какие языки поддерживаются?","faq.q6":"Нашёл баг или хочу предложить функцию.","faq.q7":"Будет ли версия для iOS?","faq.q8":"Меняет ли Premium саму игру?","faq.title":"Частые вопросы","footer.builtWith":"HTML написан руками. Трекеров на сайте нет.","footer.contactTitle":"Контакт","footer.copyright":"© Vaslix Games · Независимая Android-студия","footer.games":"Игры","footer.gamesAria":"Игры","footer.made":"Сделано в одной комнате, играется на двенадцати языках.","footer.privacyLink":"Политика конфиденциальности","footer.replyTime":"Обычно отвечаем в течение пяти рабочих дней.","footer.studio":"Студия","footer.studioAria":"Ссылки студии","g.blocklix.blurb":"Кладите фигуры на поле 8×8, очищайте линии и квадраты, собирайте комбо ради больших множителей. Шесть уровней сложности, 38 тем, 60 рангов и 21 цепочка достижений, четыре бустера, ежедневные и недельные задания со стрик-сундуком и гардероб косметики. Опциональный Premium без рекламы, с удвоением звёзд и ежедневным подарком.","g.blocklix.boosters.eyebrow":"Бустеры","g.blocklix.boosters.intro":"Каждый покупается за звёзды, заработанные игрой. Ни один нельзя купить за деньги отдельно.","g.blocklix.boosters.note":"Звёзды приходят из сыгранных партий, миссий и рангов. Premium удваивает выплату за партию, но не продаёт бустеры напрямую.","g.blocklix.boosters.title":"Четыре выхода из плохой доски","g.blocklix.chip.1":"Доска 8×8","g.blocklix.chip.2":"Играет офлайн","g.blocklix.chip.3":"Без аккаунта","g.blocklix.difficulty.eyebrow":"Шесть уровней сложности","g.blocklix.difficulty.intro":"Меняется только генератор фигур. Счёт, доска и ранги одинаковы на каждой ступени — «сложнее» значит лишь, что фигуры перестают вам помогать.","g.blocklix.difficulty.note":"Верхние ступени платят больше звёзд за очко. Лёгкая платит меньше и не делает вид, что иначе.","g.blocklix.difficulty.title":"Выберите длину партии","g.blocklix.genre":"Пазл","g.blocklix.how.1.d":"Три фигуры за раз. Любая встаёт куда влезет; ничего не вращается и не падает.","g.blocklix.how.1.t":"Положи","g.blocklix.how.2.d":"Заполните строку или столбец — они исчезнут. Заполните оба сразу — доска сама об этом скажет.","g.blocklix.how.2.t":"Очисти","g.blocklix.how.3.d":"Очищайте ход за ходом — множитель растёт. Один тихий тик предупреждает, что линия вот-вот уйдёт.","g.blocklix.how.3.t":"Комбо","g.blocklix.how.eyebrow":"Как играется","g.blocklix.how.intro":"Blocklix — та самая головоломка 8×8 «положи и очисти», доведённая до состояния, когда каждый из этих трёх ходов ложится в руку.","g.blocklix.how.title":"Три хода, которые вы уже знаете","g.blocklix.openAria":"Открыть страницу Blocklix","g.blocklix.palettes.eyebrow":"38 тем","g.blocklix.palettes.free":"Бесплатно с установки","g.blocklix.palettes.intro":"Четыре ваши с установки. Остальные зарабатываются звёздами или приходят с Premium — и каждая меняет небо, блоки и то, как вспыхивает собранная линия.","g.blocklix.palettes.tap":"Нажмите на тему — доска переоденется","g.blocklix.palettes.title":"У каждой доски своя палитра","g.blocklix.playAria":"Blocklix в Google Play","g.blocklix.premium.1":"Баннеры, межстраничная реклама и реклама при запуске выключаются","g.blocklix.premium.2":"Партия платит вдвое больше звёзд","g.blocklix.premium.3":"Ежедневный подарок и премиальные темы","g.blocklix.premium.4":"Все сложности, ранги и миссии остаются ровно теми же","g.blocklix.premium.eyebrow":"Premium","g.blocklix.premium.intro":"Premium убирает то, что мешает, и ускоряет то, что вы и так зарабатываете. Он не открывает ни уровень, ни ранг, ни миссию.","g.blocklix.premium.note":"Ролики за награду остаются добровольными для всех: они играют, только если нажать кнопку, которая их просит.","g.blocklix.premium.title":"Что меняют деньги — и чего они не трогают","g.blocklix.progress.eyebrow":"Долгая игра","g.blocklix.progress.families":"Пятнадцать семейств","g.blocklix.progress.intro":"Всё ниже зарабатывается игрой. Ничего из этого не продаётся.","g.blocklix.progress.missions.d":"Тринадцать видов дневных, растущих с вашим рангом, два недельных и сундук за неделю без пропусков.","g.blocklix.progress.missions.t":"Ежедневные и недельные задания","g.blocklix.progress.quests.d":"По пять шагов в каждой: от первой очищенной линии до тех, куда почти никто не доходит.","g.blocklix.progress.quests.t":"21 цепочка достижений","g.blocklix.progress.ranks.d":"Пятнадцать семейств по четыре ступени. Очки — ваш счёт, взвешенный выбранной сложностью.","g.blocklix.progress.ranks.t":"60 рангов","g.blocklix.progress.title":"Дорога, а не беговая дорожка","g.blocklix.tagline":"Кладёшь три фигуры, линия исчезает, комбо не должно оборваться.","g.gridlix.blurb":"Головоломка-слияние 4×4 для Android. Ежедневная задача строится из даты, поэтому доска одна и та же у всех в мире и оценивается тремя звёздами; серия со щитами переживает пропущенный вечер, а закрытый месяц стоит медали. Пять бустеров по три применения за игру, пять цветовых тем, настроенная вибрация и Premium без рекламы — по желанию.","g.gridlix.boosters.delete.d":"Убирает одну плитку, на которую вы указали.","g.gridlix.boosters.eyebrow":"Бустеры","g.gridlix.boosters.intro":"Лимит на партию, а не на день: бустер — решение внутри забега, а не ресурс, который копят.","g.gridlix.boosters.note":"Бесплатному игроку каждое применение оплачивается роликом, который он сам решает посмотреть; Premium пропускает и ролик, и счётчик. Не тронуть ни одного — третья звезда дейли.","g.gridlix.boosters.shuffle.d":"Перемешивает то, что уже стоит, ничего не добавляя.","g.gridlix.boosters.swap.d":"Меняет местами две плитки.","g.gridlix.boosters.title":"Пять штук, по три применения","g.gridlix.boosters.undo.d":"Отменяет последний ход вместе с появившейся плиткой.","g.gridlix.boosters.value_clear.d":"Сметает с доски все плитки одного номинала.","g.gridlix.chip.1":"Доска 4×4","g.gridlix.chip.2":"Дейли и endless","g.gridlix.chip.3":"Виджет на экране","g.gridlix.daily.eyebrow":"Ежедневная","g.gridlix.daily.intro":"Сид из даты строит стартовую позицию и весь поток новых плиток, поэтому доска перед вами — ровно та же, что у всех остальных.","g.gridlix.daily.seed.d":"Начало заранее разыгрывает скриптовый бот, и число его ходов задаёт par, по которому вас меряют. Попыток в день несколько, зачитывается лучшая.","g.gridlix.daily.seed.t":"Один сид — одна доска","g.gridlix.daily.star.1":"Дойти до целевой плитки в пределах лимита ходов.","g.gridlix.daily.star.2":"Сделать это в пределах par — числа ходов самого бота.","g.gridlix.daily.star.3":"В пределах par и ни одного бустера за всю партию.","g.gridlix.daily.title":"Та же задача, что у всех","g.gridlix.genre":"Пазл","g.gridlix.how.1.d":"Одно направление двигает сразу все плитки. Половинчатых ходов нет.","g.gridlix.how.1.t":"Свайп","g.gridlix.how.2.d":"Две одинаковые соприкоснувшиеся плитки становятся одной, вдвое больше. За ход плитка сливается один раз.","g.gridlix.how.2.t":"Слияние","g.gridlix.how.3.d":"В endless цель — собственный рекорд. В дейли — заданная плитка за заданное число ходов.","g.gridlix.how.3.t":"Дойти до цели","g.gridlix.how.eyebrow":"Как играется","g.gridlix.how.intro":"Учить тут нечего, кроме свайпа. Дальше — только арифметика и выдержка.","g.gridlix.how.title":"Один жест — и до самого конца","g.gridlix.month.eyebrow":"Месяц","g.gridlix.month.intro":"Один пропущенный вечер не должен стирать четыре месяца. Щит гасит пропуск, а календарь держит месяц целиком перед глазами.","g.gridlix.month.legend.done":"Сыграно","g.gridlix.month.legend.miss":"Пропущено","g.gridlix.month.legend.shield":"Под щитом","g.gridlix.month.medals.d":"Месяц закрывается, оценивается один раз, остаётся навсегда и висит в шкафу трофеев рядом с лучшей серией.","g.gridlix.month.medals.t":"Медали за месяц","g.gridlix.month.streak.d":"Щит тратится автоматически в день пропуска, а зарабатывается игрой. Серия переживает обычную неудачную неделю.","g.gridlix.month.streak.t":"Щиты","g.gridlix.month.title":"Серия, которую реально удержать","g.gridlix.openAria":"Открыть страницу Gridlix:2048","g.gridlix.playAria":"Gridlix:2048 в Google Play","g.gridlix.premium.1":"Никаких баннеров и межстраничной рекламы нигде","g.gridlix.premium.2":"Бустеры без просмотра ролика","g.gridlix.premium.3":"Продолжения, когда доска заполнилась","g.gridlix.premium.4":"Открываются четыре закрытые палитры","g.gridlix.premium.eyebrow":"Premium","g.gridlix.premium.intro":"Подписка через Google Play — месячная или годовая, у годовой есть бесплатный пробный период. Отменяется в Play в любой момент.","g.gridlix.premium.note":"Дейли, её звёзды, серия и медали работают одинаково — платите вы или нет.","g.gridlix.premium.title":"Играть без пауз на рекламу","g.gridlix.tagline":"Одна доска, одна ежедневная задача — одна на всех.","g.gridlix.themes.eyebrow":"Палитры","g.gridlix.themes.free":"Бесплатно","g.gridlix.themes.intro":"Палитра меняет плитки, акцент и свечение — но не правила. Это настоящие цвета, прямо из приложения.","g.gridlix.themes.premium":"Premium","g.gridlix.themes.title":"Пять палитр, одна доска","g.words.chip.1":"Слова","g.words.chip.2":"Прототип","g.words.tagline":"Словесная головоломка, пока на бумаге. Та же форма: маленькая, тихая, офлайн.","g.words.when":"Даты пока нет","gd.blocklix.booster.bomb.desc":"Мгновенно сносит зону 3×3","gd.blocklix.booster.bomb.name":"Бомба","gd.blocklix.booster.hammer.desc":"Разбивает один любой блок на поле","gd.blocklix.booster.hammer.name":"Молот","gd.blocklix.booster.lightning.desc":"Выжигает целый ряд и столбец одним ударом","gd.blocklix.booster.lightning.name":"Молния","gd.blocklix.booster.shuffle.desc":"Меняет фигуры на три новые","gd.blocklix.booster.shuffle.name":"Перемешать","gd.blocklix.diff.easy.desc":"Долгие спокойные игры. Звёзд поменьше.","gd.blocklix.diff.easy.name":"Легко","gd.blocklix.diff.expert.desc":"Каждый набор фигур — задачка.","gd.blocklix.diff.expert.name":"Эксперт","gd.blocklix.diff.hard.desc":"Крупные фигуры приходят раньше","gd.blocklix.diff.hard.name":"Сложно","gd.blocklix.diff.insane.desc":"Никаких поблажек: фигура может и не подойти.","gd.blocklix.diff.insane.name":"Безумие","gd.blocklix.diff.master.desc":"Только для самых цепких. Лёгких фигур не будет.","gd.blocklix.diff.master.name":"Мастер","gd.blocklix.diff.normal.desc":"Классический темп: минут десять","gd.blocklix.diff.normal.name":"Нормально","gd.blocklix.rank.bronze":"Бронза","gd.blocklix.rank.celestial":"Небесный","gd.blocklix.rank.cosmic":"Космический","gd.blocklix.rank.diamond":"Алмаз","gd.blocklix.rank.emerald":"Изумруд","gd.blocklix.rank.eternal":"Вечный","gd.blocklix.rank.gold":"Золото","gd.blocklix.rank.grandmaster":"Грандмастер","gd.blocklix.rank.legend":"Легенда","gd.blocklix.rank.master":"Мастер","gd.blocklix.rank.mythic":"Мифический","gd.blocklix.rank.platinum":"Платина","gd.blocklix.rank.ruby":"Рубин","gd.blocklix.rank.silver":"Серебро","gd.blocklix.rank.stone":"Камень","gd.gridlix.booster.delete.name":"Удалить","gd.gridlix.booster.shuffle.name":"Перемешать","gd.gridlix.booster.swap.name":"Обмен","gd.gridlix.booster.undo.name":"Отмена","gd.gridlix.booster.value_clear.name":"Очистка","gd.gridlix.medal.bronze":"Бронза","gd.gridlix.medal.gold":"Золото","gd.gridlix.medal.silver":"Серебро","gp.back":"Все игры","hero.cta.games":"Наши игры","hero.cta.studio":"О студии","hero.kick":"Независимая Android-студия","hero.lede":"Две головоломки, сделанные одним человеком. Без аккаунтов, без своих серверов, двенадцать языков — и Premium, который делает ровно одно: убирает рекламу.","hero.scroll":"Листайте","hero.t1":"Маленькие игры.","hero.t2":"Надолго.","how.eyebrow":"Как играется","how.intro":"Blocklix — та самая головоломка 8×8 «положи и очисти», доведённая до состояния, когда каждый из этих трёх ходов ложится в руку.","how.s1d":"Три фигуры за раз. Любая встаёт куда влезет; ничего не вращается и не падает.","how.s1t":"Положи","how.s2d":"Заполните строку или столбец — они исчезнут. Заполните оба сразу — доска сама об этом скажет.","how.s2t":"Очисти","how.s3d":"Очищайте ход за ходом — множитель растёт. Один тихий тик предупреждает, что линия вот-вот уйдёт.","how.s3t":"Комбо","how.title":"Три хода, которые вы уже знаете","meta.blocklix.desc":"Кладите три фигуры на поле 8×8, очищайте ряды и столбцы, собирайте комбо. 38 тем, 60 рангов, шесть сложностей, двенадцать языков. Без аккаунтов.","meta.blocklix.title":"Blocklix — головоломка 8×8: клади и очищай | Vaslix Games","meta.description":"Vaslix Games — независимая Android-студия, выпускающая компактные, сфокусированные головоломки. Gridlix:2048 и Blocklix уже доступны в Google Play.","meta.gridlix.desc":"Головоломка 4×4 со слиянием: ежедневная задача с общим сидом одинакова для всех, щиты серии, медали за месяц и пять бустеров. Endless не кончается.","meta.gridlix.title":"Gridlix:2048 — одна ежедневная задача на всех | Vaslix Games","meta.home.desc":"Vaslix Games — независимая Android-студия, выпускающая компактные, сфокусированные головоломки. Gridlix:2048 и Blocklix уже доступны в Google Play.","meta.home.title":"Vaslix Games — маленькие Android-головоломки, сделанные надолго","meta.notFound.desc":"Такого адреса нет. А полка есть.","meta.notFound.title":"Страница не найдена — Vaslix Games","meta.press.desc":"Описание, лист фактов, иконки и контакт для журналистов и партнёров. Отвечаем примерно за пять рабочих дней.","meta.press.title":"Пресс-кит — Vaslix Games","meta.privacy.desc":"Как Vaslix Games обращается с данными в Gridlix:2048 и Blocklix. Краткое объяснение, полный текст, что хранит каждая игра, и заметки по GDPR/CCPA/COPPA.","meta.privacy.title":"Политика конфиденциальности — Vaslix Games","meta.studio.desc":"Один человек, маленькие Android-приложения, без аккаунтов и без своих серверов. Что мы делаем, каких правил держимся и что дальше.","meta.studio.title":"Студия — Vaslix Games","meta.title":"Vaslix Games — маленькие Android-головоломки, сделанные надолго","nav.aria":"Основная навигация","nav.brand":"Vaslix Games","nav.games":"Игры","nav.langLabel":"Сменить язык","nav.menu":"Меню","nav.press":"Пресса","nav.privacy":"Приватность","nav.skip":"Перейти к содержимому","nav.studio":"Студия","nav.theme.auto":"Включить автотему","nav.theme.dark":"Включить тёмную тему","nav.theme.light":"Включить светлую тему","nf.body":"Адрес никуда не ведёт. Полка, впрочем, там же, где вы её оставили.","nf.eyebrow":"404","nf.games":"Смотреть полку","nf.home":"На главную","nf.title":"Эта клетка пустая","nums.accounts":"аккаунтов нужно","nums.games":"игры в Google Play","nums.langs":"языков","nums.person":"человек","nums.servers":"своих серверов","nums.since":"выпускаем с","nums.title":"Студия в цифрах","p.changed.body":"Мы сверили политику с исходным кодом обоих приложений и исправили расхождения. Google AdMob больше не упоминается: его нет ни в одном приложении. Утверждение, что Android ID устройства считывается для проверки подписки, было неверным и удалено. Рекламные SDK, приезжающие в составе медиации Appodeal — Adjust, AppsFlyer, Meta Audience Network, Sentry и Yandex AppMetrica, — теперь названы в §2, как и Play Install Referrer, запрос списка установленных приложений и разрешения Privacy Sandbox. В §1a перечислено всё, что приложения действительно хранят, включая журнал монет и запись о показанной вам рекламе. Бэкап и облачное сохранение у двух игр устроены по-разному и теперь показаны по каждой игре, а не заявлены для обеих. Аудио- и подкаст-приложения больше не описываются: их не существует.","p.changed.title":"Что изменилось в этой редакции","p.hero.chip.billing":"Google Play Billing","p.hero.chip.gdpr":"С учётом GDPR / CCPA / COPPA","p.hero.chip.updated":"Обновлено","p.hero.eyebrow":"Краткое объяснение простым языком, полный юридический текст ниже","p.hero.lede":"Как Vaslix Games обращается с информацией в наших Android-приложениях. Политика одинаково применяется ко всему, что мы выпускаем. Без аккаунтов, без своих серверов, без сюрпризов. <strong>Она распространяется на Gridlix:2048 и Blocklix — обе доступны в Google Play, а в §1 видно, чем они отличаются.</strong>","p.hero.title":"Политика конфиденциальности","p.sec1.backup":"<strong>Собственный бэкап Android включён в Blocklix и выключен в Gridlix:2048</strong> — в таблице выше видно, где как. Там, где он включён, и если резервное копирование включено на вашем устройстве, Android копирует перечисленные в 1a локальные данные в ваш личный аккаунт Google и восстанавливает их при переустановке на том же аккаунте. Эта копия принадлежит вам: ею распоряжается и её шифрует Android, мы не можем ни прочитать её, ни удалить. Управление — в <em>Настройках Android → Google → Резервное копирование</em>. Отдельно: у обеих игр есть облачное сохранение на Google Play Games Saved Games — один файл в вашем хранилище Play Games, чтобы прогресс переезжал между устройствами. Оно не работает без входа в Play Games, несёт только игровой прогресс — никогда статус подписки или данные о покупках — и обслуживается Google, а не нашим сервером. В Blocklix оно поставляется выключенным и включается постепенно. В Gridlix:2048 оно синхронизируется всякий раз, когда вы вошли в Play Games; собственного выхода в этом приложении нет, поэтому остановить синхронизацию можно, выйдя из Play Games в приложении Google Play Игры. Gridlix:2048 также открывает достижения Play Games и отправляет ваши результаты в две таблицы лидеров Play Games.","p.sec1.body1a":"Каждое приложение хранит перечисленное ниже в локальной базе Room/SQLite (или эквивалентном локальном хранилище) на вашем устройстве. Мы не выгружаем это ни на один свой сервер; там, где для приложения включён собственный бэкап Android, эти данные могут попасть в ваш личный аккаунт Google — см. 1d:","p.sec1.body1b":"Указанные ниже сторонние сервисы могут автоматически собирать технические и рекламные данные:","p.sec1.callout":"<strong>Что локально не хранится:</strong> платёжные данные, токены покупки и идентификаторы Google-аккаунта. Эта информация не покидает Google Play.","p.sec1.deviceIdCallout":"<strong>Почему мы это раскрываем:</strong> форма Google Play «Безопасность данных» требует декларировать любое чтение Advertising ID и Android ID устройства, независимо от того, покидает ли значение устройство. Advertising ID можно сбросить в любой момент в <em>Настройки Android → Конфиденциальность → Реклама</em>; Android ID пересоздаётся при сбросе устройства к заводским настройкам.","p.sec1.firebase":"Оба приложения включают <strong>Google Firebase Analytics</strong> и <strong>Firebase Crashlytics</strong>; в Blocklix есть ещё <strong>Firebase Remote Config</strong>. Analytics собирает случайный идентификатор экземпляра приложения, сведения об устройстве и ОС и агрегированные внутриигровые события — игра завершена, покупка совершена, реклама показана, вместе с доходом и именем сети по этому показу, — чтобы мы понимали общее использование и балансировали игровую экономику. Для построения рекламных профилей мы это не используем. Remote Config скачивает небольшой набор флагов и чисел игрового баланса и не отправляет персональных данных сверх технических метаданных запроса. Crashlytics присылает отчёт, когда приложение падает или зависает: стек вызовов, модель устройства, версии ОС и приложения и случайный идентификатор установки — достаточно, чтобы найти ошибку, и ничего из того, что вы вводили или играли. Crashlytics — не единственный сборщик ошибок в сборках; см. §2. Подробности: <a href=\"https://firebase.google.com/support/privacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">firebase.google.com/support/privacy ↗</a>.","p.sec1.h3a":"1a. Хранится локально на вашем устройстве","p.sec1.h3b":"1b. Собирается третьими сторонами от нашего имени","p.sec1.h3c":"1c. Аналитика, отчёты о сбоях и удалённая конфигурация (Google Firebase)","p.sec1.h3d":"1d. Резервное копирование и облачное сохранение","p.sec1.intro":"Наши приложения не требуют создания аккаунта, и мы не собираем персональные данные напрямую. Информация делится на две группы.","p.sec1.list1a.1":"Состояние приложения: доска в том виде, в каком вы её оставили, счёт, бустеры и продолжения","p.sec1.list1a.2":"История лучших игр и лучший результат — только локально","p.sec1.list1a.3":"Настройки приложения: звук вкл/выкл, вибрация вкл/выкл, тема, уведомления и подобные предпочтения","p.sec1.list1a.4":"Флаг первого запуска — по нему приложение проводит вас через онбординг при первом открытии","p.sec1.list1a.5":"Кэшированная сводка статуса подписки: активна или нет, какой план, ID продукта, был ли использован пробный период и когда истекает срок — чтобы приложение применило ваши права сразу при запуске, не дожидаясь сети","p.sec1.list1a.6":"Прогресс и внутриигровая экономика: баланс монет и полный журнал операций с ними, ежедневные и недельные миссии, достижения, прогресс рангов, серии игр, открытые темы и косметика, прогресс по сложностям, результат каждого дейли и медали за месяц","p.sec1.list1a.7":"Запись о показанной вам рекламе: какого типа, когда, и дневные счётчики, задающие её частоту; а в Gridlix:2048 — часы, в которые вы обычно играете, чтобы напоминание приходило в правдоподобное время, а не наугад","p.sec1.list1b.1":"Google Advertising ID (GAID) — считывается, чтобы рекламные сети могли показывать рекламу, ограничивать её частоту и атрибутировать установки. При активном Premium или «Без рекламы» он не используется для баннеров, межстраничных и app-open объявлений, но обрабатывается, если вы сами решаете посмотреть видео с вознаграждением.","p.sec1.list1b.2":"Идентификаторы, привязанные к устройству, включая Android ID (SSAID). Наш собственный код не читает ни его, ни рекламный идентификатор; оба могут читаться внутри рекламных SDK, описанных в §2, — для показа, ограничения частоты и сигналов о невалидном трафике. К вашей подписке они отношения не имеют: права приходят напрямую из Google Play Billing.","p.sec1.list1b.3":"IP-адрес и приблизительное географическое положение, полученное из него","p.sec1.list1b.4":"Модель устройства, версия ОС, язык и часовой пояс","p.sec1.list1b.5":"Версия приложения, метки времени сессий и диагностика сбоев","p.sec1.list1b.6":"Агрегированные обезличенные события использования — только в агрегированном виде","p.sec1.list1b.7":"Play Install Referrer — то, как вы попали на страницу приложения в сторе; считывается, чтобы установку можно было отнести к приведшей её кампании","p.sec1.list1b.8":"Список установленных на устройстве приложений, которые можно запустить, и проверка небольшого набора известных пакетов для root-доступа. Ни то, ни другое не читает наш код: это делают рекламные SDK в составе медиации — для таргетинга и для оценки целостности устройства.","p.sec1.list1b.9":"Сигналы Android Privacy Sandbox — Topics, Attribution Reporting, Protected Audience и сервис Ad ID. Приложения объявляют на них разрешения, чтобы рекламные SDK использовали данные об интересах и атрибуции, которые предоставляет операционная система, а не собираем мы.","p.sec1.title":"Какую информацию мы собираем","p.sec10.body":"По вопросам конфиденциальности любого из наших приложений пишите на <a href=\"mailto:vaslixofficial@protonmail.com\">vaslixofficial@protonmail.com</a>. Стараемся отвечать в разумные сроки.","p.sec10.title":"Контакты","p.sec2.appodeal1":"Мы используем <a href=\"https://www.appodeal.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Appodeal</a> в качестве основного партнёра по рекламной медиации. Политика конфиденциальности Appodeal: <a href=\"https://www.appodeal.com/privacy-policy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">appodeal.com/privacy-policy ↗</a>.","p.sec2.appodeal2":"Appodeal агрегирует спрос множества рекламных сетей; активный список меняется по мере обновления SDK Appodeal и нашей конфигурации сборки. Актуальный авторитетный список публикует Appodeal:","p.sec2.appodeal3":"Каждая сеть на этой странице ведёт к своей политике конфиденциальности. Вопросы по персонализации рекламы можно задавать напрямую Appodeal по тому же адресу.","p.sec2.bundled":"В пакете Appodeal приезжают не только рекламные сети. Перечисленные ниже компоненты попадают в наши релизные сборки, регистрируют собственные службы и приёмники и запускаются самим Appodeal, а не нашим кодом — мы их не вызываем и не настраиваем. Форма «Безопасность данных» в Google Play спрашивает, что собирается, а не кто это инициализировал, поэтому они названы здесь поимённо:","p.sec2.bundledList.1":"<a href=\"https://www.adjust.com/terms/privacy-policy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Adjust ↗</a> — атрибуция установок","p.sec2.bundledList.2":"<a href=\"https://www.appsflyer.com/legal/services-privacy-policy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">AppsFlyer ↗</a> — атрибуция установок, со своим приёмником install referrer","p.sec2.bundledList.3":"<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/privacy/policy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Meta Audience Network ↗</a> — рекламный спрос и измерения","p.sec2.bundledList.4":"<a href=\"https://sentry.io/privacy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sentry ↗</a> — отчёты об ошибках и падениях, отправляются в проект Appodeal, а не в наш. Это второй сборщик падений рядом с Firebase Crashlytics (§1c).","p.sec2.bundledList.5":"<a href=\"https://yandex.com/legal/confidential/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yandex AppMetrica ↗</a> — аналитика, приезжает вместе с рекламным адаптером Yandex","p.sec2.callout":"<strong>Подписчикам Premium — и, в Blocklix, всем, кто купил «Без рекламы», — не показываются баннеры, межстраничные и app-open объявления.</strong> Видео с вознаграждением никому не навязываются: и бесплатным, и платящим они запускаются только после явного нажатия на предложение. Ограниченный трафик инициализации к рекламным провайдерам всё же происходит при старте приложения, до того как ваши права определены.","p.sec2.h3a":"Медиация Appodeal","p.sec2.h3c":"Что приезжает внутри SDK медиации","p.sec2.intro":"Наши приложения показывают баннеры, изредка межстраничные объявления и видео с вознаграждением, которые вы сами решаете посмотреть в обмен на игровой бонус — бустер, продолжение после проигрыша, монеты и тому подобное. Blocklix показывает ещё и рекламу при возвращении в приложение; в Gridlix:2048 её нет. Premium отключает баннеры, межстраничные и app-open объявления в обеих играх, а в Blocklix то же делает разовая покупка «Без рекламы». Видео с вознаграждением остаются доступны всем и запускаются только после нажатия на предложение.","p.sec2.title":"Рекламные партнёры","p.sec3.intro":"Оба приложения предлагают необязательную подписку Premium, которую продаёт и обрабатывает Google через Google Play Billing. В Blocklix есть недельный, месячный и годовой автопродлеваемые планы; в Gridlix:2048 — месячный и годовой. Новым подписчикам, у которых есть на это право, годовой план даётся с бесплатным пробным периодом. Premium отключает баннеры, межстраничные и app-open объявления и открывает премиальные возможности конкретного приложения — например, x2 монет и ежедневный подарок. Blocklix продаёт ещё и разовые товары: наборы монет, стартовый набор, выплату из копилки и постоянное «Без рекламы» с тем же охватом, что у Premium. Gridlix:2048 разовых товаров не продаёт вовсе.","p.sec3.list.1":"Все платёжные, биллинговые, аккаунтные и налоговые данные собирает и обрабатывает Google. Мы не видим, не храним и не передаём ваш способ оплаты, email Google-аккаунта или государственные идентификаторы.","p.sec3.list.2":"Приложение получает от Google только обезличенный сигнал о правах: есть ли активная подписка у вашей установки, какой это продукт и — в Blocklix — какие разовые товары куплены. Этот сигнал кэшируется локально, как описано в §1a.","p.sec3.list.3":"Управление подпиской, отмена, запросы возврата и даты продления полностью обрабатываются на Google Play. Кнопка «Управление» в приложении ведёт на страницу подписок Google Play.","p.sec3.list.4":"На все процессы, связанные с биллингом, распространяется политика конфиденциальности Google Play: <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">policies.google.com/privacy ↗</a>","p.sec3.title":"Подписки и встроенные покупки (Google Play Billing)","p.sec4.body":"Если вы находитесь в ЕЭЗ, Великобритании или Швейцарии, правовое основание для рекламной обработки — ваше согласие, собранное через диалог IAB Transparency &amp; Consent Framework (TCF). Этот диалог показывает сам SDK медиации Appodeal, когда ваш регион этого требует; собственной платформы согласия у нас нет. Отозвать или изменить согласие можно в любой момент. Blocklix умеет открыть диалог заново из настроек приватности внутри приложения; в Gridlix:2048 такого экрана нет, поэтому там нужно очистить данные приложения (Настройки → Приложения) — диалог согласия появится снова при следующем запуске. Правовое основание обработки данных подписки через Google Play Billing — исполнение договора, который вы заключаете при покупке подписки.","p.sec4.title":"Правовая основа и согласие (GDPR / ЕЭЗ, Великобритания, Швейцария)","p.sec5.body":"Если вы житель Калифорнии или другого подходящего штата США, у вас есть право отказаться от «продажи» или «передачи» вашей персональной информации для поведенческой рекламы. Внутренний диалог согласия предоставляет такой опт-аут там, где это требуется. Обработка подписки через Google Play не является «продажей» персональной информации.","p.sec5.title":"CCPA / законы о конфиденциальности штатов США","p.sec6.body":"Наши приложения не предназначены для детей младше 13 лет (или эквивалентного минимального возраста в вашей юрисдикции). Мы сознательно не собираем персональные данные детей. Premium-подписка предназначена для взрослых покупателей; для встроенных покупок требуется Google-аккаунт с соответствующими правами.","p.sec6.title":"Конфиденциальность детей (COPPA)","p.sec7.body":"Локальные данные, описанные в §1a, хранятся на вашем устройстве, пока вы не очистите данные приложения или не удалите его. На своих серверах мы персональные данные не храним. Там, где включён собственный бэкап Android — это Blocklix, но не Gridlix:2048, — сделанная им копия лежит в вашем аккаунте Google и удаляется в Настройках Android → Google → Резервное копирование. Облачное сохранение Play Games лежит в вашем аккаунте Play Games и удаляется оттуда. Рекламные партнёры и Google Play хранят данные по своим политикам.","p.sec7.title":"Хранение данных","p.sec8.body":"В зависимости от вашей юрисдикции у вас могут быть права на доступ, исправление, удаление, ограничение или перенос ваших персональных данных, а также право подать жалобу в надзорный орган. Поскольку мы напрямую этих данных не храним, запросы следует направлять соответствующему рекламному партнёру или — по данным биллинга — Google Play.","p.sec8.callout":"Чтобы удалить все локальные данные любого из приложений, удалите его или очистите хранилище в настройках устройства (<em>Настройки → Приложения → [приложение] → Хранилище → Очистить данные</em>). Это стирает копию на устройстве. Уже сделанный бэкап Android — только у Blocklix — удаляется в <em>Настройках Android → Google → Резервное копирование</em>, а облачное сохранение — из вашего аккаунта Play Games.","p.sec8.title":"Ваши права","p.sec9.body":"Мы можем периодически обновлять эту Политику конфиденциальности — например, при добавлении новых тайтлов, смене рекламных партнёров или обновлении механики подписки. Дата «Обновлено» вверху страницы указывает, когда внесено последнее изменение. Существенные изменения отражаются в приложении при следующем запуске.","p.sec9.title":"Изменения политики","p.summary.1.desc":"Состояние игры, настройки, лучшие результаты, баланс монет и кэшированный признак Premium. Ни на один наш сервер это не попадает. В Blocklix собственный бэкап Android может скопировать всё это в ваш же аккаунт Google (§1d).","p.summary.1.title":"Что остаётся на вашем устройстве","p.summary.2.desc":"Платёжные данные, email вашего Google-аккаунта, ID аккаунтов, контакты, фото и геолокацию точнее, чем приблизительная оценка по IP, которой пользуются рекламные сети.","p.summary.2.title":"Чего мы никогда не видим","p.summary.3.desc":"Бесплатные игроки видят баннеры и межстраничные объявления через медиацию Appodeal, а в Blocklix — ещё и рекламу при открытии. Premium (а в Blocklix — и разовая покупка «Без рекламы») их отключает. Видео с вознаграждением — по желанию для всех: они запускаются только после нажатия на предложение.","p.summary.3.title":"Реклама и Premium","p.summary.4.desc":"Рекламные SDK могут считывать ваш Google Advertising ID и Android ID устройства — чтобы показывать рекламу и ограничивать её частоту. Наш собственный код не читает ни тот, ни другой, и к вашей подписке они отношения не имеют. Оба идентификатора сбрасываются в настройках Android.","p.summary.4.title":"Идентификаторы устройства","p.summary.heading":"Краткая версия","p.table.cloud.onSignIn":"Включается при входе в Play Games","p.table.cloud.optional":"По желанию, по умолчанию выключено","p.table.col.what":"Возможность","p.table.fb.all":"Analytics, Crashlytics, Remote Config","p.table.fb.core":"Analytics, Crashlytics","p.table.intro":"Политика распространяется на все наши приложения, а приложения не одинаковы. Различия собраны здесь; всё остальное в документе относится к обоим.","p.table.no":"Нет","p.table.oneTime.yes":"Наборы монет, стартовый набор, копилка, «Без рекламы»","p.table.plans.2":"Месячный, годовой","p.table.plans.3":"Недельный, месячный, годовой","p.table.row.appOpen":"Реклама при открытии","p.table.row.backup":"Собственный бэкап Android","p.table.row.cloudSave":"Облачное сохранение Play Games","p.table.row.firebase":"Google Firebase","p.table.row.oneTime":"Разовые покупки","p.table.row.plans":"Планы подписки","p.table.row.settings":"Настройки приватности внутри приложения","p.table.title":"Чем игры отличаются друг от друга","p.table.yes":"Да","p.toc.1":"1. Какую информацию мы собираем","p.toc.10":"10. Контакты","p.toc.2":"2. Рекламные партнёры","p.toc.3":"3. Подписки и Play Billing","p.toc.4":"4. Правовая основа (GDPR)","p.toc.5":"5. CCPA / законы штатов США","p.toc.6":"6. Конфиденциальность детей","p.toc.7":"7. Хранение данных","p.toc.8":"8. Ваши права","p.toc.9":"9. Изменения политики","p.toc.aria":"Содержание","p.toc.title":"На этой странице","press.aboutBody":"Vaslix Games — независимый Android-издатель, основанный в 2025 году. Мы делаем небольшие сфокусированные головоломки с подходом «privacy-first»: без аккаунтов, без собственных серверов, хранящих данные пользователей, без внутренней аналитики. В Google Play выпущены две игры: Gridlix:2048 и Blocklix — пазл 8×8 с шестью уровнями сложности, 38 темами и 60 рангами, локализованный на 12 языков.","press.aboutEyebrow":"Пресс-кит","press.aboutTitle":"О студии","press.assetBlocklix":"Иконка Blocklix","press.assetGridlix":"Иконка Gridlix:2048","press.assetLockup":"Логотип с надписью","press.assetLockupDark":"Логотип для тёмного фона","press.assetMark":"Марка студии","press.assetsEyebrow":"Файлы","press.assetsIntro":"Иконки и логотип ровно в том виде, в каком они в сторе. Используйте как есть — пожалуйста, не перекрашивайте и не обрезайте.","press.assetsTitle":"Брендовые ресурсы","press.contactEyebrow":"Пресс-кит","press.contactTitle":"Контакт для прессы","press.copied":"Скопировано","press.copyBtn":"Скопировать текст","press.eyebrow":"Пресс-кит","press.fact.contact":"Контакт","press.fact.founded":"Основана","press.fact.langs":"Языки","press.fact.money":"Модель","press.fact.money.v":"Бесплатно с рекламой · Premium по желанию через Google Play Billing","press.fact.people":"Команда","press.fact.platform":"Платформа","press.fact.studio":"Студия","press.fact.titles":"Игры","press.factsEyebrow":"Лист фактов","press.factsTitle":"Цифры, уже проверенные","press.lede":"Всё, что нужно журналисту, — в одном месте и без ограничений на использование.","press.sla":"Отвечает человек, обычно в течение пяти рабочих дней. Напишите издание, дедлайн и что именно нужно — этого хватит, чтобы ответ пришёл полезным с первого раза.","press.title":"Для прессы и партнёров","principles.eyebrow":"Принципы","principles.intro":"Их дешевле соблюдать, чем оправдывать, — и именно поэтому приложения остаются маленькими.","principles.title":"Четыре правила, которые не двигаются","privacy.eyebrow":"Ваши данные","privacyCta.btn":"Читать политику","privacyCta.text":"Всё, что игра знает о вас, лежит у вас в телефоне. Политика объясняет, что именно, какие рекламные сети грузятся бесплатному игроку и почему каждый платёж идёт через Google, а не через нас.","privacyCta.title":"У нас нет ни одного сервера","road.eyebrow":"Долгая игра","road.families":"Пятнадцать семейств","road.intro":"Всё ниже зарабатывается игрой. Ничего из этого не продаётся.","road.missionsD":"Тринадцать видов дневных, растущих с вашим рангом, два недельных и сундук за неделю без пропусков.","road.missionsT":"Ежедневные и недельные задания","road.questsD":"По пять шагов в каждой: от первой очищенной линии до тех, куда почти никто не доходит.","road.questsT":"21 цепочка достижений","road.ranksD":"Пятнадцать семейств по четыре ступени. Очки — ваш счёт, взвешенный выбранной сложностью.","road.ranksT":"60 рангов","road.title":"Дорога, а не беговая дорожка","roadmap.cta":"Вся дорожная карта","roadmap.eyebrow":"Дорожная карта","roadmap.intro":"Две выпущены, одна на бумаге. Ничего здесь не трогается с места, пока не закончено предыдущее.","roadmap.note":"Сроков здесь не обещают — обещают порядок.","roadmap.r1.desc":"Доступна в Google Play. Головоломка-слияние 4×4 с ежедневной задачей, одинаковой для всех, медалями за месяц, пятью бустерами и Premium без рекламы по желанию.","roadmap.r1.meta":"Выпущено · 2026","roadmap.r1.title":"Gridlix:2048","roadmap.r2.desc":"Доступен в Google Play. Пазл 8×8 «положи и очищай»: шесть уровней сложности, 38 тем, 60 рангов, четыре бустера, ежедневные и недельные задания и опциональный Premium без рекламы.","roadmap.r2.meta":"Выпущено · 2026","roadmap.r2.title":"Blocklix","roadmap.r3.desc":"Словесная головоломка, пока на бумаге. Форма та же, что у двух других: маленькая, офлайн, без аккаунта и с Premium, который только убирает рекламу.","roadmap.r3.meta":"Позже","roadmap.r3.title":"Wordlix","roadmap.title":"Куда мы идём","shelf.count.idea":"на бумаге","shelf.count.live":"в Google Play","shelf.count.open":"мест оставлено","shelf.count.soon":"в работе","shelf.eyebrow":"Полка","shelf.intro":"По панели на каждую игру, в порядке появления. Последняя панель пуста намеренно: полка размечена под то, что будет, а не под то, что уже стоит.","shelf.more":"Открыть страницу","shelf.next":"Следующая","shelf.open.body":"Когда игра готова, она занимает это место в той же рамке и сдвигает пустое дальше. Страницу для этого переделывать не нужно.","shelf.open.meta":"Ещё без названия","shelf.open.title":"Здесь встанет следующая","shelf.prev":"Предыдущая","shelf.railAria":"Полка студии","shelf.title":"Две на полке. Место оставлено под следующие.","status.dev":"В работе","status.idea":"На бумаге","status.live":"В Google Play","status.open":"Пустое место","story.eyebrow":"Коротко","story.p1":"Vaslix Games — это один человек. Это не история про трудности, а ограничение, из которого следует всё остальное. Студия из одного не потянет систему входа, парк серверов и поддержку — значит, она их не строит, и играм от этого только лучше.","story.p2":"Остаётся то, чего игрок действительно касается: доска, тайминги, ощущение вставшей на место фигуры. Каждый час, который ушёл бы на регистрацию, уходит в кривую сложности.","story.p3":"Каталог растёт медленно и намеренно. Игра выходит, когда она готова, обновляется годами и никогда не превращается тихо в сервис, куда надо входить.","story.title":"Почему приложения остаются маленькими","themes.eyebrow":"38 тем","themes.free":"Бесплатно с установки","themes.intro":"Четыре ваши с установки. Остальные зарабатываются звёздами или приходят с Premium — и каждая меняет небо, блоки и то, как вспыхивает собранная линия.","themes.tap":"Нажмите на тему — доска переоденется","themes.title":"У каждой доски своя палитра","trust.1.desc":"Регистрироваться негде. Прогресс не покидает телефон, на котором он набран.","trust.1.title":"Без аккаунтов","trust.2.desc":"Платёж принимает Google Play. Ваша карта до нас не доходит — она через нас и не проходит.","trust.2.title":"Без хранения платёжных данных","trust.3.desc":"Согласие до того, как загрузится первая реклама, отказ там, где его требует закон, и политика, в которой названа каждая причастная компания.","trust.3.title":"GDPR · CCPA · COPPA","trust.4.desc":"Premium выключает баннеры, межстраничную рекламу и объявления при открытии. Видео за награду остаются у всех и запускаются только по нажатию. Вот и вся сделка.","trust.4.title":"Premium убирает рекламу"},"es":{"about.eyebrow":"Acerca de","about.lede":"Una persona, dos juegos en Google Play, sin oficina. <strong>Apps pequeñas, hechas con cuidado, que respetan tu dispositivo y tu atención.</strong> Nada donde iniciar sesión, nada tuyo en un servidor nuestro y ningún inversor preguntando por qué la monetización es tan discreta.","about.stats.apps":"apps publicadas","about.stats.langs":"idiomas soportados","about.stats.people":"persona en el estudio","about.stats.since":"publicando desde","about.title":"Un estudio pequeño con visión a largo plazo","also.cta":"Volver a la estantería","also.eyebrow":"También del estudio","also.title":"El resto de la estantería","card.blocklix.desc":"Coloca formas en un tablero 8×8, limpia líneas y cuadrados, encadena combos para multiplicadores grandes. Seis niveles de dificultad, 38 temas, 60 rangos en 21 cadenas de logros, cuatro boosters, misiones diarias y semanales con cofre de racha, y un vestuario de cosméticos. Premium opcional sin anuncios, con estrellas ×2 y regalo diario.","card.blocklix.genre":"Puzzle","card.gridlix.desc":"Un puzle de fusión 4×4 para Android. El Diario se genera a partir de la fecha, así que todo el mundo recibe el mismo tablero, puntuado con tres estrellas; una racha con escudos sobrevive a una noche perdida y un mes terminado vale una medalla. Cinco potenciadores con tres usos cada uno por partida, cinco temas de color, vibración ajustada y un Premium opcional sin anuncios.","contact.btn":"Enviar un correo","contact.eyebrow":"Contacto","contact.text":"Errores, ideas, preguntas de prensa y propuestas llegan al mismo buzón. Si algo se cerró de golpe, indica el dispositivo y la versión de Android.","contact.title":"Escribe y responde una persona","cta.play":"Disponible en Google Play","diff.eyebrow":"Seis niveles de dificultad","diff.intro":"Solo cambia el generador de piezas. Puntuación, tablero y rangos son iguales en cada escalón — más difícil solo significa que las piezas dejan de ayudarte.","diff.note":"Los escalones altos pagan más estrellas por punto. Fácil paga menos, y nunca finge lo contrario.","diff.title":"Elige la duración de tu partida","f.boosters":"potenciadores","f.daily":"Diario con estrellas","f.difficulties":"dificultades","f.languages":"idiomas","f.ranks":"rangos","f.themes":"temas","faq.a1":"Cancela desde <strong>Google Play → Suscripciones</strong>, o usa el botón «Gestionar» dentro de la app — enlaza a la misma página. La cancelación se aplica al final del período de facturación actual.","faq.a2":"El progreso vive en tu dispositivo. En Blocklix, la copia de seguridad propia de Android lo lleva a tu cuenta de Google, así que reinstalar con la misma cuenta suele recuperarlo; en Gridlix:2048 esa copia está desactivada, y ahí la partida se pierde al desinstalar, salvo que uses el guardado en la nube de Play Games. Nunca subimos una partida a un servidor nuestro. Premium se restaura solo en cuanto reinstalas y entras con la misma cuenta de Google.","faq.a3":"Nosotros no. Nuestro propio código no lo toca — lo leen los SDK publicitarios que van dentro de la app, para limitar la frecuencia de los anuncios y atribuir instalaciones. Con Premium, o con la compra Quitar anuncios en Blocklix, deja de usarse para banners, intersticiales y anuncios de apertura; se sigue procesando si eliges ver un vídeo recompensado. La <a href=\"./privacy-policy.html\">Política de Privacidad</a> nombra todos los SDK que lo leen.","faq.a4":"Android 8.0 (API 26) y superiores. Es a propósito: un teléfono heredado dos veces debe seguir moviéndolos.","faq.a5":"Blocklix llega en 12 idiomas: inglés, ruso, alemán, español, francés, italiano, japonés, coreano, portugués (Brasil), turco, árabe y chino simplificado. Gridlix:2048 cubre un conjunto menor. El idioma del sistema se detecta al primer arranque y se puede cambiar en los ajustes.","faq.a6":"Escribe a <a href=\"mailto:vaslixofficial@protonmail.com\">vaslixofficial@protonmail.com</a> con una breve descripción. Las capturas y el modelo del dispositivo ayudan mucho. Leemos cada mensaje.","faq.a7":"No está en la hoja de ruta. Una persona puede mantener dos juegos de Android actualizados durante años; con dos plataformas, ninguno de los dos lo tendría. Si el catálogo crece lo suficiente como para cambiar la aritmética, se dirá aquí.","faq.a8":"No. Premium quita banners e intersticiales, duplica las estrellas de cada partida y añade un regalo diario y los temas premium. Cada nivel, rango y misión es igual para todos.","faq.eyebrow":"FAQ","faq.q1":"¿Cómo cancelo mi suscripción?","faq.q2":"¿Qué pasa con mi progreso si desinstalo?","faq.q3":"¿Quién lee el Advertising ID?","faq.q4":"¿Qué versiones de Android se soportan?","faq.q5":"¿Qué idiomas soportan las apps?","faq.q6":"Encontré un bug o quiero sugerir una función.","faq.q7":"¿Habrá versión para iOS?","faq.q8":"¿Premium cambia cómo se juega?","faq.title":"Preguntas frecuentes","footer.builtWith":"HTML escrito a mano. Sin rastreadores en este sitio.","footer.contactTitle":"Contacto","footer.copyright":"© Vaslix Games · Estudio Android independiente","footer.games":"Juegos","footer.gamesAria":"Juegos","footer.made":"Hecho en una habitación, jugado en doce idiomas.","footer.privacyLink":"Política de Privacidad","footer.replyTime":"Normalmente respondemos en cinco días hábiles.","footer.studio":"Estudio","footer.studioAria":"Enlaces del estudio","g.blocklix.blurb":"Coloca formas en un tablero 8×8, limpia líneas y cuadrados, encadena combos para multiplicadores grandes. Seis niveles de dificultad, 38 temas, 60 rangos en 21 cadenas de logros, cuatro boosters, misiones diarias y semanales con cofre de racha, y un vestuario de cosméticos. Premium opcional sin anuncios, con estrellas ×2 y regalo diario.","g.blocklix.boosters.eyebrow":"Potenciadores","g.blocklix.boosters.intro":"Cada uno se compra con estrellas ganadas jugando. Ninguno se vende por dinero por separado.","g.blocklix.boosters.note":"Las estrellas vienen de partidas terminadas, misiones y rangos. Premium duplica lo que paga una partida; no vende los potenciadores directamente.","g.blocklix.boosters.title":"Cuatro salidas de un tablero malo","g.blocklix.chip.1":"Tablero 8×8","g.blocklix.chip.2":"Juega sin conexión","g.blocklix.chip.3":"Sin cuenta","g.blocklix.difficulty.eyebrow":"Seis niveles de dificultad","g.blocklix.difficulty.intro":"Solo cambia el generador de piezas. Puntuación, tablero y rangos son iguales en cada escalón — más difícil solo significa que las piezas dejan de ayudarte.","g.blocklix.difficulty.note":"Los escalones altos pagan más estrellas por punto. Fácil paga menos, y nunca finge lo contrario.","g.blocklix.difficulty.title":"Elige la duración de tu partida","g.blocklix.genre":"Puzzle","g.blocklix.how.1.d":"Tres piezas a la vez. Cualquiera va donde quepa; nada gira, nada cae.","g.blocklix.how.1.t":"Coloca","g.blocklix.how.2.d":"Llena una fila o una columna y desaparece. Llena ambas a la vez y el tablero te lo dice.","g.blocklix.how.2.t":"Limpia","g.blocklix.how.3.d":"Limpia en turnos seguidos y el multiplicador sube. Un tic discreto avisa cuando una línea está a punto de irse.","g.blocklix.how.3.t":"Combo","g.blocklix.how.eyebrow":"Cómo se juega","g.blocklix.how.intro":"Blocklix es el 8×8 de colocar y limpiar que ya has visto — afinado hasta que cada uno de estos tres se siente bien en la mano.","g.blocklix.how.title":"Tres movimientos que ya conoces","g.blocklix.openAria":"Abrir la página de Blocklix","g.blocklix.palettes.eyebrow":"38 temas","g.blocklix.palettes.free":"Gratis desde la instalación","g.blocklix.palettes.intro":"Cuatro son tuyos desde la instalación. El resto se ganan con estrellas o vienen con Premium — y cada uno cambia el cielo, los bloques y cómo se ilumina una línea limpiada.","g.blocklix.palettes.tap":"Toca un tema para vestir el tablero","g.blocklix.palettes.title":"Cada tablero viste una paleta","g.blocklix.playAria":"Blocklix en Google Play","g.blocklix.premium.1":"Se apagan los banners, los intersticiales y los anuncios de apertura","g.blocklix.premium.2":"Una partida paga el doble de estrellas","g.blocklix.premium.3":"Un regalo diario y los temas premium","g.blocklix.premium.4":"Todas las dificultades, rangos y misiones siguen igual","g.blocklix.premium.eyebrow":"Premium","g.blocklix.premium.intro":"Premium quita lo que estorba y acelera lo que ya ganas. No desbloquea ningún nivel, rango ni misión.","g.blocklix.premium.note":"Los vídeos con recompensa siguen siendo voluntarios para todos: solo se reproducen si pulsas el botón que los pide.","g.blocklix.premium.title":"Qué cambia el dinero y qué no toca nunca","g.blocklix.progress.eyebrow":"El juego largo","g.blocklix.progress.families":"Las quince familias","g.blocklix.progress.intro":"Todo lo de abajo se gana jugando. Nada de esto se vende.","g.blocklix.progress.missions.d":"Trece tipos diarios que escalan con tu rango, dos semanales y un cofre por la semana que mantienes.","g.blocklix.progress.missions.t":"Misiones diarias y semanales","g.blocklix.progress.quests.d":"Cinco pasos cada una, desde la primera limpieza hasta las que casi nadie alcanza.","g.blocklix.progress.quests.t":"21 cadenas de logros","g.blocklix.progress.ranks.d":"Quince familias de cuatro. Los puntos son tu puntuación, ponderada por la dificultad que elegiste.","g.blocklix.progress.ranks.t":"60 rangos","g.blocklix.progress.title":"Un camino, no una cinta","g.blocklix.tagline":"Coloca tres piezas, despeja la línea, mantén vivo el combo.","g.gridlix.blurb":"Un puzle de fusión 4×4 para Android. El Diario se genera a partir de la fecha, así que todo el mundo recibe el mismo tablero, puntuado con tres estrellas; una racha con escudos sobrevive a una noche perdida y un mes terminado vale una medalla. Cinco potenciadores con tres usos cada uno por partida, cinco temas de color, vibración ajustada y un Premium opcional sin anuncios.","g.gridlix.boosters.delete.d":"Elimina una ficha que señales.","g.gridlix.boosters.eyebrow":"Potenciadores","g.gridlix.boosters.intro":"El límite es por partida, no por día: un potenciador es una decisión dentro de la partida, no un recurso que acumular.","g.gridlix.boosters.note":"Para quien juega gratis, cada uso se paga con un vídeo con recompensa que decides ver; Premium se salta el vídeo y el contador. No usar ninguno es la tercera estrella del Diario.","g.gridlix.boosters.shuffle.d":"Reordena lo que ya hay, sin añadir nada.","g.gridlix.boosters.swap.d":"Intercambia dos fichas de sitio.","g.gridlix.boosters.title":"Cinco, tres usos cada uno","g.gridlix.boosters.undo.d":"Deshace el último movimiento, con la ficha que apareció.","g.gridlix.boosters.value_clear.d":"Barre del tablero todas las fichas de un mismo valor.","g.gridlix.chip.1":"Tablero 4×4","g.gridlix.chip.2":"Diario + infinito","g.gridlix.chip.3":"Widget en la pantalla","g.gridlix.daily.eyebrow":"El Diario","g.gridlix.daily.intro":"Una semilla con la fecha construye la posición inicial y todo el flujo de fichas, así que el tablero que miras es el que miran los demás.","g.gridlix.daily.seed.d":"La apertura la juega de antemano un bot con guion, y su número de movimientos fija el par con el que se te mide. Varios intentos al día; cuenta el mejor.","g.gridlix.daily.seed.t":"Una semilla, un tablero","g.gridlix.daily.star.1":"Llega a la ficha objetivo dentro del límite de movimientos.","g.gridlix.daily.star.2":"Hazlo dentro del par: los movimientos del propio bot.","g.gridlix.daily.star.3":"Dentro del par y sin tocar un solo potenciador.","g.gridlix.daily.title":"El mismo puzle que todos los demás","g.gridlix.genre":"Puzzle","g.gridlix.how.1.d":"Una dirección mueve todas las fichas a la vez. No hay movimientos a medias.","g.gridlix.how.1.t":"Desliza","g.gridlix.how.2.d":"Dos fichas iguales que se tocan se convierten en una del doble. Una ficha se fusiona una vez por movimiento.","g.gridlix.how.2.t":"Fusiona","g.gridlix.how.3.d":"En el modo infinito la meta es tu propio récord. En el Diario es una ficha concreta en un número de movimientos concreto.","g.gridlix.how.3.t":"Llega al objetivo","g.gridlix.how.eyebrow":"Cómo se juega","g.gridlix.how.intro":"No hay nada que aprender más allá del deslizamiento. Lo demás es aritmética y temple.","g.gridlix.how.title":"Un solo gesto, hasta el final","g.gridlix.month.eyebrow":"El mes","g.gridlix.month.intro":"Una noche perdida no debería borrar cuatro meses. Los escudos absorben un fallo y el calendario mantiene el mes entero a la vista.","g.gridlix.month.legend.done":"Jugado","g.gridlix.month.legend.miss":"Perdido","g.gridlix.month.legend.shield":"Con escudo","g.gridlix.month.medals.d":"Al terminar un mes se califica una vez, se guarda para siempre y se muestra en la vitrina junto a tu mejor racha.","g.gridlix.month.medals.t":"Medallas mensuales","g.gridlix.month.streak.d":"El escudo se gasta solo el día que fallas y se recupera jugando. La racha sobrevive a una mala semana normal.","g.gridlix.month.streak.t":"Escudos","g.gridlix.month.title":"Una racha que sí puedes mantener","g.gridlix.openAria":"Abrir la página de Gridlix:2048","g.gridlix.playAria":"Gridlix:2048 en Google Play","g.gridlix.premium.1":"Sin banners ni intersticiales en ninguna parte","g.gridlix.premium.2":"Potenciadores sin ver nada antes","g.gridlix.premium.3":"Continuaciones cuando el tablero se llena","g.gridlix.premium.4":"Se abren las cuatro paletas bloqueadas","g.gridlix.premium.eyebrow":"Premium","g.gridlix.premium.intro":"Una suscripción mediante Google Play, mensual o anual, con prueba gratuita en el plan anual. Se cancela desde Play cuando quieras.","g.gridlix.premium.note":"El Diario, sus estrellas, la racha y las medallas funcionan igual pagues o no.","g.gridlix.premium.title":"Jugar sin interrupciones","g.gridlix.tagline":"Un tablero, un puzle diario: el mismo para todos.","g.gridlix.themes.eyebrow":"Paletas","g.gridlix.themes.free":"Gratis","g.gridlix.themes.intro":"La paleta cambia las fichas, el acento y el brillo, nunca una regla. Estos son los colores reales, sacados de la app.","g.gridlix.themes.premium":"Premium","g.gridlix.themes.title":"Cinco paletas, un tablero","g.words.chip.1":"Palabras","g.words.chip.2":"Prototipo","g.words.tagline":"Un puzle de palabras, aún sobre el papel. La misma forma: pequeño, silencioso, sin conexión.","g.words.when":"Todavía sin fecha","gd.blocklix.booster.bomb.desc":"Despeja un área de 3×3 al instante","gd.blocklix.booster.bomb.name":"Bomba","gd.blocklix.booster.hammer.desc":"Rompe cualquier bloque","gd.blocklix.booster.hammer.name":"Martillo","gd.blocklix.booster.lightning.desc":"Fulmina una fila y una columna enteras de un solo golpe","gd.blocklix.booster.lightning.name":"Rayo","gd.blocklix.booster.shuffle.desc":"Cambia tus piezas por tres nuevas","gd.blocklix.booster.shuffle.name":"Mezcla","gd.blocklix.diff.easy.desc":"Partidas largas y tranquilas. Menos estrellas.","gd.blocklix.diff.easy.name":"Fácil","gd.blocklix.diff.expert.desc":"Cada nueva tanda de piezas es un rompecabezas.","gd.blocklix.diff.expert.name":"Experto","gd.blocklix.diff.hard.desc":"Las piezas grandes llegan antes.","gd.blocklix.diff.hard.name":"Difícil","gd.blocklix.diff.insane.desc":"Suerte pura. Puede que las piezas ni quepan.","gd.blocklix.diff.insane.name":"Locura","gd.blocklix.diff.master.desc":"Solo sobreviven los más hábiles. Nada de piezas fáciles.","gd.blocklix.diff.master.name":"Maestro","gd.blocklix.diff.normal.desc":"El ritmo clásico: unos diez minutos.","gd.blocklix.diff.normal.name":"Normal","gd.blocklix.rank.bronze":"Bronce","gd.blocklix.rank.celestial":"Celestial","gd.blocklix.rank.cosmic":"Cósmico","gd.blocklix.rank.diamond":"Diamante","gd.blocklix.rank.emerald":"Esmeralda","gd.blocklix.rank.eternal":"Eterno","gd.blocklix.rank.gold":"Oro","gd.blocklix.rank.grandmaster":"Gran Maestro","gd.blocklix.rank.legend":"Leyenda","gd.blocklix.rank.master":"Maestro","gd.blocklix.rank.mythic":"Mítico","gd.blocklix.rank.platinum":"Platino","gd.blocklix.rank.ruby":"Rubí","gd.blocklix.rank.silver":"Plata","gd.blocklix.rank.stone":"Piedra","gd.gridlix.booster.delete.name":"Borrar","gd.gridlix.booster.shuffle.name":"Mezclar","gd.gridlix.booster.swap.name":"Cambiar","gd.gridlix.booster.undo.name":"Deshacer","gd.gridlix.booster.value_clear.name":"Limpieza","gd.gridlix.medal.bronze":"Bronce","gd.gridlix.medal.gold":"Oro","gd.gridlix.medal.silver":"Plata","gp.back":"Todos los títulos","hero.cta.games":"Nuestros juegos","hero.cta.studio":"Sobre el estudio","hero.kick":"Estudio Android independiente","hero.lede":"Dos juegos de puzzle, hechos por una persona. Sin cuentas, sin servidores nuestros, doce idiomas — y un Premium que hace exactamente una cosa: quita los anuncios.","hero.scroll":"Desplaza","hero.t1":"Juegos pequeños.","hero.t2":"Hechos para durar.","how.eyebrow":"Cómo se juega","how.intro":"Blocklix es el 8×8 de colocar y limpiar que ya has visto — afinado hasta que cada uno de estos tres se siente bien en la mano.","how.s1d":"Tres piezas a la vez. Cualquiera va donde quepa; nada gira, nada cae.","how.s1t":"Coloca","how.s2d":"Llena una fila o una columna y desaparece. Llena ambas a la vez y el tablero te lo dice.","how.s2t":"Limpia","how.s3d":"Limpia en turnos seguidos y el multiplicador sube. Un tic discreto avisa cuando una línea está a punto de irse.","how.s3t":"Combo","how.title":"Tres movimientos que ya conoces","meta.blocklix.desc":"Coloca tres piezas en un tablero de 8×8, despeja filas y columnas, encadena combos. 38 temas, 60 rangos, seis dificultades, doce idiomas. Sin cuentas.","meta.blocklix.title":"Blocklix — un puzle 8×8 de colocar y despejar | Vaslix Games","meta.description":"Vaslix Games es un estudio Android independiente que crea juegos de puzzle pequeños y enfocados. Gridlix:2048 y Blocklix ya están en Google Play.","meta.gridlix.desc":"Un puzle de fusión 4×4 con un Diario idéntico para todos, escudos de racha, medallas mensuales y cinco potenciadores. El modo infinito no termina.","meta.gridlix.title":"Gridlix:2048 — un puzle diario para todos | Vaslix Games","meta.home.desc":"Vaslix Games es un estudio Android independiente que crea juegos de puzzle pequeños y enfocados. Gridlix:2048 y Blocklix ya están en Google Play.","meta.home.title":"Vaslix Games — pequeños puzzles para Android, hechos para durar","meta.notFound.desc":"Esa dirección no lleva a ninguna parte. La estantería sí.","meta.notFound.title":"Página no encontrada — Vaslix Games","meta.press.desc":"Descripción, ficha de datos, iconos y contacto para medios y socios. Respondemos en unos cinco días hábiles.","meta.press.title":"Kit de prensa — Vaslix Games","meta.privacy.desc":"Cómo Vaslix Games gestiona los datos en Gridlix:2048 y Blocklix. Resumen claro, política completa, qué guarda cada juego y notas sobre GDPR/CCPA/COPPA.","meta.privacy.title":"Política de Privacidad — Vaslix Games","meta.studio.desc":"Una persona, apps de Android pequeñas, sin cuentas y sin servidores propios. Qué hacemos, qué reglas mantenemos y qué viene después.","meta.studio.title":"Estudio — Vaslix Games","meta.title":"Vaslix Games — pequeños puzzles para Android, hechos para durar","nav.aria":"Navegación principal","nav.brand":"Vaslix Games","nav.games":"Juegos","nav.langLabel":"Cambiar idioma","nav.menu":"Menú","nav.press":"Prensa","nav.privacy":"Privacidad","nav.skip":"Ir al contenido","nav.studio":"Estudio","nav.theme.auto":"Cambiar a tema automático","nav.theme.dark":"Cambiar a tema oscuro","nav.theme.light":"Cambiar a tema claro","nf.body":"La dirección no lleva a ninguna parte. La estantería, en cambio, sigue donde la dejaste.","nf.eyebrow":"404","nf.games":"Ver la estantería","nf.home":"Inicio","nf.title":"Esta casilla está vacía","nums.accounts":"cuentas necesarias","nums.games":"juegos en Google Play","nums.langs":"idiomas","nums.person":"persona","nums.servers":"servidores propios","nums.since":"publicando desde","nums.title":"El estudio en cifras","p.changed.body":"Hemos contrastado esta política con el código fuente de ambas apps y la hemos corregido donde no coincidían. Google AdMob ya no se menciona: ninguna app lo incluye. La afirmación de que el ID de dispositivo Android se lee para verificar tu suscripción era falsa y se ha eliminado. Los SDK publicitarios que llegan dentro del paquete de mediación de Appodeal — Adjust, AppsFlyer, Meta Audience Network, Sentry y Yandex AppMetrica — ahora se nombran en §2, igual que Play Install Referrer, la consulta de apps instaladas y los permisos de Privacy Sandbox. El §1a ahora enumera todo lo que las apps guardan de verdad, incluido el registro de monedas y el de los anuncios que se te mostraron. La copia de seguridad y el guardado en la nube difieren entre los dos juegos y ahora se indican por juego en vez de darse por hechos en ambos. Ya no se describen apps de audio ni de podcast: no existe ninguna.","p.changed.title":"Qué cambió en esta revisión","p.hero.chip.billing":"Google Play Billing","p.hero.chip.gdpr":"Cumple GDPR / CCPA / COPPA","p.hero.chip.updated":"Actualizado","p.hero.eyebrow":"Resumen en lenguaje claro, texto legal completo abajo","p.hero.lede":"Cómo Vaslix Games gestiona la información en nuestras apps Android. La política se aplica igual a todo lo que publicamos. Sin cuentas, sin servidores propios, sin sorpresas. <strong>Cubre Gridlix:2048 y Blocklix, ambas en Google Play — y el §1 muestra en qué se diferencian.</strong>","p.hero.title":"Política de Privacidad","p.sec1.backup":"<strong>La copia de seguridad propia de Android está activada en Blocklix y desactivada en Gridlix:2048</strong> — la tabla de arriba indica cuál es cuál. Donde está activada, y si la copia de seguridad está activada en tu dispositivo, Android copia los datos locales listados en 1a a tu cuenta personal de Google y los restaura al reinstalar en la misma cuenta. Esa copia es tuya: Android la gestiona y la cifra, y nosotros no podemos ni leerla ni borrarla. La controlas en <em>Ajustes de Android → Google → Copia de seguridad</em>. Aparte, ambos juegos tienen guardado en la nube sobre Google Play Games Saved Games: un archivo en tu propio almacenamiento de Play Games, para que el progreso te siga entre dispositivos. Nunca funciona sin iniciar sesión en Play Games, lleva solo progreso de juego — nunca el estado de suscripción ni datos de compra — y lo sirve Google, no un servidor nuestro. En Blocklix se publica desactivado y se está habilitando poco a poco. En Gridlix:2048 se sincroniza siempre que hayas iniciado sesión en Play Games; esa app no tiene cierre de sesión propio, así que para detenerlo hay que salir de Play Games desde la app de Google Play Juegos. Gridlix:2048 también desbloquea logros de Play Games y envía tus puntuaciones a dos clasificaciones de Play Games.","p.sec1.body1a":"Cada app almacena lo siguiente en una base local Room/SQLite (o equivalente) de tu dispositivo. Nosotros no lo subimos a ningún servidor propio; donde la copia de seguridad propia de Android está activada para la app, esto puede acabar en tu cuenta de Google personal, como se describe en 1d:","p.sec1.body1b":"Los servicios externos descritos abajo pueden recopilar información técnica y publicitaria automáticamente:","p.sec1.callout":"<strong>Lo que no se guarda localmente:</strong> datos de pago, tokens de compra e identificadores de cuenta Google. Nada de eso sale de Google Play.","p.sec1.deviceIdCallout":"<strong>Por qué lo divulgamos:</strong> el formulario «Seguridad de los datos» de Google Play exige declarar toda lectura del Advertising ID y del ID de dispositivo Android, salga o no del dispositivo. Puedes restablecer el Advertising ID en cualquier momento desde <em>Ajustes de Android → Privacidad → Anuncios</em>; el Android ID se regenera al restablecer el dispositivo a valores de fábrica.","p.sec1.firebase":"Ambas apps incluyen <strong>Google Firebase Analytics</strong> y <strong>Firebase Crashlytics</strong>; Blocklix incluye además <strong>Firebase Remote Config</strong>. Analytics recoge un ID aleatorio de instancia de app, información del dispositivo y del sistema, y eventos agregados dentro de la app — partida terminada, compra completada, anuncio mostrado, junto con los ingresos y el nombre de la red informados para esa impresión — para que podamos entender el uso general y equilibrar la economía del juego. No lo usamos para crear perfiles publicitarios. Remote Config descarga un pequeño conjunto de indicadores y números de balance y no envía datos personales más allá de los metadatos técnicos de la petición. Crashlytics envía un informe cuando la app falla o se congela: la traza, el modelo del dispositivo, las versiones del sistema y de la app, y un identificador aleatorio de instalación — lo justo para encontrar el fallo, y nada de lo que escribiste o jugaste. Crashlytics no es el único recolector de errores presente en las compilaciones; véase el §2. Detalles: <a href=\"https://firebase.google.com/support/privacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">firebase.google.com/support/privacy ↗</a>.","p.sec1.h3a":"1a. Almacenado localmente en tu dispositivo","p.sec1.h3b":"1b. Recopilado por terceros en nuestro nombre","p.sec1.h3c":"1c. Analítica, informes de fallos y configuración remota (Google Firebase)","p.sec1.h3d":"1d. Copia de seguridad y guardado en la nube","p.sec1.intro":"Nuestras apps no requieren crear una cuenta y no recopilamos a sabiendas información personal directamente. La información se divide en dos grupos.","p.sec1.list1a.1":"Estado propio de la app: el tablero tal como lo dejaste, tu puntuación, los boosters y las continuaciones","p.sec1.list1a.2":"Tu historial de mejores partidas y tu mejor puntuación, guardados solo en local","p.sec1.list1a.3":"Ajustes de la app: sonido sí o no, vibración sí o no, tema, notificaciones y preferencias similares","p.sec1.list1a.4":"Un indicador de primer arranque, usado para llevarte por la introducción la primera vez que abres la app","p.sec1.list1a.5":"Un resumen en caché del estado de tu suscripción — activa o no, qué plan, el ID de producto, si ya se usó la prueba gratuita y cuándo caduca — para que la app aplique tus derechos al arrancar sin esperar a la red","p.sec1.list1a.6":"Tu progreso y la economía del juego: el saldo de monedas y el registro completo de sus movimientos, misiones diarias y semanales, logros, progreso de rango, rachas, temas y cosméticos desbloqueados, progreso por dificultad, el resultado de cada Daily y las medallas mensuales","p.sec1.list1a.7":"Un registro de los anuncios que se te mostraron — de qué tipo, cuándo, y los contadores diarios que marcan su ritmo — y, en Gridlix:2048, las horas del día a las que sueles jugar, para que el recordatorio llegue a una hora verosímil y no al azar","p.sec1.list1b.1":"Google Advertising ID (GAID) — se lee para que las redes publicitarias puedan servir anuncios, limitar su frecuencia y atribuir instalaciones. Con Premium o Quitar Anuncios activo no se usa para banners, intersticiales ni app-open; sí se procesa cuando eliges explícitamente ver un vídeo rewarded.","p.sec1.list1b.2":"Identificadores ligados al dispositivo, incluido el ID de dispositivo Android (SSAID). Nuestro propio código no lee ni este ni el ID de publicidad; ambos pueden leerse dentro de los SDK publicitarios descritos en el §2, para la entrega, la limitación de frecuencia y las señales de tráfico no válido. No intervienen en tu suscripción: ese derecho viene directamente de Google Play Billing.","p.sec1.list1b.3":"Dirección IP y ubicación geográfica aproximada derivada","p.sec1.list1b.4":"Modelo de dispositivo, versión de SO, idioma y zona horaria","p.sec1.list1b.5":"Versión de la app, marcas de tiempo de sesión y diagnósticos de fallos","p.sec1.list1b.6":"Eventos de uso agregados y no identificativos, usados solo de forma agregada","p.sec1.list1b.7":"El Play Install Referrer — cómo llegaste a la ficha de la app en la tienda — leído para poder atribuir la instalación a la campaña que la produjo","p.sec1.list1b.8":"La lista de apps instaladas en tu dispositivo que se pueden abrir, y la comprobación de un pequeño conjunto de paquetes conocidos de gestión de root. Nada de esto lo lee nuestro código: viene de los SDK publicitarios incluidos en la mediación, que lo usan para segmentación y para señales de integridad del dispositivo.","p.sec1.list1b.9":"Señales de Android Privacy Sandbox — Topics, Attribution Reporting, Protected Audience y el servicio de Ad ID. Las apps declaran permisos para ello, de modo que los SDK publicitarios usen datos de intereses y atribución que proporciona el sistema operativo en vez de reunirlos nosotros.","p.sec1.title":"Información que recopilamos","p.sec10.body":"Para preguntas de privacidad sobre cualquiera de nuestras apps, escríbenos a <a href=\"mailto:vaslixofficial@protonmail.com\">vaslixofficial@protonmail.com</a>. Intentamos responder en un plazo razonable.","p.sec10.title":"Contacto","p.sec2.appodeal1":"Usamos <a href=\"https://www.appodeal.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Appodeal</a> como nuestro principal socio de mediación publicitaria. La política de privacidad de Appodeal está en <a href=\"https://www.appodeal.com/privacy-policy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">appodeal.com/privacy-policy ↗</a>.","p.sec2.appodeal2":"Appodeal media demanda de muchas redes publicitarias; el conjunto activo cambia con las actualizaciones del SDK y nuestra configuración. La lista actualizada y autoritativa la publica Appodeal:","p.sec2.appodeal3":"Cada red enlazada en esa página remite a su propia política de privacidad. Las preguntas sobre personalización de anuncios pueden dirigirse directamente a Appodeal en el mismo sitio.","p.sec2.bundled":"El paquete de Appodeal trae más que redes publicitarias. Los componentes siguientes se compilan en nuestras versiones de lanzamiento, registran sus propios servicios y receptores y los arranca Appodeal, no nuestro código: ni los llamamos ni los configuramos. El formulario de Seguridad de los datos de Google Play pregunta qué se recoge, no quién lo inicializó, así que se nombran aquí por completo:","p.sec2.bundledList.1":"<a href=\"https://www.adjust.com/terms/privacy-policy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Adjust ↗</a> — atribución de instalaciones","p.sec2.bundledList.2":"<a href=\"https://www.appsflyer.com/legal/services-privacy-policy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">AppsFlyer ↗</a> — atribución de instalaciones, con su propio receptor de install referrer","p.sec2.bundledList.3":"<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/privacy/policy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Meta Audience Network ↗</a> — demanda publicitaria y medición","p.sec2.bundledList.4":"<a href=\"https://sentry.io/privacy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sentry ↗</a> — informes de errores y fallos, enviados al proyecto de Appodeal y no a uno nuestro. Es un segundo recolector de fallos junto a Firebase Crashlytics (§1c).","p.sec2.bundledList.5":"<a href=\"https://yandex.com/legal/confidential/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yandex AppMetrica ↗</a> — analítica, que llega con el adaptador publicitario de Yandex","p.sec2.callout":"<strong>A los suscriptores Premium — y, en Blocklix, a quien haya comprado Quitar anuncios — no se les muestran banners, intersticiales ni anuncios de apertura.</strong> Los vídeos recompensados no se imponen a nadie: gratis o de pago, solo arrancan al tocar explícitamente una oferta. Sigue habiendo un tráfico limitado de inicialización hacia los proveedores publicitarios al arrancar la app, antes de que se resuelvan tus derechos.","p.sec2.h3a":"Mediación de Appodeal","p.sec2.h3c":"Qué viene dentro del SDK de mediación","p.sec2.intro":"Nuestras apps muestran banners, anuncios intersticiales ocasionales y vídeos recompensados que eliges ver a cambio de una ventaja en el juego: un booster, una continuación tras perder, monedas extra y similares. Blocklix muestra además anuncios al volver a la app; Gridlix:2048 no. Una suscripción Premium desactiva banners, intersticiales y anuncios de apertura en ambos juegos, y en Blocklix la compra única Quitar anuncios hace lo mismo. Los vídeos recompensados siguen disponibles para todos y solo se reproducen cuando tocas su oferta.","p.sec2.title":"Socios publicitarios","p.sec3.intro":"Ambas apps ofrecen una suscripción Premium opcional, vendida y procesada por Google mediante Google Play Billing. Blocklix ofrece planes de renovación automática semanal, mensual y anual; Gridlix:2048 ofrece mensual y anual. Los nuevos suscriptores que cumplan los requisitos obtienen una prueba gratuita introductoria en el plan anual. Premium desactiva banners, intersticiales y anuncios de apertura y desbloquea funciones premium propias de cada app — por ejemplo x2 monedas y un regalo diario. Blocklix vende además productos únicos: packs de monedas, un pack inicial, el pago de la hucha y un desbloqueo permanente de Quitar anuncios con el mismo alcance que Premium. Gridlix:2048 no vende ningún producto único.","p.sec3.list.1":"Toda la información de pago, facturación, cuenta e impuestos la recopila y procesa Google. No vemos, almacenamos ni transmitimos tu método de pago, email de Google ni identificadores oficiales.","p.sec3.list.2":"La app recibe de Google únicamente una señal de derechos no identificativa: si existe una suscripción activa para tu instalación, de qué producto se trata y — en Blocklix — qué productos únicos se han comprado. Esa señal se almacena en caché local como se describe en el §1a.","p.sec3.list.3":"La gestión, cancelación, reembolsos y fechas de renovación se gestionan íntegramente en Google Play. El botón «Gestionar» dentro de la app enlaza a la página de suscripciones de Google Play.","p.sec3.list.4":"La política de privacidad de Google Play se aplica a todo el procesamiento de facturación: <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">policies.google.com/privacy ↗</a>","p.sec3.title":"Suscripciones y compras dentro de la app (Google Play Billing)","p.sec4.body":"Si te encuentras en el EEE, el Reino Unido o Suiza, la base legal para el tratamiento publicitario es tu consentimiento, recogido mediante un diálogo del IAB Transparency &amp; Consent Framework (TCF). Ese diálogo lo muestra el propio SDK de mediación de Appodeal cuando tu región lo exige; nosotros no operamos ninguna plataforma de consentimiento propia. Puedes retirar o cambiar tu consentimiento en cualquier momento. Blocklix puede volver a abrir el diálogo desde sus ajustes de privacidad dentro de la app; Gridlix:2048 no tiene esa pantalla, así que allí hay que borrar los datos de la app (Ajustes → Aplicaciones), lo que vuelve a mostrar el diálogo en el siguiente arranque. La base legal del tratamiento de datos de suscripción vía Google Play Billing es la ejecución del contrato que celebras al comprar la suscripción.","p.sec4.title":"Base legal y consentimiento (GDPR / EEE, Reino Unido, Suiza)","p.sec5.body":"Si resides en California u otro estado aplicable, tienes derecho a oponerte a la \"venta\" o \"compartición\" de tu información personal con fines publicitarios conductuales. El diálogo de consentimiento ofrece este opt-out donde sea necesario. El procesamiento de suscripciones por Google Play no es una \"venta\" de información personal.","p.sec5.title":"CCPA / leyes estatales de privacidad de EE. UU.","p.sec6.body":"Nuestras apps no están dirigidas a menores de 13 años (o la edad mínima equivalente en tu jurisdicción). No recopilamos a sabiendas información personal de menores. La suscripción Premium está pensada para compradores adultos; las compras requieren una cuenta de Google Play con los permisos adecuados.","p.sec6.title":"Privacidad infantil (COPPA)","p.sec7.body":"Los datos locales descritos en el §1a se conservan en tu dispositivo hasta que borres los datos de la app o la desinstales. No conservamos información personal en servidores nuestros. Donde la copia de seguridad propia de Android está activada — Blocklix, no Gridlix:2048 — la copia que hace vive en tu cuenta de Google y se elimina en Ajustes de Android → Google → Copia de seguridad. Un guardado en la nube de Play Games vive en tu cuenta de Play Games y se elimina desde allí. Los socios publicitarios y Google Play conservan datos según sus propias políticas.","p.sec7.title":"Retención de datos","p.sec8.body":"Según tu jurisdicción puedes tener derecho a acceder, corregir, eliminar, restringir o portar tus datos personales, y a presentar una reclamación ante una autoridad de control. Como no almacenamos directamente estos datos, las solicitudes deben dirigirse al socio publicitario correspondiente o — para datos de facturación — a Google Play.","p.sec8.callout":"Para eliminar todos los datos locales de cualquiera de las apps, desinstálala o borra su almacenamiento desde los ajustes del dispositivo (<em>Ajustes → Aplicaciones → [la app] → Almacenamiento → Borrar datos</em>). Eso borra la copia del dispositivo. Una copia de seguridad que Android ya haya hecho — solo Blocklix — se elimina en <em>Ajustes de Android → Google → Copia de seguridad</em>, y el guardado en la nube desde tu cuenta de Play Games.","p.sec8.title":"Tus derechos","p.sec9.body":"Podemos actualizar esta Política de Privacidad de vez en cuando — por ejemplo cuando añadamos nuevos títulos, cambiemos socios publicitarios o actualicemos la mecánica de suscripción. La fecha «Actualizado» en la parte superior indica cuándo se hizo el último cambio. Los cambios sustanciales se reflejarán en la app en el siguiente arranque.","p.sec9.title":"Cambios a esta política","p.summary.1.desc":"Estado del juego, ajustes, mejores puntuaciones, tu saldo de monedas y un indicador de premium en caché. Nada de eso llega a un servidor nuestro. En Blocklix, la copia de seguridad propia de Android puede llevarlo a tu cuenta de Google (§1d).","p.summary.1.title":"Qué se queda en tu dispositivo","p.summary.2.desc":"Datos de pago, tu email de Google, identificadores de cuenta, contactos, fotos o ubicación más allá del estimado por IP que usan las redes publicitarias.","p.summary.2.title":"Qué nunca vemos","p.summary.3.desc":"Los jugadores gratuitos ven banners e intersticiales a través de la mediación de Appodeal, y en Blocklix también anuncios de apertura. Premium — o, en Blocklix, la compra única Quitar anuncios — los desactiva. Los vídeos recompensados son voluntarios para todos: solo se reproducen al tocar una oferta.","p.summary.3.title":"Anuncios vs Premium","p.summary.4.desc":"Los SDK publicitarios pueden leer tu Google Advertising ID y el ID de dispositivo Android para servir anuncios y limitar su frecuencia. Nuestro propio código no lee ninguno de los dos, y ninguno tiene que ver con tu suscripción. Ambos se pueden restablecer en los ajustes de Android.","p.summary.4.title":"Identificadores de dispositivo","p.summary.heading":"Versión corta","p.table.cloud.onSignIn":"Activo al iniciar sesión en Play Games","p.table.cloud.optional":"Opcional, desactivado por defecto","p.table.col.what":"Función","p.table.fb.all":"Analytics, Crashlytics, Remote Config","p.table.fb.core":"Analytics, Crashlytics","p.table.intro":"Esta política cubre todas las apps que publicamos, y las apps no son idénticas. Donde difieren, difieren aquí; todo lo demás en este documento vale para ambas.","p.table.no":"No","p.table.oneTime.yes":"Packs de monedas, pack inicial, hucha, Quitar anuncios","p.table.plans.2":"Mensual, anual","p.table.plans.3":"Semanal, mensual, anual","p.table.row.appOpen":"Anuncios al abrir la app","p.table.row.backup":"Copia de seguridad propia de Android","p.table.row.cloudSave":"Guardado en la nube de Play Games","p.table.row.firebase":"Google Firebase","p.table.row.oneTime":"Compras únicas","p.table.row.plans":"Planes de suscripción","p.table.row.settings":"Ajustes de privacidad dentro de la app","p.table.title":"En qué se diferencian nuestros juegos","p.table.yes":"Sí","p.toc.1":"1. Información que recopilamos","p.toc.10":"10. Contacto","p.toc.2":"2. Socios publicitarios","p.toc.3":"3. Suscripciones y Play Billing","p.toc.4":"4. Base legal (GDPR)","p.toc.5":"5. CCPA / leyes estatales EE. UU.","p.toc.6":"6. Privacidad infantil","p.toc.7":"7. Retención de datos","p.toc.8":"8. Tus derechos","p.toc.9":"9. Cambios a esta política","p.toc.aria":"Tabla de contenidos","p.toc.title":"En esta página","press.aboutBody":"Vaslix Games es un editor Android independiente fundado en 2025. Hacemos juegos de puzzle pequeños y enfocados con un enfoque privacy-first: sin cuentas, sin servidores propios guardando datos de usuario, sin analítica casera. Dos títulos están en Google Play: Gridlix:2048 y Blocklix, un puzzle 8×8 con seis niveles de dificultad, 38 temas y 60 rangos, localizado a 12 idiomas.","press.aboutEyebrow":"Press kit","press.aboutTitle":"Sobre el estudio","press.assetBlocklix":"Icono de Blocklix","press.assetGridlix":"Icono de Gridlix:2048","press.assetLockup":"Logotipo con texto","press.assetLockupDark":"Logotipo para fondos oscuros","press.assetMark":"Marca del estudio","press.assetsEyebrow":"Descargas","press.assetsIntro":"Iconos y logotipo tal como se publican. Úsalos tal cual: por favor, no los recolorees ni los recortes.","press.assetsTitle":"Recursos de marca","press.contactEyebrow":"Press kit","press.contactTitle":"Contacto de prensa","press.copied":"Copiado","press.copyBtn":"Copiar texto","press.eyebrow":"Press kit","press.fact.contact":"Contacto","press.fact.founded":"Fundado","press.fact.langs":"Idiomas","press.fact.money":"Modelo de negocio","press.fact.money.v":"Gratis con anuncios · Premium opcional mediante Google Play Billing","press.fact.people":"Equipo","press.fact.platform":"Plataforma","press.fact.studio":"Estudio","press.fact.titles":"Títulos","press.factsEyebrow":"Ficha de datos","press.factsTitle":"Las cifras, ya comprobadas","press.lede":"Todo lo que necesita quien escribe, en un solo sitio y libre de usar.","press.sla":"Responde una persona, normalmente en cinco días hábiles. Dinos tu medio, tu deadline y qué necesitas — con eso basta para que la primera respuesta ya sirva.","press.title":"Para prensa y socios","principles.eyebrow":"Principios","principles.intro":"Sale más barato cumplirlas que justificarlas, y por eso las apps siguen siendo pequeñas.","principles.title":"Cuatro reglas que no se mueven","privacy.eyebrow":"Tus datos","privacyCta.btn":"Leer la política","privacyCta.text":"Todo lo que un juego sabe de ti está en tu teléfono. La política dice exactamente qué es, qué redes publicitarias se cargan para un jugador gratuito y por qué cada pago pasa por Google y no por nosotros.","privacyCta.title":"No tenemos ni un solo servidor","road.eyebrow":"El juego largo","road.families":"Las quince familias","road.intro":"Todo lo de abajo se gana jugando. Nada de esto se vende.","road.missionsD":"Trece tipos diarios que escalan con tu rango, dos semanales y un cofre por la semana que mantienes.","road.missionsT":"Misiones diarias y semanales","road.questsD":"Cinco pasos cada una, desde la primera limpieza hasta las que casi nadie alcanza.","road.questsT":"21 cadenas de logros","road.ranksD":"Quince familias de cuatro. Los puntos son tu puntuación, ponderada por la dificultad que elegiste.","road.ranksT":"60 rangos","road.title":"Un camino, no una cinta","roadmap.cta":"La hoja de ruta completa","roadmap.eyebrow":"Hoja de ruta","roadmap.intro":"Dos publicados, uno sobre el papel. Aquí nada arranca hasta que lo anterior está terminado.","roadmap.note":"Aquí no se prometen fechas; se promete el orden.","roadmap.r1.desc":"Disponible en Google Play. Un puzle de fusión 4×4 con un Diario igual para todos, medallas mensuales, cinco potenciadores y un Premium opcional sin anuncios.","roadmap.r1.meta":"Publicado · 2026","roadmap.r1.title":"Gridlix:2048","roadmap.r2.desc":"Disponible en Google Play. Puzzle 8×8 de colocar y limpiar: seis niveles de dificultad, 38 temas, 60 rangos, cuatro boosters, misiones diarias y semanales, y Premium opcional sin anuncios.","roadmap.r2.meta":"Publicado · 2026","roadmap.r2.title":"Blocklix","roadmap.r3.desc":"Un puzle de palabras, todavía sobre el papel. La misma forma que los otros dos: pequeño, sin conexión, sin cuenta y un Premium que solo quita los anuncios.","roadmap.r3.meta":"Más adelante","roadmap.r3.title":"Wordlix","roadmap.title":"Hacia dónde vamos","shelf.count.idea":"en papel","shelf.count.live":"en Google Play","shelf.count.open":"huecos reservados","shelf.count.soon":"en marcha","shelf.eyebrow":"La estantería","shelf.intro":"Un panel por título, en el orden en que se hicieron. El último panel está vacío a propósito: la estantería está medida para lo que viene, no para lo que ya está.","shelf.more":"Abrir la página","shelf.next":"Título siguiente","shelf.open.body":"Cuando un título esté listo ocupará este hueco, con el mismo marco, y empujará el vacío una posición. La página no cambia.","shelf.open.meta":"Todavía sin nombre","shelf.open.title":"Aquí llegará el siguiente","shelf.prev":"Título anterior","shelf.railAria":"La estantería del estudio","shelf.title":"Dos en la estantería. Hay sitio para más.","status.dev":"En marcha","status.idea":"Sobre el papel","status.live":"En Google Play","status.open":"Hueco libre","story.eyebrow":"La versión corta","story.p1":"Vaslix Games es una persona. No es una historia de sacrificio: es la restricción de la que sale todo lo demás. Un estudio de uno no puede mantener un sistema de cuentas, una flota de servidores y un soporte, así que no los construye, y los juegos ganan con ello.","story.p2":"Queda lo que el jugador toca de verdad: el tablero, el ritmo, la sensación de una pieza al encajar. Cada hora que habría ido a un registro va a la curva de dificultad.","story.p3":"El catálogo crece despacio y a propósito. Un título sale cuando está terminado, recibe actualizaciones durante años y nunca se convierte en silencio en un servicio con inicio de sesión.","story.title":"Por qué las apps siguen siendo pequeñas","themes.eyebrow":"38 temas","themes.free":"Gratis desde la instalación","themes.intro":"Cuatro son tuyos desde la instalación. El resto se ganan con estrellas o vienen con Premium — y cada uno cambia el cielo, los bloques y cómo se ilumina una línea limpiada.","themes.tap":"Toca un tema para vestir el tablero","themes.title":"Cada tablero viste una paleta","trust.1.desc":"No hay dónde registrarse. Tu progreso no sale del teléfono donde lo hiciste.","trust.1.title":"Sin cuentas","trust.2.desc":"El pago lo cobra Google Play. Tu tarjeta nunca llega hasta nosotros, porque nunca pasa por nosotros.","trust.2.title":"Sin guardar datos de pago","trust.3.desc":"Consentimiento antes de que cargue el primer anuncio, un opt-out donde la ley lo exige y una política que nombra a cada empresa implicada.","trust.3.title":"GDPR · CCPA · COPPA","trust.4.desc":"Premium apaga los banners, los intersticiales y los anuncios de apertura. Los vídeos recompensados siguen ahí para todos y solo arrancan si tocas uno. Ese es todo el trato.","trust.4.title":"Premium quita los anuncios"},"de":{"about.eyebrow":"Über uns","about.lede":"Eine Person, zwei Spiele bei Google Play, kein Büro. <strong>Kleine Apps, mit Sorgfalt gebaut, die dein Gerät und deine Aufmerksamkeit respektieren.</strong> Nichts, wo du dich anmelden müsstest, nichts von dir auf einem Server von uns und kein Investor, der fragt, warum die Monetarisierung so leise ist.","about.stats.apps":"veröffentlichte Apps","about.stats.langs":"unterstützte Sprachen","about.stats.people":"Person im Studio","about.stats.since":"veröffentlicht seit","about.title":"Ein kleines Studio mit langem Atem","also.cta":"Zurück zum Regal","also.eyebrow":"Auch aus dem Studio","also.title":"Der Rest des Regals","card.blocklix.desc":"Setze Formen auf ein 8×8-Feld, räume Linien und Quadrate ab, kette Combos für große Multiplikatoren. Sechs Schwierigkeitsstufen, 38 Themes, 60 Ränge in 21 Erfolgsketten, vier Booster, Tages- und Wochenmissionen mit Serien-Truhe und eine Kosmetik-Garderobe. Optionales werbefreies Premium mit 2× Sternen und einem Tagesgeschenk.","card.blocklix.genre":"Puzzle","card.gridlix.desc":"Ein 4×4-Merge-Puzzle für Android. Das Daily entsteht aus dem Datum, also bekommt jede und jeder weltweit dasselbe Feld, bewertet mit bis zu drei Sternen; eine Serie mit Schilden übersteht einen verpassten Abend, und ein abgeschlossener Monat bringt eine Medaille. Fünf Booster mit je drei Einsätzen pro Partie, fünf Farbthemes, abgestimmte Haptik und ein optionales werbefreies Premium.","contact.btn":"E-Mail schreiben","contact.eyebrow":"Kontakt","contact.text":"Fehler, Ideen, Presseanfragen und Angebote landen im selben Postfach. Bei einem Absturz bitte Gerät und Android-Version nennen.","contact.title":"Schreiben Sie — es antwortet ein Mensch","cta.play":"Jetzt bei Google Play","diff.eyebrow":"Sechs Schwierigkeitsstufen","diff.intro":"Nur der Steingenerator ändert sich. Wertung, Feld und Ränge bleiben auf jeder Stufe gleich — schwerer heißt nur, dass die Steine aufhören, dir zu helfen.","diff.note":"Höhere Stufen zahlen mehr Sterne pro Punkt. Leicht zahlt weniger und tut nie so, als wäre es anders.","diff.title":"Wähle die Länge deiner Partie","f.boosters":"Booster","f.daily":"bewertetes Daily","f.difficulties":"Schwierigkeitsgrade","f.languages":"Sprachen","f.ranks":"Ränge","f.themes":"Themes","faq.a1":"Kündige in <strong>Google Play → Abos</strong> oder über die Schaltfläche „Verwalten“ in der App — sie verlinkt zur selben Seite. Die Kündigung greift am Ende deines aktuellen Abrechnungszeitraums.","faq.a2":"Der Fortschritt liegt auf deinem Gerät. In Blocklix kopiert ihn Androids eigenes Backup in dein Google-Konto; eine Neuinstallation mit demselben Konto holt ihn also meist zurück. In Gridlix:2048 ist dieses Backup abgeschaltet, und dort geht der Spielstand beim Deinstallieren verloren — es sei denn, du nutzt den Cloud-Spielstand von Play Games. Auf einen Server von uns laden wir Spielstände nie hoch. Premium stellt sich von selbst wieder her, sobald du neu installierst und dich mit demselben Google-Konto anmeldest.","faq.a3":"Wir nicht. Unser eigener Code fasst sie nie an — das tun die Werbe-SDKs in der App, damit die Häufigkeit von Anzeigen begrenzt und Installationen zugeordnet werden können. Mit Premium, in Blocklix auch mit dem Kauf „Werbung entfernen“, wird sie nicht mehr für Banner, Interstitials oder App-Open-Anzeigen verwendet; verarbeitet wird sie weiterhin, wenn du dich für ein Rewarded Video entscheidest. Die <a href=\"./privacy-policy.html\">Datenschutzerklärung</a> nennt jedes SDK, das sie liest.","faq.a4":"Android 8.0 (API 26) und höher. Das ist Absicht: Ein zweimal weitergereichtes Handy soll die Spiele noch packen.","faq.a5":"Blocklix erscheint in 12 Sprachen: Englisch, Russisch, Deutsch, Spanisch, Französisch, Italienisch, Japanisch, Koreanisch, Portugiesisch (Brasilien), Türkisch, Arabisch und vereinfachtes Chinesisch. Gridlix:2048 deckt weniger ab. Die Systemsprache wird beim ersten Start erkannt und lässt sich in den App-Einstellungen ändern.","faq.a6":"Schreib an <a href=\"mailto:vaslixofficial@protonmail.com\">vaslixofficial@protonmail.com</a> mit einer kurzen Beschreibung. Screenshots und Gerätemodell helfen sehr. Wir lesen jede Nachricht.","faq.a7":"Nicht auf der Roadmap. Eine Person kann zwei Android-Spiele jahrelang aktuell halten; bei zwei Plattformen bekäme das keines von beiden. Wächst der Katalog so weit, dass sich die Rechnung ändert, steht es hier.","faq.a8":"Nein. Premium entfernt Banner und Interstitials, verdoppelt die Sterne einer Partie und bringt ein Tagesgeschenk und die Premium-Themes. Jede Stufe, jeder Rang und jede Mission ist für alle gleich.","faq.eyebrow":"FAQ","faq.q1":"Wie kündige ich mein Abo?","faq.q2":"Was passiert mit meinem Spielfortschritt beim Deinstallieren?","faq.q3":"Wer liest die Advertising ID?","faq.q4":"Welche Android-Versionen werden unterstützt?","faq.q5":"Welche Sprachen werden unterstützt?","faq.q6":"Ich habe einen Bug gefunden oder einen Vorschlag.","faq.q7":"Wird es jemals eine iOS-Version geben?","faq.q8":"Ändert Premium, wie sich das Spiel spielt?","faq.title":"Häufige Fragen","footer.builtWith":"Handgeschriebenes HTML. Keine Tracker auf dieser Seite.","footer.contactTitle":"Kontakt","footer.copyright":"© Vaslix Games · Unabhängiges Android-Studio","footer.games":"Spiele","footer.gamesAria":"Spiele","footer.made":"In einem Zimmer gemacht, in zwölf Sprachen gespielt.","footer.privacyLink":"Datenschutzerklärung","footer.replyTime":"Antwort in der Regel binnen fünf Werktagen.","footer.studio":"Studio","footer.studioAria":"Studio-Links","g.blocklix.blurb":"Setze Formen auf ein 8×8-Feld, räume Linien und Quadrate ab, kette Combos für große Multiplikatoren. Sechs Schwierigkeitsstufen, 38 Themes, 60 Ränge in 21 Erfolgsketten, vier Booster, Tages- und Wochenmissionen mit Serien-Truhe und eine Kosmetik-Garderobe. Optionales werbefreies Premium mit 2× Sternen und einem Tagesgeschenk.","g.blocklix.boosters.eyebrow":"Booster","g.blocklix.boosters.intro":"Jeder wird mit erspielten Sternen bezahlt. Keiner ist einzeln für Geld zu haben.","g.blocklix.boosters.note":"Sterne kommen aus beendeten Partien, Missionen und Rängen. Premium verdoppelt den Ertrag einer Partie, verkauft die Booster aber nicht direkt.","g.blocklix.boosters.title":"Vier Auswege aus einem schlechten Feld","g.blocklix.chip.1":"8×8-Feld","g.blocklix.chip.2":"Läuft offline","g.blocklix.chip.3":"Ohne Konto","g.blocklix.difficulty.eyebrow":"Sechs Schwierigkeitsstufen","g.blocklix.difficulty.intro":"Nur der Steingenerator ändert sich. Wertung, Feld und Ränge bleiben auf jeder Stufe gleich — schwerer heißt nur, dass die Steine aufhören, dir zu helfen.","g.blocklix.difficulty.note":"Höhere Stufen zahlen mehr Sterne pro Punkt. Leicht zahlt weniger und tut nie so, als wäre es anders.","g.blocklix.difficulty.title":"Wähle die Länge deiner Partie","g.blocklix.genre":"Puzzle","g.blocklix.how.1.d":"Drei Steine auf einmal. Jeder passt, wo er passt; nichts dreht sich, nichts fällt.","g.blocklix.how.1.t":"Ablegen","g.blocklix.how.2.d":"Fülle eine Reihe oder Spalte, und sie verschwindet. Fülle beide zugleich, und das Feld sagt es dir.","g.blocklix.how.2.t":"Abräumen","g.blocklix.how.3.d":"Räume in aufeinanderfolgenden Zügen ab, und der Multiplikator steigt. Ein leises Ticken warnt, wenn eine Linie gleich fällt.","g.blocklix.how.3.t":"Combo","g.blocklix.how.eyebrow":"So spielt es sich","g.blocklix.how.intro":"Blocklix ist das 8×8-Drop-and-Clear, das du schon gesehen hast — so lange abgestimmt, bis sich jeder dieser drei Züge richtig anfühlt.","g.blocklix.how.title":"Drei Züge, die du schon kennst","g.blocklix.openAria":"Die Blocklix-Seite öffnen","g.blocklix.palettes.eyebrow":"38 Themes","g.blocklix.palettes.free":"Kostenlos ab Installation","g.blocklix.palettes.intro":"Vier gehören dir ab Installation. Der Rest wird mit Sternen verdient oder kommt mit Premium — und jedes verändert Himmel, Steine und die Art, wie eine abgeräumte Linie aufleuchtet.","g.blocklix.palettes.tap":"Tippe ein Theme an, um das Feld einzukleiden","g.blocklix.palettes.title":"Jedes Feld trägt eine Palette","g.blocklix.playAria":"Blocklix bei Google Play","g.blocklix.premium.1":"Banner, Interstitials und App-Open-Werbung gehen aus","g.blocklix.premium.2":"Eine Partie zahlt doppelt so viele Sterne","g.blocklix.premium.3":"Ein tägliches Geschenk und die Premium-Themes","g.blocklix.premium.4":"Alle Schwierigkeitsgrade, Ränge und Missionen bleiben unverändert","g.blocklix.premium.eyebrow":"Premium","g.blocklix.premium.intro":"Premium entfernt, was stört, und beschleunigt, was ohnehin verdient wird. Es schaltet weder Level noch Rang noch Mission frei.","g.blocklix.premium.note":"Belohnte Videos bleiben für alle freiwillig: Sie laufen nur, wenn man die Schaltfläche dafür antippt.","g.blocklix.premium.title":"Was Geld ändert — und was es nie anfasst","g.blocklix.progress.eyebrow":"Das lange Spiel","g.blocklix.progress.families":"Die fünfzehn Familien","g.blocklix.progress.intro":"Alles hier unten wird erspielt. Nichts davon wird verkauft.","g.blocklix.progress.missions.d":"Dreizehn tägliche Arten, die mit deinem Rang wachsen, zwei wöchentliche und eine Truhe für die Woche, die du durchhältst.","g.blocklix.progress.missions.t":"Tages- und Wochenmissionen","g.blocklix.progress.quests.d":"Je fünf Schritte, vom ersten Abräumen bis zu denen, die fast niemand erreicht.","g.blocklix.progress.quests.t":"21 Erfolgsketten","g.blocklix.progress.ranks.d":"Fünfzehn Familien zu je vier. Punkte sind deine Wertung, gewichtet mit der gewählten Schwierigkeit.","g.blocklix.progress.ranks.t":"60 Ränge","g.blocklix.progress.title":"Ein Weg, kein Laufband","g.blocklix.tagline":"Drei Teile legen, die Linie räumen, die Combo am Leben halten.","g.gridlix.blurb":"Ein 4×4-Merge-Puzzle für Android. Das Daily entsteht aus dem Datum, also bekommt jede und jeder weltweit dasselbe Feld, bewertet mit bis zu drei Sternen; eine Serie mit Schilden übersteht einen verpassten Abend, und ein abgeschlossener Monat bringt eine Medaille. Fünf Booster mit je drei Einsätzen pro Partie, fünf Farbthemes, abgestimmte Haptik und ein optionales werbefreies Premium.","g.gridlix.boosters.delete.d":"Entfernt eine angetippte Kachel.","g.gridlix.boosters.eyebrow":"Booster","g.gridlix.boosters.intro":"Das Limit gilt pro Partie, nicht pro Tag — ein Booster ist eine Entscheidung im Lauf, kein Vorrat.","g.gridlix.boosters.note":"Für kostenlose Spielende wird jeder Einsatz mit einem freiwilligen Belohnungsvideo bezahlt; Premium überspringt Video und Zähler. Keinen zu benutzen ist der dritte Daily-Stern.","g.gridlix.boosters.shuffle.d":"Ordnet das Vorhandene neu, ohne etwas hinzuzufügen.","g.gridlix.boosters.swap.d":"Tauscht zwei Kacheln.","g.gridlix.boosters.title":"Fünf, je drei Einsätze","g.gridlix.boosters.undo.d":"Nimmt den letzten Zug samt neuer Kachel zurück.","g.gridlix.boosters.value_clear.d":"Fegt alle Kacheln eines Werts vom Feld.","g.gridlix.chip.1":"4×4-Feld","g.gridlix.chip.2":"Daily + Endlos","g.gridlix.chip.3":"Widget für den Startbildschirm","g.gridlix.daily.eyebrow":"Das Daily","g.gridlix.daily.intro":"Ein Seed aus dem Datum baut die Startstellung und den gesamten Spawn-Strom — das Feld vor Ihnen ist das Feld aller anderen.","g.gridlix.daily.seed.d":"Die Eröffnung spielt vorab ein Skript-Bot; seine Zugzahl setzt das Par, an dem gemessen wird. Mehrere Versuche pro Tag, der beste zählt.","g.gridlix.daily.seed.t":"Ein Seed, ein Brett","g.gridlix.daily.star.1":"Die Zielkachel innerhalb des Zuglimits erreichen.","g.gridlix.daily.star.2":"Und zwar innerhalb des Par — der Zugzahl des Bots.","g.gridlix.daily.star.3":"Innerhalb des Par und ohne einen einzigen Booster.","g.gridlix.daily.title":"Dasselbe Rätsel wie alle anderen","g.gridlix.genre":"Puzzle","g.gridlix.how.1.d":"Eine Richtung bewegt alle Kacheln zugleich. Halbe Züge gibt es nicht.","g.gridlix.how.1.t":"Wischen","g.gridlix.how.2.d":"Zwei gleiche Kacheln, die sich berühren, werden eine mit doppeltem Wert. Pro Zug verschmilzt eine Kachel einmal.","g.gridlix.how.2.t":"Verschmelzen","g.gridlix.how.3.d":"Im Endlosmodus ist das Ziel der eigene Rekord. Im Daily eine genannte Kachel in einer genannten Zugzahl.","g.gridlix.how.3.t":"Das Ziel erreichen","g.gridlix.how.eyebrow":"Wie es sich spielt","g.gridlix.how.intro":"Mehr als das Wischen gibt es nicht zu lernen. Alles Weitere ist Rechnen und Nerven.","g.gridlix.how.title":"Eine Geste, bis ganz nach unten","g.gridlix.month.eyebrow":"Der Monat","g.gridlix.month.intro":"Ein verpasster Abend soll nicht vier Monate löschen. Schilde fangen einen Ausfall ab, und der Kalender behält den ganzen Monat im Blick.","g.gridlix.month.legend.done":"Gespielt","g.gridlix.month.legend.miss":"Verpasst","g.gridlix.month.legend.shield":"Geschützt","g.gridlix.month.medals.d":"Ein abgeschlossener Monat wird einmal bewertet, bleibt für immer und steht in der Vitrine neben der besten Serie.","g.gridlix.month.medals.t":"Monatsmedaillen","g.gridlix.month.streak.d":"Ein Schild wird am Tag des Ausfalls automatisch eingesetzt und durch Spielen zurückverdient. Die Serie übersteht eine ganz normale schlechte Woche.","g.gridlix.month.streak.t":"Schilde","g.gridlix.month.title":"Eine Serie, die man wirklich halten kann","g.gridlix.openAria":"Die Gridlix:2048-Seite öffnen","g.gridlix.playAria":"Gridlix:2048 bei Google Play","g.gridlix.premium.1":"Keine Banner, keine Interstitials, nirgends","g.gridlix.premium.2":"Booster ohne vorheriges Video","g.gridlix.premium.3":"Fortsetzungen, wenn das Feld voll ist","g.gridlix.premium.4":"Die vier gesperrten Paletten öffnen sich","g.gridlix.premium.eyebrow":"Premium","g.gridlix.premium.intro":"Ein Abo über Google Play, monatlich oder jährlich, mit Gratiszeitraum im Jahresplan. Jederzeit über Play kündbar.","g.gridlix.premium.note":"Daily, Sterne, Serie und Medaillen funktionieren gleich, ob bezahlt oder nicht.","g.gridlix.premium.title":"Spielen ohne Unterbrechungen","g.gridlix.tagline":"Ein Brett, ein Tagesrätsel — für alle dasselbe.","g.gridlix.themes.eyebrow":"Paletten","g.gridlix.themes.free":"Kostenlos","g.gridlix.themes.intro":"Die Palette ändert Kacheln, Akzent und Schein — nie eine Regel. Das sind die echten Farben, direkt aus der App.","g.gridlix.themes.premium":"Premium","g.gridlix.themes.title":"Fünf Paletten, ein Brett","g.words.chip.1":"Worträtsel","g.words.chip.2":"Prototyp","g.words.tagline":"Ein Worträtsel, noch auf dem Papier. Dieselbe Form: klein, leise, offline.","g.words.when":"Noch kein Termin","gd.blocklix.booster.bomb.desc":"Sprengt sofort ein 3×3-Feld frei","gd.blocklix.booster.bomb.name":"Bombe","gd.blocklix.booster.hammer.desc":"Zertrümmert einen beliebigen Block","gd.blocklix.booster.hammer.name":"Hammer","gd.blocklix.booster.lightning.desc":"Fegt eine ganze Reihe und Spalte mit einem Schlag weg","gd.blocklix.booster.lightning.name":"Blitz","gd.blocklix.booster.shuffle.desc":"Tauscht deine Figuren gegen drei neue","gd.blocklix.booster.shuffle.name":"Mischen","gd.blocklix.diff.easy.desc":"Lange, entspannte Spiele. Weniger Sterne.","gd.blocklix.diff.easy.name":"Leicht","gd.blocklix.diff.expert.desc":"Jedes neue Figuren-Set ist ein Rätsel.","gd.blocklix.diff.expert.name":"Experte","gd.blocklix.diff.hard.desc":"Große Steine kommen früher.","gd.blocklix.diff.hard.name":"Schwer","gd.blocklix.diff.insane.desc":"Reines Glücksspiel. Figuren passen vielleicht gar nicht.","gd.blocklix.diff.insane.name":"Wahnsinn","gd.blocklix.diff.master.desc":"Nur die Besten halten durch. Keine leichten Figuren.","gd.blocklix.diff.master.name":"Meister","gd.blocklix.diff.normal.desc":"Klassisch — etwa zehn Minuten.","gd.blocklix.diff.normal.name":"Normal","gd.blocklix.rank.bronze":"Bronze","gd.blocklix.rank.celestial":"Himmlisch","gd.blocklix.rank.cosmic":"Kosmisch","gd.blocklix.rank.diamond":"Diamant","gd.blocklix.rank.emerald":"Smaragd","gd.blocklix.rank.eternal":"Ewig","gd.blocklix.rank.gold":"Gold","gd.blocklix.rank.grandmaster":"Großmeister","gd.blocklix.rank.legend":"Legende","gd.blocklix.rank.master":"Meister","gd.blocklix.rank.mythic":"Mythisch","gd.blocklix.rank.platinum":"Platin","gd.blocklix.rank.ruby":"Rubin","gd.blocklix.rank.silver":"Silber","gd.blocklix.rank.stone":"Stein","gd.gridlix.booster.delete.name":"Löschen","gd.gridlix.booster.shuffle.name":"Mischen","gd.gridlix.booster.swap.name":"Tausch","gd.gridlix.booster.undo.name":"Zurück","gd.gridlix.booster.value_clear.name":"Aufräumen","gd.gridlix.medal.bronze":"Bronze","gd.gridlix.medal.gold":"Gold","gd.gridlix.medal.silver":"Silber","gp.back":"Alle Titel","hero.cta.games":"Unsere Spiele","hero.cta.studio":"Über das Studio","hero.kick":"Unabhängiges Android-Studio","hero.lede":"Zwei Puzzlespiele, von einer Person gemacht. Keine Konten, keine eigenen Server, zwölf Sprachen — und ein Premium, das genau eines tut: Es entfernt die Werbung.","hero.scroll":"Scrollen","hero.t1":"Kleine Spiele.","hero.t2":"Für lange gemacht.","how.eyebrow":"So spielt es sich","how.intro":"Blocklix ist das 8×8-Drop-and-Clear, das du schon gesehen hast — so lange abgestimmt, bis sich jeder dieser drei Züge richtig anfühlt.","how.s1d":"Drei Steine auf einmal. Jeder passt, wo er passt; nichts dreht sich, nichts fällt.","how.s1t":"Ablegen","how.s2d":"Fülle eine Reihe oder Spalte, und sie verschwindet. Fülle beide zugleich, und das Feld sagt es dir.","how.s2t":"Abräumen","how.s3d":"Räume in aufeinanderfolgenden Zügen ab, und der Multiplikator steigt. Ein leises Ticken warnt, wenn eine Linie gleich fällt.","how.s3t":"Combo","how.title":"Drei Züge, die du schon kennst","meta.blocklix.desc":"Lege drei Teile auf ein 8×8-Feld, räume Reihen und Spalten, verkette Combos. 38 Themes, 60 Ränge, sechs Schwierigkeitsgrade, zwölf Sprachen. Ohne Konto.","meta.blocklix.title":"Blocklix — ein 8×8-Puzzle zum Legen und Räumen | Vaslix Games","meta.description":"Vaslix Games ist ein unabhängiges Android-Studio, das kleine, fokussierte Puzzlespiele veröffentlicht. Gridlix:2048 und Blocklix sind beide auf Google Play.","meta.gridlix.desc":"Ein 4×4-Merge-Puzzle mit einem Daily, das für alle identisch ist, Serien-Schilden, Monatsmedaillen und fünf Boostern. Der Endlosmodus endet nie.","meta.gridlix.title":"Gridlix:2048 — ein Tagesrätsel für alle | Vaslix Games","meta.home.desc":"Vaslix Games ist ein unabhängiges Android-Studio, das kleine, fokussierte Puzzlespiele veröffentlicht. Gridlix:2048 und Blocklix sind beide auf Google Play.","meta.home.title":"Vaslix Games — kleine Android-Puzzles, gebaut, um zu bleiben","meta.notFound.desc":"Diese Adresse führt nirgendwohin. Das Regal schon.","meta.notFound.title":"Seite nicht gefunden — Vaslix Games","meta.press.desc":"Kurztext, Faktenblatt, Icons und Kontakt für Presse und Partner. Antwort in etwa fünf Werktagen.","meta.press.title":"Pressemappe — Vaslix Games","meta.privacy.desc":"Wie Vaslix Games Daten in Gridlix:2048 und Blocklix verarbeitet. Klartext-Zusammenfassung, vollständige Erklärung, was jedes Spiel speichert, GDPR/CCPA/COPPA-Hinweise.","meta.privacy.title":"Datenschutzerklärung — Vaslix Games","meta.studio.desc":"Eine Person, kleine Android-Apps, keine Konten und keine eigenen Server. Was wir bauen, welche Regeln gelten und was als Nächstes kommt.","meta.studio.title":"Studio — Vaslix Games","meta.title":"Vaslix Games — kleine Android-Puzzles, gebaut, um zu bleiben","nav.aria":"Hauptnavigation","nav.brand":"Vaslix Games","nav.games":"Spiele","nav.langLabel":"Sprache ändern","nav.menu":"Menü","nav.press":"Presse","nav.privacy":"Datenschutz","nav.skip":"Zum Inhalt springen","nav.studio":"Studio","nav.theme.auto":"Zum automatischen Theme wechseln","nav.theme.dark":"Zum dunklen Theme wechseln","nav.theme.light":"Zum hellen Theme wechseln","nf.body":"Die Adresse führt nirgendwohin. Das Regal steht dagegen noch genau dort.","nf.eyebrow":"404","nf.games":"Regal ansehen","nf.home":"Startseite","nf.title":"Dieses Feld ist leer","nums.accounts":"Konten nötig","nums.games":"Spiele auf Google Play","nums.langs":"Sprachen","nums.person":"Person","nums.servers":"eigene Server","nums.since":"veröffentlicht seit","nums.title":"Das Studio in Zahlen","p.changed.body":"Wir haben diese Erklärung gegen den Quellcode beider Apps geprüft und dort korrigiert, wo beide sich widersprachen. Google AdMob wird nicht mehr genannt, denn keine der Apps enthält es. Die Behauptung, die Android-Geräte-ID werde zur Prüfung Ihres Abos gelesen, war falsch und ist entfernt. Werbe-SDKs, die im Appodeal-Mediation-Paket mitkommen — Adjust, AppsFlyer, Meta Audience Network, Sentry und Yandex AppMetrica — sind jetzt in §2 benannt, ebenso der Play Install Referrer, die Abfrage installierter Apps und die Privacy-Sandbox-Berechtigungen. §1a listet nun alles auf, was die Apps tatsächlich speichern, einschließlich des Münz-Journals und der Aufzeichnung, welche Werbung Ihnen gezeigt wurde. Backup und Cloud-Speicherstand unterscheiden sich zwischen den beiden Spielen und werden jetzt pro Spiel angegeben statt für beide behauptet. Audio- und Podcast-Apps werden nicht mehr beschrieben: es gibt keine.","p.changed.title":"Was sich in dieser Fassung geändert hat","p.hero.chip.billing":"Google Play Billing","p.hero.chip.gdpr":"GDPR / CCPA / COPPA-konform","p.hero.chip.updated":"Zuletzt aktualisiert","p.hero.eyebrow":"Klartext-Zusammenfassung, vollständiger Rechtstext unten","p.hero.lede":"Wie Vaslix Games Informationen in unseren Android-Apps verarbeitet. Die Erklärung gilt gleichermaßen für alles, was wir veröffentlichen. Keine Konten, keine eigenen Server, keine Überraschungen. <strong>Sie deckt Gridlix:2048 und Blocklix ab, beide bei Google Play — und §1 zeigt, worin sich die beiden unterscheiden.</strong>","p.hero.title":"Datenschutzerklärung","p.sec1.backup":"<strong>Androids eigenes Backup ist in Blocklix aktiviert und in Gridlix:2048 abgeschaltet</strong> — die Tabelle oben zeigt, was wo gilt. Wo es aktiv ist und wenn das Backup auf Ihrem Gerät eingeschaltet ist, kopiert Android die in 1a genannten lokalen Daten in Ihr persönliches Google-Konto und stellt sie wieder her, wenn Sie mit demselben Konto neu installieren. Diese Kopie gehört Ihnen: Android verwaltet und verschlüsselt sie, wir können sie weder lesen noch löschen. Sie steuern das unter <em>Android-Einstellungen → Google → Backup</em>. Davon getrennt: Beide Spiele haben einen Cloud-Speicherstand auf Basis von Google Play Games Saved Games — eine Datei in Ihrem eigenen Play-Games-Speicher, damit der Fortschritt Ihnen zwischen Geräten folgt. Er läuft nie ohne Play-Games-Anmeldung, trägt ausschließlich Spielfortschritt — nie Abo-Status oder Kaufdaten — und wird von Google bereitgestellt, nicht von einem Server von uns. In Blocklix wird er abgeschaltet ausgeliefert und schrittweise aktiviert. In Gridlix:2048 synchronisiert er, sobald Sie bei Play Games angemeldet sind; diese App hat keine eigene Abmeldung, also beenden Sie ihn, indem Sie sich in der Google-Play-Games-App von Play Games abmelden. Gridlix:2048 schaltet außerdem Play-Games-Erfolge frei und überträgt Ihre Punktzahlen an zwei Play-Games-Bestenlisten.","p.sec1.body1a":"Jede App speichert Folgendes in einer lokalen Room/SQLite-Datenbank (oder einem äquivalenten lokalen Speicher) auf deinem Gerät. Wir laden es auf keinen eigenen Server hoch; wo Androids eigenes Backup für die App aktiviert ist, kann dies in Ihr persönliches Google-Konto kopiert werden, wie in 1d beschrieben:","p.sec1.body1b":"Die unten beschriebenen Drittdienste können automatisch technische und werbebezogene Informationen erfassen:","p.sec1.callout":"<strong>Was nicht lokal gespeichert wird:</strong> Zahlungsdaten, Kauf-Tokens und Google-Konto-Identifikatoren. Nichts davon verlässt Google Play.","p.sec1.deviceIdCallout":"<strong>Warum wir das offenlegen:</strong> Das Google-Play-Formular „Datensicherheit“ verlangt, dass jeder Lesezugriff auf die Advertising ID und die Android-Geräte-ID deklariert wird — unabhängig davon, ob der Wert das Gerät verlässt. Du kannst die Advertising ID jederzeit unter <em>Android-Einstellungen → Datenschutz → Werbung</em> zurücksetzen; die Android-ID wird bei einem Werksreset des Geräts neu erzeugt.","p.sec1.firebase":"Beide Apps enthalten <strong>Google Firebase Analytics</strong> und <strong>Firebase Crashlytics</strong>; Blocklix enthält zusätzlich <strong>Firebase Remote Config</strong>. Analytics erfasst eine zufällige App-Instanz-ID, Geräte- und Betriebssysteminformationen sowie aggregierte In-App-Ereignisse — Spiel beendet, Kauf abgeschlossen, Werbung gezeigt, samt der für diese Einblendung gemeldeten Einnahmen und des Netzwerknamens —, damit wir die Gesamtnutzung verstehen und die Spielökonomie ausbalancieren können. Für Werbeprofile verwenden wir das nicht. Remote Config lädt eine kleine Menge Feature-Flags und Balancing-Zahlen und sendet außer den technischen Anfrage-Metadaten keine personenbezogenen Daten. Crashlytics sendet einen Bericht, wenn die App abstürzt oder einfriert: den Stacktrace, das Gerätemodell, die Betriebssystem- und App-Version und eine zufällige Installations-ID — genug, um den Fehler zu finden, und nichts von dem, was Sie getippt oder gespielt haben. Crashlytics ist nicht der einzige Fehlerberichterstatter in den Builds; siehe §2. Details: <a href=\"https://firebase.google.com/support/privacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">firebase.google.com/support/privacy ↗</a>.","p.sec1.h3a":"1a. Lokal auf deinem Gerät gespeichert","p.sec1.h3b":"1b. Von Dritten in unserem Auftrag erfasst","p.sec1.h3c":"1c. Analyse, Absturzberichte und Remote-Konfiguration (Google Firebase)","p.sec1.h3d":"1d. Sicherung und Cloud-Spielstand","p.sec1.intro":"Unsere Apps erfordern keine Kontoerstellung, und wir erheben nicht wissentlich personenbezogene Daten direkt. Informationen verteilen sich auf zwei Gruppen.","p.sec1.list1a.1":"App-eigener Zustand: das Spielfeld, wie Sie es verlassen haben, Ihr Punktestand, Booster und Fortsetzungen","p.sec1.list1a.2":"Ihre Bestenliste und Ihr bester Punktestand, nur lokal gespeichert","p.sec1.list1a.3":"App-Einstellungen: Ton an oder aus, Haptik an oder aus, Theme, Benachrichtigungen und ähnliche Vorlieben","p.sec1.list1a.4":"Ein Erststart-Kennzeichen, mit dem die App Sie beim ersten Öffnen durch das Onboarding führt","p.sec1.list1a.5":"Eine zwischengespeicherte Zusammenfassung Ihres Abo-Status — aktiv oder nicht, welcher Plan, die Produkt-ID, ob die kostenlose Testphase genutzt wurde und wann sie abläuft — damit die App Ihre Berechtigung beim Start anwendet, ohne auf das Netz zu warten","p.sec1.list1a.6":"Ihr Fortschritt und die Spielökonomie: der Münzstand und das vollständige Journal der Münzbewegungen, tägliche und wöchentliche Missionen, Erfolge, Rangfortschritt, Spielserien, freigeschaltete Themes und Kosmetik, Schwierigkeitsfortschritt, das Ergebnis jedes Daily und die Monatsmedaillen","p.sec1.list1a.7":"Eine Aufzeichnung der Ihnen gezeigten Werbung — welcher Typ, wann, und die Tageszähler, die ihren Takt vorgeben — sowie, in Gridlix:2048, die Tageszeiten, zu denen Sie üblicherweise spielen, damit eine Erinnerung zu einer plausiblen Zeit kommt statt zufällig","p.sec1.list1b.1":"Google Advertising ID (GAID) — wird gelesen, damit Werbenetzwerke Werbung ausliefern, sie in der Häufigkeit begrenzen und Installationen attribuieren können. Bei aktivem Premium oder Werbung entfernen wird sie nicht für Banner-, Interstitial- oder App-Open-Werbung genutzt; sie wird aber verarbeitet, wenn du dich ausdrücklich für ein Rewarded-Video entscheidest.","p.sec1.list1b.2":"Geräteweite Kennungen, einschließlich der Android-Geräte-ID (SSAID). Unser eigener Code liest weder diese noch die Werbe-ID; beide können innerhalb der in §2 beschriebenen Werbe-SDKs gelesen werden — für Auslieferung, Frequenzbegrenzung und Signale zu ungültigem Traffic. Für Ihr Abo spielen sie keine Rolle: diese Berechtigung kommt direkt von Google Play Billing.","p.sec1.list1b.3":"IP-Adresse und daraus abgeleiteter ungefährer Standort","p.sec1.list1b.4":"Gerätemodell, Betriebssystemversion, Sprache und Zeitzone","p.sec1.list1b.5":"App-Version, Sitzungs-Zeitstempel und Absturzdiagnosen","p.sec1.list1b.6":"Aggregierte, nicht personenbezogene Nutzungsereignisse, ausschließlich in aggregierter Form verwendet","p.sec1.list1b.7":"Der Play Install Referrer — wie Sie zum Store-Eintrag der App gekommen sind — wird gelesen, um eine Installation der Kampagne zuzuordnen, aus der sie stammt","p.sec1.list1b.8":"Die Liste der auf Ihrem Gerät installierten, startbaren Apps sowie Prüfungen auf einige bekannte Root-Verwaltungspakete. Beides liest nicht unser Code: es stammt aus den mit der Mediation gebündelten Werbe-SDKs, die es für Targeting und Geräteintegritätssignale nutzen.","p.sec1.list1b.9":"Signale der Android Privacy Sandbox — Topics, Attribution Reporting, Protected Audience und der Ad-ID-Dienst. Die Apps deklarieren dafür Berechtigungen, damit die Werbe-SDKs Interessen- und Attributionsdaten nutzen können, die vom Betriebssystem stammen statt von uns zusammengetragen zu werden.","p.sec1.title":"Welche Informationen wir erfassen","p.sec10.body":"Für Datenschutzfragen zu einer unserer Apps schreib uns an <a href=\"mailto:vaslixofficial@protonmail.com\">vaslixofficial@protonmail.com</a>. Wir versuchen, in angemessener Zeit zu antworten.","p.sec10.title":"Kontakt","p.sec2.appodeal1":"Wir nutzen <a href=\"https://www.appodeal.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Appodeal</a> als unseren primären Werbe-Mediation-Partner. Die Datenschutzerklärung von Appodeal findest du unter <a href=\"https://www.appodeal.com/privacy-policy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">appodeal.com/privacy-policy ↗</a>.","p.sec2.appodeal2":"Appodeal vermittelt Nachfrage einer großen Zahl von Werbenetzwerken; die aktive Liste ändert sich mit SDK-Updates von Appodeal und unserer Build-Konfiguration. Die aktuelle, autoritative Liste veröffentlicht Appodeal:","p.sec2.appodeal3":"Jedes auf dieser Seite verlinkte Netzwerk verweist auf seine eigene Datenschutzerklärung. Datenschutzfragen zur Werbe-Personalisierung können direkt bei Appodeal auf derselben Seite gestellt werden.","p.sec2.bundled":"Das Appodeal-Paket bündelt mehr als Werbenetzwerke. Die folgenden Komponenten werden in unsere Release-Builds kompiliert, registrieren eigene Dienste und Receiver und werden von Appodeal gestartet, nicht von unserem Code — wir rufen sie weder auf noch konfigurieren wir sie. Das Data-safety-Formular von Google Play fragt, was erhoben wird, nicht wer es initialisiert hat; deshalb sind sie hier vollständig benannt:","p.sec2.bundledList.1":"<a href=\"https://www.adjust.com/terms/privacy-policy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Adjust ↗</a> — Installationsattribution","p.sec2.bundledList.2":"<a href=\"https://www.appsflyer.com/legal/services-privacy-policy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">AppsFlyer ↗</a> — Installationsattribution, mit eigenem Install-Referrer-Receiver","p.sec2.bundledList.3":"<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/privacy/policy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Meta Audience Network ↗</a> — Werbenachfrage und Messung","p.sec2.bundledList.4":"<a href=\"https://sentry.io/privacy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sentry ↗</a> — Fehler- und Absturzberichte, die an Appodeals Projekt gehen und nicht an eines von uns. Es ist ein zweiter Absturzberichterstatter neben Firebase Crashlytics (§1c).","p.sec2.bundledList.5":"<a href=\"https://yandex.com/legal/confidential/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yandex AppMetrica ↗</a> — Analytics, kommt mit dem Yandex-Werbeadapter","p.sec2.callout":"<strong>Premium-Abonnenten — und in Blocklix alle, die „Werbung entfernen“ gekauft haben — bekommen keine Banner-, Interstitial- oder App-Open-Anzeigen.</strong> Rewarded-Videos werden niemandem aufgedrängt: ob kostenlos oder zahlend, sie starten nur nach ausdrücklichem Antippen eines Angebots. Ein begrenzter Initialisierungsverkehr zu den Werbeanbietern findet beim App-Start dennoch statt, bevor Ihre Berechtigung ermittelt ist.","p.sec2.h3a":"Appodeal-Mediation","p.sec2.h3c":"Was im Mediation-SDK mitkommt","p.sec2.intro":"Unsere Apps zeigen Banner, gelegentliche Interstitials und Rewarded-Videos, die Sie ausdrücklich ansehen, um einen Vorteil im Spiel zu erhalten — einen Booster, eine Fortsetzung nach dem Game-over, Bonusmünzen und Ähnliches. Blocklix zeigt zusätzlich App-Open-Anzeigen bei der Rückkehr in die App; Gridlix:2048 nicht. Ein Premium-Abo schaltet Banner, Interstitials und App-Open-Anzeigen in beiden Spielen ab, und in Blocklix tut der Einmalkauf „Werbung entfernen“ dasselbe. Rewarded-Videos bleiben für alle verfügbar und laufen erst, wenn Sie ihr Angebot antippen.","p.sec2.title":"Werbepartner","p.sec3.intro":"Beide Apps bieten ein optionales Premium-Abo, das Google über Google Play Billing verkauft und abwickelt. Blocklix bietet wöchentliche, monatliche und jährliche automatisch verlängernde Pläne; Gridlix:2048 bietet monatlich und jährlich. Berechtigte Neuabonnenten erhalten eine einführende kostenlose Testphase im Jahresplan. Premium schaltet Banner-, Interstitial- und App-Open-Anzeigen ab und schaltet app-spezifische Premium-Funktionen frei — etwa x2 Münzen und ein tägliches Geschenk. Blocklix verkauft zusätzlich Einmalprodukte: Münzpakete, ein Starterpaket, eine Sparschwein-Auszahlung und eine dauerhafte „Werbung entfernen“-Freischaltung mit demselben Umfang wie Premium. Gridlix:2048 verkauft überhaupt keine Einmalprodukte.","p.sec3.list.1":"Alle Zahlungs-, Abrechnungs-, Konto- und Steuerdaten werden von Google erfasst und verarbeitet. Wir sehen, speichern und übertragen weder dein Zahlungsmittel noch deine Google-Konto-E-Mail oder amtliche Identifikatoren.","p.sec3.list.2":"Die App erhält von Google nur ein nicht identifizierendes Berechtigungssignal: ob für Ihre Installation ein aktives Abo besteht, um welches Produkt es sich handelt und — in Blocklix — welche Einmalprodukte gekauft wurden. Dieses Signal wird lokal zwischengespeichert, wie in §1a beschrieben.","p.sec3.list.3":"Abo-Verwaltung, Kündigung, Erstattungsanfragen und Verlängerungstermine werden vollständig in Google Play abgewickelt. Die „Verwalten“-Schaltfläche in der App verlinkt zur Google-Play-Abo-Seite.","p.sec3.list.4":"Die Datenschutzerklärung von Google Play gilt für alle abrechnungsbezogenen Verarbeitungen: <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">policies.google.com/privacy ↗</a>","p.sec3.title":"Abos und In-App-Käufe (Google Play Billing)","p.sec4.body":"Wenn Sie sich im EWR, im Vereinigten Königreich oder in der Schweiz befinden, ist die Rechtsgrundlage für die werbebezogene Verarbeitung Ihre Einwilligung, eingeholt über einen Dialog des IAB Transparency &amp; Consent Framework (TCF). Diesen Dialog zeigt das Appodeal-Mediation-SDK selbst an, wenn Ihre Region ihn verlangt; wir betreiben keine eigene Consent-Plattform. Sie können Ihre Einwilligung jederzeit widerrufen oder ändern. Blocklix kann den Dialog aus seinen Datenschutzeinstellungen in der App erneut öffnen; Gridlix:2048 hat keinen solchen Bildschirm, dort führt der Weg über das Löschen der App-Daten (Einstellungen → Apps), womit der Einwilligungsdialog beim nächsten Start erneut erscheint. Die Rechtsgrundlage für die Verarbeitung von Abodaten über Google Play Billing ist die Erfüllung des Vertrags, den Sie beim Kauf eines Abos schließen.","p.sec4.title":"Rechtsgrundlage und Einwilligung (GDPR / EWR, UK, Schweiz)","p.sec5.body":"Wenn du in Kalifornien oder einem anderen einschlägigen US-Bundesstaat ansässig bist, hast du das Recht, dem „Verkauf“ oder „Teilen“ deiner personenbezogenen Informationen für verhaltensbasierte Werbung zu widersprechen. Der In-App-Einwilligungsdialog stellt diesen Opt-out bereit, wo erforderlich. Die Abo-Abwicklung durch Google Play ist kein „Verkauf“ personenbezogener Informationen.","p.sec5.title":"CCPA / US-Datenschutzgesetze der Bundesstaaten","p.sec6.body":"Unsere Apps richten sich nicht an Kinder unter 13 Jahren (oder das entsprechende Mindestalter deiner Jurisdiktion). Wir erfassen nicht wissentlich personenbezogene Daten von Kindern. Das Premium-Abo richtet sich an erwachsene Käufer; In-App-Käufe erfordern ein Google-Play-Konto mit entsprechenden Berechtigungen.","p.sec6.title":"Datenschutz für Kinder (COPPA)","p.sec7.body":"Die in §1a beschriebenen lokalen Daten bleiben auf Ihrem Gerät, bis Sie die App-Daten löschen oder die App deinstallieren. Auf eigenen Servern speichern wir keine personenbezogenen Daten. Wo Androids eigenes Backup aktiviert ist — Blocklix, nicht Gridlix:2048 — liegt die davon erstellte Kopie in Ihrem eigenen Google-Konto und wird unter Android-Einstellungen → Google → Backup entfernt. Ein Play-Games-Cloud-Speicherstand liegt in Ihrem Play-Games-Konto und wird dort entfernt. Die Werbepartner und Google Play speichern Daten gemäß ihren eigenen Richtlinien.","p.sec7.title":"Datenspeicherung","p.sec8.body":"Je nach Jurisdiktion kannst du das Recht haben, deine personenbezogenen Daten einzusehen, zu berichtigen, zu löschen, zu beschränken oder zu übertragen, sowie Beschwerde bei einer Aufsichtsbehörde einzulegen. Da wir diese Daten nicht selbst halten, sollten Anfragen an den betreffenden Werbepartner oder — für Abrechnungsdaten — an Google Play gerichtet werden.","p.sec8.callout":"Um alle lokal gespeicherten Daten einer der Apps zu entfernen, deinstallieren Sie sie oder löschen Sie ihren Speicher in den Geräteeinstellungen (<em>Einstellungen → Apps → [die App] → Speicher → Daten löschen</em>). Das löscht die Kopie auf dem Gerät. Ein bereits von Android erstelltes Backup — nur Blocklix — wird unter <em>Android-Einstellungen → Google → Backup</em> entfernt, ein Play-Games-Cloud-Speicherstand aus Ihrem Play-Games-Konto.","p.sec8.title":"Deine Rechte","p.sec9.body":"Wir können diese Datenschutzerklärung gelegentlich aktualisieren — z. B. wenn wir neue Titel hinzufügen, Werbepartner wechseln oder Abo-Mechaniken anpassen. Das Datum „Zuletzt aktualisiert“ oben gibt an, wann die letzte Änderung erfolgte. Wesentliche Änderungen werden in der App beim nächsten Start widergespiegelt.","p.sec9.title":"Änderungen dieser Erklärung","p.summary.1.desc":"Spielstand, Einstellungen, Bestwerte, Ihr Münzguthaben und ein zwischengespeichertes Premium-Kennzeichen. Nichts davon erreicht einen Server von uns. In Blocklix kann Androids eigenes Backup es in Ihr eigenes Google-Konto kopieren (§1d).","p.summary.1.title":"Was auf deinem Gerät bleibt","p.summary.2.desc":"Zahlungsdetails, deine Google-Konto-E-Mail, Konto-IDs, Kontakte, Fotos oder Standort über die IP-basierte Schätzung der Werbenetzwerke hinaus.","p.summary.2.title":"Was wir nie sehen","p.summary.3.desc":"Kostenlose Spielerinnen und Spieler sehen Banner und Interstitials über die Appodeal-Mediation, in Blocklix zusätzlich App-Open-Anzeigen. Premium — oder in Blocklix der Einmalkauf „Werbung entfernen“ — schaltet sie ab. Rewarded-Videos sind für alle freiwillig: sie laufen nur, wenn Sie ein Angebot antippen.","p.summary.3.title":"Werbung vs. Premium","p.summary.4.desc":"Die Werbe-SDKs können Ihre Google Advertising ID und die Android-Geräte-ID lesen, um Anzeigen auszuliefern und ihre Häufigkeit zu begrenzen. Unser eigener Code liest keine von beiden, und keine hat mit Ihrem Abo zu tun. Beide IDs lassen sich in den Android-Einstellungen zurücksetzen.","p.summary.4.title":"Geräte-Identifikatoren","p.summary.heading":"Die Kurzfassung","p.table.cloud.onSignIn":"Aktiv, sobald Sie sich bei Play Games anmelden","p.table.cloud.optional":"Optional, standardmäßig aus","p.table.col.what":"Funktion","p.table.fb.all":"Analytics, Crashlytics, Remote Config","p.table.fb.core":"Analytics, Crashlytics","p.table.intro":"Diese Erklärung gilt für alle Apps, die wir veröffentlichen, und die Apps sind nicht identisch. Wo sie sich unterscheiden, steht es hier; alles Übrige in diesem Dokument gilt für beide.","p.table.no":"Nein","p.table.oneTime.yes":"Münzpakete, Starterpaket, Sparschwein, Werbung entfernen","p.table.plans.2":"Monatlich, jährlich","p.table.plans.3":"Wöchentlich, monatlich, jährlich","p.table.row.appOpen":"App-Open-Anzeigen","p.table.row.backup":"Androids eigenes Backup","p.table.row.cloudSave":"Play-Games-Cloud-Speicherstand","p.table.row.firebase":"Google Firebase","p.table.row.oneTime":"Einmalkäufe","p.table.row.plans":"Abo-Pläne","p.table.row.settings":"Datenschutzeinstellungen in der App","p.table.title":"Worin sich unsere Spiele unterscheiden","p.table.yes":"Ja","p.toc.1":"1. Welche Informationen wir erfassen","p.toc.10":"10. Kontakt","p.toc.2":"2. Werbepartner","p.toc.3":"3. Abos & Play Billing","p.toc.4":"4. Rechtsgrundlage (GDPR)","p.toc.5":"5. CCPA / US-Gesetze","p.toc.6":"6. Kinder-Datenschutz","p.toc.7":"7. Datenspeicherung","p.toc.8":"8. Deine Rechte","p.toc.9":"9. Änderungen dieser Erklärung","p.toc.aria":"Inhaltsverzeichnis","p.toc.title":"Auf dieser Seite","press.aboutBody":"Vaslix Games ist ein unabhängiger Android-Publisher, gegründet 2025. Wir bauen kleine, fokussierte Puzzlespiele mit einer Privacy-First-Haltung: keine Konten, keine eigenen Server, die Nutzerdaten speichern, keine Inhouse-Analytics. Zwei Titel sind auf Google Play: Gridlix:2048 und Blocklix, ein 8×8-Blockpuzzle mit sechs Schwierigkeitsstufen, 38 Themes und 60 Rängen, lokalisiert in 12 Sprachen.","press.aboutEyebrow":"Pressekit","press.aboutTitle":"Über das Studio","press.assetBlocklix":"Blocklix-Icon","press.assetGridlix":"Gridlix:2048-Icon","press.assetLockup":"Wortmarke","press.assetLockupDark":"Wortmarke für dunkle Hintergründe","press.assetMark":"Studio-Zeichen","press.assetsEyebrow":"Downloads","press.assetsIntro":"Icons und Logo genau so, wie sie ausgeliefert werden. Bitte unverändert verwenden — nicht umfärben, nicht beschneiden.","press.assetsTitle":"Brand-Assets","press.contactEyebrow":"Pressekit","press.contactTitle":"Pressekontakt","press.copied":"Kopiert","press.copyBtn":"Text kopieren","press.eyebrow":"Pressekit","press.fact.contact":"Kontakt","press.fact.founded":"Gegründet","press.fact.langs":"Sprachen","press.fact.money":"Geschäftsmodell","press.fact.money.v":"Kostenlos mit Werbung · optionales Premium über Google Play Billing","press.fact.people":"Team","press.fact.platform":"Plattform","press.fact.studio":"Studio","press.fact.titles":"Titel","press.factsEyebrow":"Faktenblatt","press.factsTitle":"Die Zahlen, bereits geprüft","press.lede":"Alles, was die Presse braucht, an einem Ort und frei verwendbar.","press.sla":"Es antwortet ein Mensch, meist innerhalb von fünf Werktagen. Schreib uns dein Medium, deine Deadline und was du brauchst — das reicht für eine brauchbare Antwort schon beim ersten Mal.","press.title":"Für Presse & Partner","principles.eyebrow":"Grundsätze","principles.intro":"Sie einzuhalten ist billiger, als sie wegzuerklären — und darum bleiben die Apps klein.","principles.title":"Vier Regeln, die bleiben","privacy.eyebrow":"Deine Daten","privacyCta.btn":"Erklärung lesen","privacyCta.text":"Alles, was ein Spiel über dich weiß, liegt in deinem Telefon. Die Datenschutzerklärung nennt genau, was das ist, welche Werbenetzwerke für Gratis-Spieler geladen werden und warum jede Zahlung über Google läuft statt über uns.","privacyCta.title":"Wir betreiben keinen einzigen Server","road.eyebrow":"Das lange Spiel","road.families":"Die fünfzehn Familien","road.intro":"Alles hier unten wird erspielt. Nichts davon wird verkauft.","road.missionsD":"Dreizehn tägliche Arten, die mit deinem Rang wachsen, zwei wöchentliche und eine Truhe für die Woche, die du durchhältst.","road.missionsT":"Tages- und Wochenmissionen","road.questsD":"Je fünf Schritte, vom ersten Abräumen bis zu denen, die fast niemand erreicht.","road.questsT":"21 Erfolgsketten","road.ranksD":"Fünfzehn Familien zu je vier. Punkte sind deine Wertung, gewichtet mit der gewählten Schwierigkeit.","road.ranksT":"60 Ränge","road.title":"Ein Weg, kein Laufband","roadmap.cta":"Der ganze Fahrplan","roadmap.eyebrow":"Roadmap","roadmap.intro":"Zwei veröffentlicht, eines auf dem Papier. Nichts hier setzt sich in Bewegung, bevor das Vorherige fertig ist.","roadmap.note":"Termine werden hier nicht versprochen — die Reihenfolge schon.","roadmap.r1.desc":"Bei Google Play erschienen. Ein 4×4-Merge-Puzzle mit einem Daily für alle, Monatsmedaillen, fünf Boostern und optionalem werbefreiem Premium.","roadmap.r1.meta":"Veröffentlicht · 2026","roadmap.r1.title":"Gridlix:2048","roadmap.r2.desc":"Live auf Google Play. 8×8-Drop-and-Clear-Puzzle mit sechs Schwierigkeitsstufen, 38 Themes, 60 Rängen, vier Boostern, Tages- und Wochenmissionen und optionalem werbefreiem Premium.","roadmap.r2.meta":"Veröffentlicht · 2026","roadmap.r2.title":"Blocklix","roadmap.r3.desc":"Ein Wortpuzzle, noch auf dem Papier. Gleiche Form wie die anderen zwei: klein, offline, ohne Konto und mit einem Premium, das nur die Werbung entfernt.","roadmap.r3.meta":"Später","roadmap.r3.title":"Wordlix","roadmap.title":"Wohin wir gehen","shelf.count.idea":"auf dem Papier","shelf.count.live":"bei Google Play","shelf.count.open":"Plätze bleiben frei","shelf.count.soon":"in Arbeit","shelf.eyebrow":"Das Regal","shelf.intro":"Ein Panel je Titel, in der Reihenfolge ihrer Entstehung. Das letzte ist absichtlich leer — das Regal ist auf das Kommende ausgelegt, nicht auf das Vorhandene.","shelf.more":"Seite öffnen","shelf.next":"Nächster Titel","shelf.open.body":"Ist ein Titel fertig, nimmt er diesen Platz im gleichen Rahmen ein und schiebt den leeren weiter. An der Seite ändert sich nichts.","shelf.open.meta":"Noch ohne Namen","shelf.open.title":"Hier landet der nächste","shelf.prev":"Vorheriger Titel","shelf.railAria":"Das Studio-Regal","shelf.title":"Zwei im Regal. Platz bleibt für mehr.","status.dev":"In Arbeit","status.idea":"Auf dem Papier","status.live":"Bei Google Play","status.open":"Freier Platz","story.eyebrow":"Die kurze Fassung","story.p1":"Vaslix Games ist eine Person. Das ist keine Leidensgeschichte, sondern die Randbedingung, aus der alles Weitere folgt. Ein Ein-Personen-Studio kann kein Login-System, keine Serverflotte und keinen Support-Desk betreiben — also baut es sie nicht, und die Spiele werden dadurch besser.","story.p2":"Übrig bleibt, was Spielende wirklich anfassen: das Feld, das Timing, das Gefühl eines einrastenden Teils. Jede Stunde, die in einen Anmeldeprozess geflossen wäre, fließt in die Schwierigkeitskurve.","story.p3":"Der Katalog wächst langsam, und zwar absichtlich. Ein Titel erscheint, wenn er fertig ist, bekommt jahrelang Updates und wird nie stillschweigend zu einem Dienst mit Anmeldung.","story.title":"Warum die Apps klein bleiben","themes.eyebrow":"38 Themes","themes.free":"Kostenlos ab Installation","themes.intro":"Vier gehören dir ab Installation. Der Rest wird mit Sternen verdient oder kommt mit Premium — und jedes verändert Himmel, Steine und die Art, wie eine abgeräumte Linie aufleuchtet.","themes.tap":"Tippe ein Theme an, um das Feld einzukleiden","themes.title":"Jedes Feld trägt eine Palette","trust.1.desc":"Es gibt keine Anmeldung. Dein Fortschritt verlässt nie das Telefon, auf dem er entstanden ist.","trust.1.title":"Keine Konten","trust.2.desc":"Die Zahlung nimmt Google Play entgegen. Deine Karte erreicht uns nie — sie läuft gar nicht erst über uns.","trust.2.title":"Keine Zahlungsdaten gespeichert","trust.3.desc":"Einwilligung, bevor die erste Anzeige lädt, ein Opt-out, wo das Gesetz eines verlangt, und eine Datenschutzerklärung, die jede beteiligte Firma nennt.","trust.3.title":"GDPR · CCPA · COPPA","trust.4.desc":"Premium schaltet Banner, Interstitials und App-Open-Anzeigen ab. Rewarded Videos bleiben für alle verfügbar und starten nur, wenn du eines antippst. Mehr ist es nicht.","trust.4.title":"Premium entfernt Werbung"},"fr":{"about.eyebrow":"À propos","about.lede":"Une personne, deux jeux sur Google Play, pas de bureau. <strong>De petites apps, faites avec soin, qui respectent votre appareil et votre attention.</strong> Rien où se connecter, rien de vous sur un serveur à nous, et aucun investisseur pour demander pourquoi la monétisation est si discrète.","about.stats.apps":"apps publiées","about.stats.langs":"langues prises en charge","about.stats.people":"personne au studio","about.stats.since":"publie depuis","about.title":"Un petit studio avec une vue lointaine","also.cta":"Retour à l'étagère","also.eyebrow":"Aussi du studio","also.title":"Le reste de l'étagère","card.blocklix.desc":"Posez des formes sur un plateau 8×8, nettoyez lignes et carrés, enchaînez les combos pour de gros multiplicateurs. Six niveaux de difficulté, 38 thèmes, 60 rangs sur 21 chaînes de succès, quatre boosters, missions quotidiennes et hebdomadaires avec coffre de série, et un vestiaire de cosmétiques. Premium optionnel sans pub, étoiles ×2 et cadeau quotidien.","card.blocklix.genre":"Puzzle","card.gridlix.desc":"Un puzzle de fusion 4×4 pour Android. Le Quotidien est tiré de la date : tout le monde reçoit le même plateau, noté sur trois étoiles ; une série avec boucliers survit à une soirée manquée, et un mois terminé vaut une médaille. Cinq boosters à trois usages chacun par partie, cinq thèmes de couleur, un retour haptique réglé et un Premium sans publicité en option.","contact.btn":"Envoyer un e-mail","contact.eyebrow":"Contact","contact.text":"Bugs, idées, questions presse et propositions arrivent dans la même boîte. En cas de plantage, indiquez l'appareil et la version d'Android.","contact.title":"Écrivez, une personne répond","cta.play":"Disponible sur Google Play","diff.eyebrow":"Six niveaux de difficulté","diff.intro":"Seul le générateur de pièces change. Score, plateau et rangs sont identiques à chaque palier — plus dur veut seulement dire que les pièces cessent de vous aider.","diff.note":"Les paliers hauts paient plus d'étoiles par point. Facile en paie moins, et ne prétend jamais le contraire.","diff.title":"Choisissez la longueur de votre partie","f.boosters":"boosters","f.daily":"Quotidien noté","f.difficulties":"difficultés","f.languages":"langues","f.ranks":"rangs","f.themes":"thèmes","faq.a1":"Résiliez depuis <strong>Google Play → Abonnements</strong>, ou via le bouton « Gérer » dans l'app — il pointe vers la même page. La résiliation prend effet à la fin de votre période de facturation en cours.","faq.a2":"La progression vit sur votre appareil. Dans Blocklix, le service de sauvegarde d'Android la copie dans votre compte Google, donc réinstaller avec le même compte la récupère généralement ; dans Gridlix:2048, ce service est désactivé, et la partie y est perdue à la désinstallation, sauf si vous utilisez la sauvegarde cloud de Play Games. Nous n'envoyons jamais de sauvegarde sur un serveur à nous. Premium se restaure tout seul dès que vous réinstallez et que vous vous connectez au même compte Google.","faq.a3":"Pas nous. Notre propre code n'y touche jamais — ce sont les SDK publicitaires embarqués dans l'app, pour plafonner la fréquence des pubs et attribuer les installations. Avec Premium, ou l'achat Sans pub dans Blocklix, il n'est plus utilisé pour les bannières, les interstitiels ou les pubs à l'ouverture ; il reste traité si vous choisissez de regarder une vidéo récompensée. La <a href=\"./privacy-policy.html\">Politique de confidentialité</a> nomme chaque SDK qui le lit.","faq.a4":"Android 8.0 (API 26) et plus. C'est voulu : un téléphone passé deux fois de main en main doit encore les faire tourner.","faq.a5":"Blocklix sort en 12 langues : anglais, russe, allemand, espagnol, français, italien, japonais, coréen, portugais (Brésil), turc, arabe et chinois simplifié. Gridlix:2048 en couvre moins. La langue système est détectée au premier lancement et modifiable dans les réglages de l'app.","faq.a6":"Écrivez à <a href=\"mailto:vaslixofficial@protonmail.com\">vaslixofficial@protonmail.com</a> avec une brève description. Les captures et le modèle d'appareil aident beaucoup. Nous lisons chaque message.","faq.a7":"Pas dans la feuille de route. Une personne peut tenir deux jeux Android à jour pendant des années ; deux plateformes, et aucun des deux n'y aurait droit. Si le catalogue grandit assez pour changer le calcul, ce sera écrit ici.","faq.a8":"Non. Premium enlève bannières et interstitiels, double les étoiles d'une partie et ajoute un cadeau quotidien et les thèmes premium. Chaque niveau, rang et mission est le même pour tous.","faq.eyebrow":"FAQ","faq.q1":"Comment résilier mon abonnement ?","faq.q2":"Que devient ma progression si je désinstalle ?","faq.q3":"Qui lit l'Advertising ID ?","faq.q4":"Quelles versions d'Android sont prises en charge ?","faq.q5":"Quelles langues sont prises en charge ?","faq.q6":"J'ai trouvé un bug ou j'ai une suggestion.","faq.q7":"Y aura-t-il une version iOS ?","faq.q8":"Premium change-t-il la façon de jouer ?","faq.title":"Questions fréquentes","footer.builtWith":"HTML écrit à la main. Aucun traceur sur ce site.","footer.contactTitle":"Contact","footer.copyright":"© Vaslix Games · Studio Android indépendant","footer.games":"Jeux","footer.gamesAria":"Jeux","footer.made":"Fait dans une pièce, joué en douze langues.","footer.privacyLink":"Politique de confidentialité","footer.replyTime":"Réponse en général sous cinq jours ouvrés.","footer.studio":"Studio","footer.studioAria":"Liens du studio","g.blocklix.blurb":"Posez des formes sur un plateau 8×8, nettoyez lignes et carrés, enchaînez les combos pour de gros multiplicateurs. Six niveaux de difficulté, 38 thèmes, 60 rangs sur 21 chaînes de succès, quatre boosters, missions quotidiennes et hebdomadaires avec coffre de série, et un vestiaire de cosmétiques. Premium optionnel sans pub, étoiles ×2 et cadeau quotidien.","g.blocklix.boosters.eyebrow":"Boosters","g.blocklix.boosters.intro":"Chacun s'achète avec des étoiles gagnées en jouant. Aucun ne s'achète séparément avec de l'argent.","g.blocklix.boosters.note":"Les étoiles viennent des parties terminées, des missions et des rangs. Premium double ce que rapporte une partie ; il ne vend pas les boosters.","g.blocklix.boosters.title":"Quatre issues à un plateau bouché","g.blocklix.chip.1":"Plateau 8×8","g.blocklix.chip.2":"Joue hors ligne","g.blocklix.chip.3":"Sans compte","g.blocklix.difficulty.eyebrow":"Six niveaux de difficulté","g.blocklix.difficulty.intro":"Seul le générateur de pièces change. Score, plateau et rangs sont identiques à chaque palier — plus dur veut seulement dire que les pièces cessent de vous aider.","g.blocklix.difficulty.note":"Les paliers hauts paient plus d'étoiles par point. Facile en paie moins, et ne prétend jamais le contraire.","g.blocklix.difficulty.title":"Choisissez la longueur de votre partie","g.blocklix.genre":"Puzzle","g.blocklix.how.1.d":"Trois pièces à la fois. Chacune va où elle rentre ; rien ne tourne, rien ne tombe.","g.blocklix.how.1.t":"Posez","g.blocklix.how.2.d":"Remplissez une ligne ou une colonne et elle disparaît. Remplissez les deux d'un coup et le plateau vous le dit.","g.blocklix.how.2.t":"Nettoyez","g.blocklix.how.3.d":"Nettoyez sur des coups consécutifs et le multiplicateur grimpe. Un petit tic prévient quand une ligne est sur le point de partir.","g.blocklix.how.3.t":"Combo","g.blocklix.how.eyebrow":"Comment on joue","g.blocklix.how.intro":"Blocklix, c'est le 8×8 « pose et nettoie » que vous avez déjà vu — réglé jusqu'à ce que chacun de ces trois gestes tombe juste sous le doigt.","g.blocklix.how.title":"Trois gestes que vous connaissez déjà","g.blocklix.openAria":"Ouvrir la page de Blocklix","g.blocklix.palettes.eyebrow":"38 thèmes","g.blocklix.palettes.free":"Gratuit dès l'installation","g.blocklix.palettes.intro":"Quatre sont à vous dès l'installation. Les autres se gagnent en étoiles ou viennent avec Premium — et chacun change le ciel, les blocs et la façon dont une ligne nettoyée s'allume.","g.blocklix.palettes.tap":"Touchez un thème pour habiller le plateau","g.blocklix.palettes.title":"Chaque plateau porte une palette","g.blocklix.playAria":"Blocklix sur Google Play","g.blocklix.premium.1":"Bannières, interstitiels et publicités à l'ouverture s'éteignent","g.blocklix.premium.2":"Une partie rapporte deux fois plus d'étoiles","g.blocklix.premium.3":"Un cadeau quotidien et les thèmes premium","g.blocklix.premium.4":"Toutes les difficultés, tous les rangs et toutes les missions restent identiques","g.blocklix.premium.eyebrow":"Premium","g.blocklix.premium.intro":"Premium retire ce qui gêne et accélère ce que vous gagnez déjà. Il ne débloque ni niveau, ni rang, ni mission.","g.blocklix.premium.note":"Les vidéos récompensées restent facultatives pour tous : elles ne se lancent que si vous appuyez sur le bouton.","g.blocklix.premium.title":"Ce que l'argent change — et ce qu'il ne touche jamais","g.blocklix.progress.eyebrow":"Le jeu long","g.blocklix.progress.families":"Les quinze familles","g.blocklix.progress.intro":"Tout ce qui suit se gagne en jouant. Rien ici n'est à vendre.","g.blocklix.progress.missions.d":"Treize types quotidiens qui montent avec votre rang, deux hebdomadaires et un coffre pour la semaine tenue.","g.blocklix.progress.missions.t":"Missions quotidiennes et hebdomadaires","g.blocklix.progress.quests.d":"Cinq étapes chacune, du premier nettoyage à celles que presque personne n'atteint.","g.blocklix.progress.quests.t":"21 chaînes de succès","g.blocklix.progress.ranks.d":"Quinze familles de quatre. Les points sont votre score, pondéré par la difficulté choisie.","g.blocklix.progress.ranks.t":"60 rangs","g.blocklix.progress.title":"Une route, pas un tapis roulant","g.blocklix.tagline":"Posez trois pièces, effacez la ligne, gardez le combo en vie.","g.gridlix.blurb":"Un puzzle de fusion 4×4 pour Android. Le Quotidien est tiré de la date : tout le monde reçoit le même plateau, noté sur trois étoiles ; une série avec boucliers survit à une soirée manquée, et un mois terminé vaut une médaille. Cinq boosters à trois usages chacun par partie, cinq thèmes de couleur, un retour haptique réglé et un Premium sans publicité en option.","g.gridlix.boosters.delete.d":"Supprime une tuile désignée.","g.gridlix.boosters.eyebrow":"Boosters","g.gridlix.boosters.intro":"La limite est par partie, pas par jour : un booster est une décision en cours de partie, pas une réserve.","g.gridlix.boosters.note":"En version gratuite, chaque usage se paie par une vidéo récompensée que vous choisissez de regarder ; Premium saute la vidéo et le compteur. N'en utiliser aucun, c'est la troisième étoile du Quotidien.","g.gridlix.boosters.shuffle.d":"Réarrange ce qui est là, sans rien ajouter.","g.gridlix.boosters.swap.d":"Échange deux tuiles de place.","g.gridlix.boosters.title":"Cinq, trois usages chacun","g.gridlix.boosters.undo.d":"Annule le dernier coup, tuile apparue comprise.","g.gridlix.boosters.value_clear.d":"Balaie du plateau toutes les tuiles d'une même valeur.","g.gridlix.chip.1":"Plateau 4×4","g.gridlix.chip.2":"Quotidien + infini","g.gridlix.chip.3":"Widget d'accueil","g.gridlix.daily.eyebrow":"Le Quotidien","g.gridlix.daily.intro":"Une graine tirée de la date construit la position de départ et tout le flux de tuiles : le plateau que vous regardez est celui de tout le monde.","g.gridlix.daily.seed.d":"L'ouverture est jouée d'avance par un bot scripté, et son nombre de coups fixe le par sur lequel vous êtes jugé. Plusieurs essais par jour ; le meilleur compte.","g.gridlix.daily.seed.t":"Une graine, un plateau","g.gridlix.daily.star.1":"Atteindre la tuile visée dans la limite de coups.","g.gridlix.daily.star.2":"Le faire dans le par — le nombre de coups du bot.","g.gridlix.daily.star.3":"Dans le par et sans toucher un seul booster.","g.gridlix.daily.title":"Le même puzzle que tout le monde","g.gridlix.genre":"Puzzle","g.gridlix.how.1.d":"Une direction déplace toutes les tuiles d'un coup. Pas de demi-coup.","g.gridlix.how.1.t":"Balayez","g.gridlix.how.2.d":"Deux tuiles identiques qui se touchent n'en font plus qu'une, deux fois plus grande. Une tuile fusionne une fois par coup.","g.gridlix.how.2.t":"Fusionnez","g.gridlix.how.3.d":"En infini, l'objectif est votre record. Dans le Quotidien, c'est une tuile donnée en un nombre de coups donné.","g.gridlix.how.3.t":"Atteindre l'objectif","g.gridlix.how.eyebrow":"Comment ça se joue","g.gridlix.how.intro":"Rien à apprendre au-delà du balayage. Ensuite, c'est de l'arithmétique et du sang-froid.","g.gridlix.how.title":"Un seul geste, jusqu'au bout","g.gridlix.month.eyebrow":"Le mois","g.gridlix.month.intro":"Une soirée manquée ne devrait pas effacer quatre mois. Les boucliers absorbent un oubli, et le calendrier garde tout le mois sous les yeux.","g.gridlix.month.legend.done":"Joué","g.gridlix.month.legend.miss":"Manqué","g.gridlix.month.legend.shield":"Protégé","g.gridlix.month.medals.d":"Un mois terminé est noté une fois, conservé pour toujours et affiché dans la vitrine à côté de votre meilleure série.","g.gridlix.month.medals.t":"Médailles mensuelles","g.gridlix.month.streak.d":"Un bouclier se dépense automatiquement le jour manqué et se regagne en jouant. La série survit à une mauvaise semaine ordinaire.","g.gridlix.month.streak.t":"Boucliers","g.gridlix.month.title":"Une série que l'on peut vraiment tenir","g.gridlix.openAria":"Ouvrir la page de Gridlix:2048","g.gridlix.playAria":"Gridlix:2048 sur Google Play","g.gridlix.premium.1":"Aucune bannière ni interstitiel, nulle part","g.gridlix.premium.2":"Des boosters sans vidéo préalable","g.gridlix.premium.3":"Des continuations quand le plateau est plein","g.gridlix.premium.4":"Les quatre palettes verrouillées s'ouvrent","g.gridlix.premium.eyebrow":"Premium","g.gridlix.premium.intro":"Un abonnement via Google Play, mensuel ou annuel, avec essai gratuit sur la formule annuelle. Résiliable à tout moment depuis Play.","g.gridlix.premium.note":"Le Quotidien, ses étoiles, la série et les médailles fonctionnent pareil, que vous payiez ou non.","g.gridlix.premium.title":"Jouer sans interruptions","g.gridlix.tagline":"Un plateau, un puzzle quotidien — le même pour tous.","g.gridlix.themes.eyebrow":"Palettes","g.gridlix.themes.free":"Gratuit","g.gridlix.themes.intro":"La palette change les tuiles, l'accent et la lueur — jamais une règle. Ce sont les vraies couleurs, tirées de l'appli.","g.gridlix.themes.premium":"Premium","g.gridlix.themes.title":"Cinq palettes, un plateau","g.words.chip.1":"Mots","g.words.chip.2":"Prototype","g.words.tagline":"Un puzzle de mots, encore sur le papier. Même forme : petit, silencieux, hors ligne.","g.words.when":"Pas encore de date","gd.blocklix.booster.bomb.desc":"Fait sauter une zone 3×3 en un instant","gd.blocklix.booster.bomb.name":"Bombe","gd.blocklix.booster.hammer.desc":"Casse n'importe quel bloc","gd.blocklix.booster.hammer.name":"Marteau","gd.blocklix.booster.lightning.desc":"Foudroie une ligne et une colonne entières d'un seul coup","gd.blocklix.booster.lightning.name":"Éclair","gd.blocklix.booster.shuffle.desc":"Échange tes pièces contre trois nouvelles","gd.blocklix.booster.shuffle.name":"Mélange","gd.blocklix.diff.easy.desc":"Des parties longues et tranquilles. Moins d'étoiles.","gd.blocklix.diff.easy.name":"Facile","gd.blocklix.diff.expert.desc":"Chaque nouvelle série de pièces est un casse-tête.","gd.blocklix.diff.expert.name":"Expert","gd.blocklix.diff.hard.desc":"Les grandes pièces arrivent plus tôt.","gd.blocklix.diff.hard.name":"Difficile","gd.blocklix.diff.insane.desc":"Pur hasard. Les pièces peuvent ne pas rentrer du tout.","gd.blocklix.diff.insane.name":"Démence","gd.blocklix.diff.master.desc":"Seuls les plus futés survivent. Pas de pièces faciles.","gd.blocklix.diff.master.name":"Maître","gd.blocklix.diff.normal.desc":"Rythme classique : dix minutes.","gd.blocklix.diff.normal.name":"Normal","gd.blocklix.rank.bronze":"Bronze","gd.blocklix.rank.celestial":"Céleste","gd.blocklix.rank.cosmic":"Cosmique","gd.blocklix.rank.diamond":"Diamant","gd.blocklix.rank.emerald":"Émeraude","gd.blocklix.rank.eternal":"Éternel","gd.blocklix.rank.gold":"Or","gd.blocklix.rank.grandmaster":"Grand Maître","gd.blocklix.rank.legend":"Légende","gd.blocklix.rank.master":"Maître","gd.blocklix.rank.mythic":"Mythique","gd.blocklix.rank.platinum":"Platine","gd.blocklix.rank.ruby":"Rubis","gd.blocklix.rank.silver":"Argent","gd.blocklix.rank.stone":"Pierre","gd.gridlix.booster.delete.name":"Supprimer","gd.gridlix.booster.shuffle.name":"Mélanger","gd.gridlix.booster.swap.name":"Échange","gd.gridlix.booster.undo.name":"Annuler","gd.gridlix.booster.value_clear.name":"Nettoyage","gd.gridlix.medal.bronze":"Bronze","gd.gridlix.medal.gold":"Or","gd.gridlix.medal.silver":"Argent","gp.back":"Tous les titres","hero.cta.games":"Nos jeux","hero.cta.studio":"À propos du studio","hero.kick":"Studio Android indépendant","hero.lede":"Deux jeux de puzzle, faits par une seule personne. Pas de compte, pas de serveur à nous, douze langues — et un Premium qui fait exactement une chose : il enlève les pubs.","hero.scroll":"Défiler","hero.t1":"De petits jeux.","hero.t2":"Faits pour durer.","how.eyebrow":"Comment on joue","how.intro":"Blocklix, c'est le 8×8 « pose et nettoie » que vous avez déjà vu — réglé jusqu'à ce que chacun de ces trois gestes tombe juste sous le doigt.","how.s1d":"Trois pièces à la fois. Chacune va où elle rentre ; rien ne tourne, rien ne tombe.","how.s1t":"Posez","how.s2d":"Remplissez une ligne ou une colonne et elle disparaît. Remplissez les deux d'un coup et le plateau vous le dit.","how.s2t":"Nettoyez","how.s3d":"Nettoyez sur des coups consécutifs et le multiplicateur grimpe. Un petit tic prévient quand une ligne est sur le point de partir.","how.s3t":"Combo","how.title":"Trois gestes que vous connaissez déjà","meta.blocklix.desc":"Posez trois pièces sur un plateau 8×8, effacez lignes et colonnes, enchaînez les combos. 38 thèmes, 60 rangs, six difficultés, douze langues. Sans compte.","meta.blocklix.title":"Blocklix — un puzzle 8×8 : poser et effacer | Vaslix Games","meta.description":"Vaslix Games est un studio Android indépendant qui publie des jeux de puzzle compacts et soignés. Gridlix:2048 et Blocklix sont tous deux sur Google Play.","meta.gridlix.desc":"Un puzzle de fusion 4×4 avec un Quotidien identique pour tous, des boucliers de série, des médailles mensuelles et cinq boosters. Le mode infini ne finit jamais.","meta.gridlix.title":"Gridlix:2048 — un puzzle quotidien pour tous | Vaslix Games","meta.home.desc":"Vaslix Games est un studio Android indépendant qui publie des jeux de puzzle compacts et soignés. Gridlix:2048 et Blocklix sont tous deux sur Google Play.","meta.home.title":"Vaslix Games — petits puzzles Android, faits pour durer","meta.notFound.desc":"Cette adresse ne mène nulle part. L'étagère, si.","meta.notFound.title":"Page introuvable — Vaslix Games","meta.press.desc":"Présentation, fiche technique, icônes et contact pour la presse et les partenaires. Réponse sous environ cinq jours ouvrés.","meta.press.title":"Kit presse — Vaslix Games","meta.privacy.desc":"Comment Vaslix Games traite les données dans Gridlix:2048 et Blocklix. Résumé clair, politique complète, ce que chaque jeu stocke, notes GDPR/CCPA/COPPA.","meta.privacy.title":"Politique de confidentialité — Vaslix Games","meta.studio.desc":"Une personne, de petites applis Android, sans comptes ni serveurs à nous. Ce que nous faisons, nos règles, et la suite.","meta.studio.title":"Studio — Vaslix Games","meta.title":"Vaslix Games — petits puzzles Android, faits pour durer","nav.aria":"Navigation principale","nav.brand":"Vaslix Games","nav.games":"Jeux","nav.langLabel":"Changer de langue","nav.menu":"Menu","nav.press":"Presse","nav.privacy":"Confidentialité","nav.skip":"Aller au contenu","nav.studio":"Studio","nav.theme.auto":"Passer au thème automatique","nav.theme.dark":"Passer au thème sombre","nav.theme.light":"Passer au thème clair","nf.body":"L'adresse ne mène nulle part. L'étagère, elle, n'a pas bougé.","nf.eyebrow":"404","nf.games":"Voir l'étagère","nf.home":"Accueil","nf.title":"Cette case est vide","nums.accounts":"compte requis","nums.games":"jeux sur Google Play","nums.langs":"langues","nums.person":"personne","nums.servers":"serveurs à nous","nums.since":"publie depuis","nums.title":"Le studio en chiffres","p.changed.body":"Nous avons confronté cette politique au code source des deux applications et l'avons corrigée là où les deux divergeaient. Google AdMob n'est plus cité : aucune des deux ne l'embarque. L'affirmation selon laquelle l'identifiant Android est lu pour vérifier votre abonnement était fausse et a été supprimée. Les SDK publicitaires livrés dans le paquet de médiation Appodeal — Adjust, AppsFlyer, Meta Audience Network, Sentry et Yandex AppMetrica — sont désormais nommés au §2, de même que le Play Install Referrer, la requête des applications installées et les autorisations Privacy Sandbox. Le §1a énumère maintenant tout ce que les applications stockent réellement, y compris le journal des pièces et celui des publicités qui vous ont été montrées. La sauvegarde et le cloud diffèrent entre les deux jeux et sont désormais indiqués jeu par jeu au lieu d'être affirmés pour les deux. Les applications audio et podcast ne sont plus décrites : il n'en existe aucune.","p.changed.title":"Ce qui a changé dans cette révision","p.hero.chip.billing":"Google Play Billing","p.hero.chip.gdpr":"Conforme GDPR / CCPA / COPPA","p.hero.chip.updated":"Mis à jour","p.hero.eyebrow":"Résumé en langage clair, texte légal complet ci-dessous","p.hero.lede":"Comment Vaslix Games traite les informations dans nos applications Android. La politique s'applique de la même façon à tout ce que nous publions. Pas de comptes, pas de serveurs à nous, pas de surprises. <strong>Elle couvre Gridlix:2048 et Blocklix, tous deux sur Google Play — et le §1 montre en quoi les deux diffèrent.</strong>","p.hero.title":"Politique de confidentialité","p.sec1.backup":"<strong>La sauvegarde propre à Android est activée dans Blocklix et désactivée dans Gridlix:2048</strong> — le tableau ci-dessus indique lequel est lequel. Là où elle est active, et si la sauvegarde est activée sur votre appareil, Android copie les données locales listées en 1a dans votre compte Google personnel et les restaure lors d'une réinstallation sur le même compte. Cette copie vous appartient : Android la gère et la chiffre, et nous ne pouvons ni la lire ni la supprimer. Vous la contrôlez dans <em>Paramètres Android → Google → Sauvegarde</em>. Par ailleurs, les deux jeux disposent d'une sauvegarde cloud reposant sur Google Play Games Saved Games : un fichier dans votre propre espace Play Games, pour que la progression vous suive d'un appareil à l'autre. Elle ne fonctionne jamais sans connexion à Play Games, ne transporte que la progression de jeu — jamais l'état d'abonnement ni les données d'achat — et elle est servie par Google, pas par un serveur à nous. Dans Blocklix elle est livrée désactivée et s'active progressivement. Dans Gridlix:2048 elle se synchronise dès que vous êtes connecté à Play Games ; cette application n'a pas de déconnexion propre, il faut donc se déconnecter de Play Games depuis l'application Google Play Jeux. Gridlix:2048 débloque aussi des succès Play Games et envoie vos scores à deux classements Play Games.","p.sec1.body1a":"Chaque app stocke ce qui suit dans une base Room/SQLite locale (ou équivalent) sur votre appareil. Nous ne l'envoyons sur aucun serveur à nous ; là où la sauvegarde propre à Android est activée pour l'application, cela peut être copié dans votre compte Google personnel, comme décrit en 1d :","p.sec1.body1b":"Les services tiers décrits ci-dessous peuvent collecter automatiquement des informations techniques et publicitaires :","p.sec1.callout":"<strong>Ce qui n'est pas stocké localement :</strong> données de paiement, jetons d'achat et identifiants de compte Google. Rien de tout cela ne quitte Google Play.","p.sec1.deviceIdCallout":"<strong>Pourquoi nous le déclarons :</strong> le formulaire « Sécurité des données » de Google Play exige de déclarer toute lecture de l'Advertising ID et de l'identifiant d'appareil Android, que la valeur quitte ou non l'appareil. Vous pouvez réinitialiser l'Advertising ID à tout moment depuis <em>Paramètres Android → Confidentialité → Annonces</em> ; l'Android ID est régénéré lors d'une réinitialisation aux paramètres d'usine.","p.sec1.firebase":"Les deux applications intègrent <strong>Google Firebase Analytics</strong> et <strong>Firebase Crashlytics</strong> ; Blocklix intègre en plus <strong>Firebase Remote Config</strong>. Analytics collecte un identifiant d'instance d'application aléatoire, des informations sur l'appareil et le système, et des événements agrégés dans l'app — partie terminée, achat effectué, publicité affichée, avec les revenus et le nom du réseau rapportés pour cette impression — afin que nous comprenions l'usage global et équilibrions l'économie du jeu. Nous ne l'utilisons pas pour constituer des profils publicitaires. Remote Config télécharge un petit ensemble de drapeaux de fonctionnalité et de valeurs d'équilibrage et n'envoie aucune donnée personnelle au-delà des métadonnées techniques de la requête. Crashlytics envoie un rapport quand l'app plante ou se fige : la pile d'appels, le modèle de l'appareil, les versions du système et de l'app, et un identifiant d'installation aléatoire — de quoi trouver le bogue, et rien de ce que vous avez tapé ou joué. Crashlytics n'est pas le seul collecteur d'erreurs présent dans les builds ; voir le §2. Détails : <a href=\"https://firebase.google.com/support/privacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">firebase.google.com/support/privacy ↗</a>.","p.sec1.h3a":"1a. Stocké localement sur votre appareil","p.sec1.h3b":"1b. Collecté par des tiers pour notre compte","p.sec1.h3c":"1c. Analyse, rapports de plantage et configuration à distance (Google Firebase)","p.sec1.h3d":"1d. Sauvegarde et sauvegarde cloud","p.sec1.intro":"Nos apps ne nécessitent pas de création de compte et nous ne collectons pas sciemment d'informations personnelles directement. Les informations se répartissent en deux groupes.","p.sec1.list1a.1":"L'état propre à l'application : le plateau tel que vous l'avez laissé, votre score, les boosters et les reprises","p.sec1.list1a.2":"L'historique de vos meilleures parties et votre meilleur score, conservés uniquement en local","p.sec1.list1a.3":"Réglages de l'app : son activé ou non, retour haptique activé ou non, thème, notifications et préférences similaires","p.sec1.list1a.4":"Un indicateur de premier lancement, utilisé pour vous faire passer par l'introduction à la première ouverture","p.sec1.list1a.5":"Un résumé en cache de l'état de votre abonnement — actif ou non, quelle formule, l'identifiant du produit, si l'essai gratuit a été utilisé et quand il expire — afin que l'app applique vos droits au démarrage sans attendre le réseau","p.sec1.list1a.6":"Votre progression et l'économie du jeu : le solde de pièces et le journal complet de leurs mouvements, les missions quotidiennes et hebdomadaires, les succès, la progression de rang, les séries, les thèmes et cosmétiques débloqués, la progression par difficulté, le résultat de chaque Daily et les médailles mensuelles","p.sec1.list1a.7":"Un relevé des publicités qui vous ont été montrées — leur type, le moment, et les compteurs quotidiens qui en règlent le rythme — et, dans Gridlix:2048, les heures de la journée auxquelles vous jouez d'habitude, pour qu'un rappel arrive à une heure plausible plutôt qu'au hasard","p.sec1.list1b.1":"Google Advertising ID (GAID) — lu afin que les régies puissent diffuser des pubs, en limiter la fréquence et attribuer les installations. Avec Premium ou Supprimer les pubs actif, il n'est pas utilisé pour les bannières, interstitiels ou app-open ; il est toutefois traité lorsque vous choisissez explicitement de regarder une vidéo rewarded.","p.sec1.list1b.2":"Des identifiants liés à l'appareil, dont l'identifiant Android (SSAID). Notre propre code ne lit ni celui-ci ni l'identifiant publicitaire ; les deux peuvent être lus à l'intérieur des SDK publicitaires décrits au §2, pour la diffusion, la limitation de fréquence et les signaux de trafic invalide. Ils n'interviennent pas dans votre abonnement : ce droit vient directement de Google Play Billing.","p.sec1.list1b.3":"Adresse IP et localisation géographique approximative qui en dérive","p.sec1.list1b.4":"Modèle d'appareil, version du système, langue et fuseau horaire","p.sec1.list1b.5":"Version de l'app, horodatage des sessions et diagnostics de plantage","p.sec1.list1b.6":"Des événements d'usage agrégés et non identifiants, utilisés uniquement sous forme agrégée","p.sec1.list1b.7":"Le Play Install Referrer — la manière dont vous êtes arrivé sur la fiche de l'app — lu afin d'attribuer une installation à la campagne qui l'a produite","p.sec1.list1b.8":"La liste des applications installées sur votre appareil qui peuvent être lancées, ainsi que la vérification d'un petit ensemble de paquets connus de gestion du root. Rien de cela n'est lu par notre code : cela vient des SDK publicitaires livrés avec la médiation, qui s'en servent pour le ciblage et pour des signaux d'intégrité de l'appareil.","p.sec1.list1b.9":"Les signaux de l'Android Privacy Sandbox — Topics, Attribution Reporting, Protected Audience et le service Ad ID. Les applications déclarent les autorisations correspondantes afin que les SDK publicitaires utilisent des données d'intérêt et d'attribution fournies par le système d'exploitation plutôt que rassemblées par nous.","p.sec1.title":"Informations collectées","p.sec10.body":"Pour toute question de confidentialité sur l'une de nos apps, écrivez-nous à <a href=\"mailto:vaslixofficial@protonmail.com\">vaslixofficial@protonmail.com</a>. Nous essayons de répondre dans un délai raisonnable.","p.sec10.title":"Contact","p.sec2.appodeal1":"Nous utilisons <a href=\"https://www.appodeal.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Appodeal</a> comme partenaire principal de médiation publicitaire. La politique de confidentialité d'Appodeal est sur <a href=\"https://www.appodeal.com/privacy-policy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">appodeal.com/privacy-policy ↗</a>.","p.sec2.appodeal2":"Appodeal médie la demande d'un grand nombre de régies publicitaires ; l'ensemble actif évolue avec les mises à jour du SDK Appodeal et notre configuration de build. La liste actuelle et faisant foi est publiée par Appodeal :","p.sec2.appodeal3":"Chaque régie sur cette page renvoie à sa propre politique. Les questions de personnalisation publicitaire peuvent être adressées directement à Appodeal sur le même site.","p.sec2.bundled":"Le paquet Appodeal ne contient pas que des régies publicitaires. Les composants ci-dessous sont compilés dans nos versions de production, enregistrent leurs propres services et receivers, et sont démarrés par Appodeal et non par notre code — nous ne les appelons ni ne les configurons. Le formulaire Sécurité des données de Google Play demande ce qui est collecté, pas qui l'a initialisé : ils sont donc nommés ici en entier :","p.sec2.bundledList.1":"<a href=\"https://www.adjust.com/terms/privacy-policy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Adjust ↗</a> — attribution des installations","p.sec2.bundledList.2":"<a href=\"https://www.appsflyer.com/legal/services-privacy-policy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">AppsFlyer ↗</a> — attribution des installations, avec son propre receiver d'install referrer","p.sec2.bundledList.3":"<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/privacy/policy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Meta Audience Network ↗</a> — demande publicitaire et mesure","p.sec2.bundledList.4":"<a href=\"https://sentry.io/privacy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sentry ↗</a> — rapports d'erreurs et de plantages, envoyés au projet d'Appodeal et non à l'un des nôtres. C'est un second collecteur de plantages à côté de Firebase Crashlytics (§1c).","p.sec2.bundledList.5":"<a href=\"https://yandex.com/legal/confidential/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yandex AppMetrica ↗</a> — analytique, livrée avec l’adaptateur publicitaire Yandex","p.sec2.callout":"<strong>Les abonnés Premium — et, dans Blocklix, quiconque a acheté Sans publicité — ne voient ni bannières, ni interstitiels, ni publicités à l'ouverture.</strong> Les vidéos récompensées ne sont imposées à personne : gratuit ou payant, elles ne démarrent qu'après avoir touché explicitement une offre. Un trafic d'initialisation limité vers les régies a tout de même lieu au démarrage de l'app, avant que vos droits soient résolus.","p.sec2.h3a":"Médiation Appodeal","p.sec2.h3c":"Ce qui est livré dans le SDK de médiation","p.sec2.intro":"Nos applications affichent des bannières, des interstitiels occasionnels et des vidéos récompensées que vous choisissez explicitement de regarder en échange d'un avantage en jeu — un booster, une reprise après une défaite, des pièces bonus et similaires. Blocklix affiche en plus des publicités à l'ouverture quand vous y revenez ; Gridlix:2048 n'en affiche pas. Un abonnement Premium désactive bannières, interstitiels et publicités à l'ouverture dans les deux jeux, et dans Blocklix l'achat unique Sans publicité fait de même. Les vidéos récompensées restent accessibles à tous et ne démarrent qu'après avoir touché leur offre.","p.sec2.title":"Partenaires publicitaires","p.sec3.intro":"Les deux applications proposent un abonnement Premium facultatif, vendu et traité par Google via Google Play Billing. Blocklix propose des formules à renouvellement automatique hebdomadaire, mensuelle et annuelle ; Gridlix:2048 propose mensuelle et annuelle. Les nouveaux abonnés éligibles bénéficient d'un essai gratuit d'introduction sur la formule annuelle. Premium désactive bannières, interstitiels et publicités à l'ouverture, et débloque des fonctions premium propres à chaque app — par exemple x2 pièces et un cadeau quotidien. Blocklix vend en plus des produits uniques : packs de pièces, pack de départ, versement de la tirelire et un déblocage permanent Sans publicité, de même portée que Premium. Gridlix:2048 ne vend aucun produit unique.","p.sec3.list.1":"Toutes les informations de paiement, facturation, compte et fiscalité sont collectées et traitées par Google. Nous ne voyons, ne stockons, ni ne transmettons votre moyen de paiement, votre e-mail Google ou des identifiants officiels.","p.sec3.list.2":"L'application ne reçoit de Google qu'un signal de droits non identifiant : l'existence d'un abonnement actif pour votre installation, de quel produit il s'agit et — dans Blocklix — quels produits uniques ont été achetés. Ce signal est mis en cache localement comme décrit au §1a.","p.sec3.list.3":"La gestion de l'abonnement, l'annulation, les demandes de remboursement et les dates de renouvellement sont entièrement gérées sur Google Play. Le bouton « Gérer » dans l'app renvoie vers la page d'abonnements Google Play.","p.sec3.list.4":"La politique de confidentialité de Google Play s'applique à tout le traitement lié à la facturation : <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">policies.google.com/privacy ↗</a>","p.sec3.title":"Abonnements et achats in-app (Google Play Billing)","p.sec4.body":"Si vous vous trouvez dans l'EEE, au Royaume-Uni ou en Suisse, la base légale du traitement publicitaire est votre consentement, recueilli via une fenêtre de l'IAB Transparency &amp; Consent Framework (TCF). Cette fenêtre est présentée par le SDK de médiation Appodeal lui-même, lorsque votre région l'exige ; nous n'exploitons aucune plateforme de consentement qui nous soit propre. Vous pouvez retirer ou modifier votre consentement à tout moment. Blocklix peut rouvrir la fenêtre depuis ses réglages de confidentialité dans l'application ; Gridlix:2048 n'a pas cet écran, il faut donc y effacer les données de l'app (Paramètres → Applications), ce qui réaffiche la fenêtre au lancement suivant. La base légale du traitement des données d'abonnement via Google Play Billing est l'exécution du contrat conclu lors de l'achat d'un abonnement.","p.sec4.title":"Base légale et consentement (GDPR / EEE, Royaume-Uni, Suisse)","p.sec5.body":"Si vous êtes résident de Californie ou d'un autre État applicable, vous avez le droit de refuser la « vente » ou le « partage » de vos informations personnelles à des fins publicitaires comportementales. Le dialogue de consentement dans l'app fournit cet opt-out là où il est requis. Le traitement de l'abonnement par Google Play n'est pas une « vente » d'informations personnelles.","p.sec5.title":"CCPA / lois d'État américaines sur la confidentialité","p.sec6.body":"Nos apps ne s'adressent pas aux enfants de moins de 13 ans (ou l'âge minimum équivalent dans votre juridiction). Nous ne collectons pas sciemment d'informations personnelles d'enfants. L'abonnement Premium est destiné à des acheteurs adultes ; les achats in-app nécessitent un compte Google Play avec les permissions adéquates.","p.sec6.title":"Vie privée des enfants (COPPA)","p.sec7.body":"Les données locales décrites au §1a restent sur votre appareil jusqu'à ce que vous effaciez les données de l'app ou la désinstalliez. Nous ne conservons aucune donnée personnelle sur des serveurs à nous. Là où la sauvegarde propre à Android est activée — Blocklix, pas Gridlix:2048 — la copie qu'elle réalise réside dans votre compte Google et se supprime dans Paramètres Android → Google → Sauvegarde. Une sauvegarde cloud Play Games réside dans votre compte Play Games et se supprime depuis celui-ci. Les partenaires publicitaires et Google Play conservent les données selon leurs propres politiques.","p.sec7.title":"Conservation des données","p.sec8.body":"Selon votre juridiction, vous pouvez avoir le droit d'accéder à vos données personnelles, les rectifier, les supprimer, les restreindre ou les porter, et de déposer une plainte auprès d'une autorité de contrôle. Comme nous ne détenons pas ces données directement, les demandes doivent être adressées au partenaire publicitaire concerné ou — pour les données de facturation — à Google Play.","p.sec8.callout":"Pour supprimer toutes les données locales de l'une ou l'autre application, désinstallez-la ou effacez son stockage depuis les paramètres de l'appareil (<em>Paramètres → Applications → [l'app] → Stockage → Effacer les données</em>). Cela efface la copie présente sur l'appareil. Une sauvegarde déjà réalisée par Android — Blocklix uniquement — se supprime dans <em>Paramètres Android → Google → Sauvegarde</em>, et une sauvegarde cloud Play Games depuis votre compte Play Games.","p.sec8.title":"Vos droits","p.sec9.body":"Nous pouvons mettre à jour cette Politique de confidentialité de temps à autre — par exemple lorsque nous ajoutons de nouveaux titres, changeons de partenaires publicitaires ou mettons à jour la mécanique d'abonnement. La date « Mis à jour » en haut de la page indique quand le dernier changement a été effectué. Les changements importants sont reflétés dans l'app au prochain lancement.","p.sec9.title":"Modifications de cette politique","p.summary.1.desc":"L'état du jeu, les réglages, les meilleurs scores, votre solde de pièces et un indicateur premium en cache. Rien de tout cela n'atteint un serveur à nous. Dans Blocklix, la sauvegarde propre à Android peut en faire une copie dans votre compte Google (§1d).","p.summary.1.title":"Ce qui reste sur votre appareil","p.summary.2.desc":"Données de paiement, votre e-mail Google, identifiants de compte, contacts, photos ou localisation au-delà de l'estimation par IP des régies publicitaires.","p.summary.2.title":"Ce que nous ne voyons jamais","p.summary.3.desc":"Les joueurs gratuits voient des bannières et des interstitiels via la médiation Appodeal, plus des publicités à l'ouverture dans Blocklix. Premium — ou, dans Blocklix, l'achat unique Sans publicité — les désactive. Les vidéos récompensées sont volontaires pour tous : elles ne se lancent qu'en touchant une offre.","p.summary.3.title":"Pubs vs Premium","p.summary.4.desc":"Les SDK publicitaires peuvent lire votre Google Advertising ID et l'identifiant Android pour diffuser les publicités et en limiter la fréquence. Notre propre code ne lit ni l'un ni l'autre, et aucun n'a de rapport avec votre abonnement. Les deux identifiants sont réinitialisables dans les paramètres Android.","p.summary.4.title":"Identifiants de l'appareil","p.summary.heading":"La version courte","p.table.cloud.onSignIn":"Activée dès la connexion à Play Games","p.table.cloud.optional":"Optionnelle, désactivée par défaut","p.table.col.what":"Fonction","p.table.fb.all":"Analytics, Crashlytics, Remote Config","p.table.fb.core":"Analytics, Crashlytics","p.table.intro":"Cette politique couvre toutes les apps que nous publions, et elles ne sont pas identiques. Là où elles diffèrent, elles diffèrent ici ; tout le reste du document vaut pour les deux.","p.table.no":"Non","p.table.oneTime.yes":"Packs de pièces, pack de départ, tirelire, Sans publicité","p.table.plans.2":"Mensuel, annuel","p.table.plans.3":"Hebdomadaire, mensuel, annuel","p.table.row.appOpen":"Publicités à l'ouverture","p.table.row.backup":"La sauvegarde propre à Android","p.table.row.cloudSave":"Sauvegarde cloud Play Games","p.table.row.firebase":"Google Firebase","p.table.row.oneTime":"Achats uniques","p.table.row.plans":"Formules d'abonnement","p.table.row.settings":"Réglages de confidentialité dans l'app","p.table.title":"Ce qui diffère entre nos jeux","p.table.yes":"Oui","p.toc.1":"1. Informations collectées","p.toc.10":"10. Contact","p.toc.2":"2. Partenaires publicitaires","p.toc.3":"3. Abonnements & Play Billing","p.toc.4":"4. Base légale (GDPR)","p.toc.5":"5. CCPA / lois d'État US","p.toc.6":"6. Vie privée des enfants","p.toc.7":"7. Conservation des données","p.toc.8":"8. Vos droits","p.toc.9":"9. Modifications de cette politique","p.toc.aria":"Table des matières","p.toc.title":"Sur cette page","press.aboutBody":"Vaslix Games est un éditeur Android indépendant fondé en 2025. Nous faisons de petits jeux de puzzle concentrés avec une approche privacy-first : pas de comptes, pas de serveurs maison stockant des données utilisateurs, pas d'analytics maison. Deux titres sont sur Google Play : Gridlix:2048 et Blocklix, un puzzle de blocs 8×8 avec six niveaux de difficulté, 38 thèmes et 60 rangs, localisé en 12 langues.","press.aboutEyebrow":"Kit presse","press.aboutTitle":"À propos du studio","press.assetBlocklix":"Icône Blocklix","press.assetGridlix":"Icône Gridlix:2048","press.assetLockup":"Logotype","press.assetLockupDark":"Logotype pour fond sombre","press.assetMark":"Marque du studio","press.assetsEyebrow":"Téléchargements","press.assetsIntro":"Icônes et logo tels qu'ils sont publiés. À utiliser tels quels : merci de ne pas les recolorer ni les recadrer.","press.assetsTitle":"Ressources de marque","press.contactEyebrow":"Kit presse","press.contactTitle":"Contact presse","press.copied":"Copié","press.copyBtn":"Copier le texte","press.eyebrow":"Kit presse","press.fact.contact":"Contact","press.fact.founded":"Fondé","press.fact.langs":"Langues","press.fact.money":"Modèle économique","press.fact.money.v":"Gratuit avec publicités · Premium optionnel via Google Play Billing","press.fact.people":"Équipe","press.fact.platform":"Plateforme","press.fact.studio":"Studio","press.fact.titles":"Titres","press.factsEyebrow":"Fiche technique","press.factsTitle":"Les chiffres, déjà vérifiés","press.lede":"Tout ce qu'il faut à la presse, au même endroit et libre d'usage.","press.sla":"Une personne répond, en général sous cinq jours ouvrés. Indiquez votre média, votre deadline et ce dont vous avez besoin — ça suffit pour que la réponse soit utile du premier coup.","press.title":"Pour la presse et les partenaires","principles.eyebrow":"Principes","principles.intro":"Les tenir coûte moins cher que les justifier, et c'est pourquoi les applis restent petites.","principles.title":"Quatre règles qui ne bougent pas","privacy.eyebrow":"Vos données","privacyCta.btn":"Lire la politique","privacyCta.text":"Tout ce qu'un jeu sait de vous tient dans votre téléphone. La politique dit exactement ce que c'est, quels réseaux publicitaires se chargent pour un joueur gratuit, et pourquoi chaque paiement passe par Google et non par nous.","privacyCta.title":"Nous n'avons pas un seul serveur","road.eyebrow":"Le jeu long","road.families":"Les quinze familles","road.intro":"Tout ce qui suit se gagne en jouant. Rien ici n'est à vendre.","road.missionsD":"Treize types quotidiens qui montent avec votre rang, deux hebdomadaires et un coffre pour la semaine tenue.","road.missionsT":"Missions quotidiennes et hebdomadaires","road.questsD":"Cinq étapes chacune, du premier nettoyage à celles que presque personne n'atteint.","road.questsT":"21 chaînes de succès","road.ranksD":"Quinze familles de quatre. Les points sont votre score, pondéré par la difficulté choisie.","road.ranksT":"60 rangs","road.title":"Une route, pas un tapis roulant","roadmap.cta":"La feuille de route complète","roadmap.eyebrow":"Feuille de route","roadmap.intro":"Deux jeux sortis, un sur le papier. Rien ne bouge ici tant que ce qui précède n'est pas fini.","roadmap.note":"Aucune date promise ici — l'ordre, oui.","roadmap.r1.desc":"Disponible sur Google Play. Un puzzle de fusion 4×4 avec un Quotidien identique pour tous, des médailles mensuelles, cinq boosters et un Premium sans publicité en option.","roadmap.r1.meta":"Sorti · 2026","roadmap.r1.title":"Gridlix:2048","roadmap.r2.desc":"Disponible sur Google Play. Puzzle 8×8 « pose et nettoie » : six niveaux de difficulté, 38 thèmes, 60 rangs, quatre boosters, missions quotidiennes et hebdomadaires, et Premium optionnel sans pub.","roadmap.r2.meta":"Sorti · 2026","roadmap.r2.title":"Blocklix","roadmap.r3.desc":"Un puzzle de mots, encore sur le papier. Même forme que les deux autres : petit, hors ligne, sans compte, et un Premium qui ne fait qu'enlever les pubs.","roadmap.r3.meta":"Plus tard","roadmap.r3.title":"Wordlix","roadmap.title":"Où nous allons","shelf.count.idea":"sur le papier","shelf.count.live":"sur Google Play","shelf.count.open":"places réservées","shelf.count.soon":"en cours","shelf.eyebrow":"L'étagère","shelf.intro":"Un panneau par titre, dans l'ordre où ils ont été faits. Le dernier est vide exprès : l'étagère est dimensionnée pour la suite, pas pour l'existant.","shelf.more":"Ouvrir la page","shelf.next":"Titre suivant","shelf.open.body":"Quand un titre est prêt, il prend cette place dans le même cadre et pousse le vide plus loin. La page ne change pas.","shelf.open.meta":"Pas encore nommé","shelf.open.title":"Le prochain se posera ici","shelf.prev":"Titre précédent","shelf.railAria":"L'étagère du studio","shelf.title":"Deux sur l'étagère. La place est gardée.","status.dev":"En cours","status.idea":"Sur le papier","status.live":"Sur Google Play","status.open":"Place libre","story.eyebrow":"La version courte","story.p1":"Vaslix Games, c'est une personne. Ce n'est pas un récit de galère : c'est la contrainte dont découle tout le reste. Un studio d'une personne ne peut pas maintenir un système de comptes, une flotte de serveurs et un support — il ne les construit donc pas, et les jeux s'en portent mieux.","story.p2":"Reste ce que le joueur touche vraiment : le plateau, le rythme, la sensation d'une pièce qui se pose. Chaque heure qui serait partie dans un parcours d'inscription part dans la courbe de difficulté.","story.p3":"Le catalogue grandit lentement, exprès. Un titre sort quand il est fini, reçoit des mises à jour pendant des années, et ne devient jamais en douce un service avec connexion.","story.title":"Pourquoi les applis restent petites","themes.eyebrow":"38 thèmes","themes.free":"Gratuit dès l'installation","themes.intro":"Quatre sont à vous dès l'installation. Les autres se gagnent en étoiles ou viennent avec Premium — et chacun change le ciel, les blocs et la façon dont une ligne nettoyée s'allume.","themes.tap":"Touchez un thème pour habiller le plateau","themes.title":"Chaque plateau porte une palette","trust.1.desc":"Nulle part où s'inscrire. Votre progression ne quitte jamais le téléphone où elle a été faite.","trust.1.title":"Pas de compte","trust.2.desc":"Google Play encaisse le paiement. Votre carte ne nous parvient jamais, parce qu'elle ne passe jamais par nous.","trust.2.title":"Aucune donnée de paiement stockée","trust.3.desc":"Un consentement avant que la première pub se charge, un opt-out là où la loi en exige un, et une politique qui nomme chaque entreprise impliquée.","trust.3.title":"GDPR · CCPA · COPPA","trust.4.desc":"Premium coupe les bannières, les interstitiels et les pubs à l'ouverture. Les vidéos récompensées restent accessibles à tous et ne démarrent que si vous appuyez dessus. Le marché s'arrête là.","trust.4.title":"Premium enlève les pubs"},"pt-BR":{"about.eyebrow":"Sobre","about.lede":"Uma pessoa, dois jogos no Google Play, nenhum escritório. <strong>Apps pequenos, feitos com cuidado, que respeitam seu aparelho e sua atenção.</strong> Não tem onde fazer login, não tem nada seu em servidor nosso e não tem investidor perguntando por que a monetização é tão discreta.","about.stats.apps":"apps publicados","about.stats.langs":"idiomas suportados","about.stats.people":"pessoa no estúdio","about.stats.since":"publicando desde","about.title":"Um estúdio pequeno com visão de longo prazo","also.cta":"Voltar à prateleira","also.eyebrow":"Também do estúdio","also.title":"O resto da prateleira","card.blocklix.desc":"Coloque formas num tabuleiro 8×8, limpe linhas e quadrados, encadeie combos para multiplicadores altos. Seis níveis de dificuldade, 38 temas, 60 patentes em 21 cadeias de conquistas, quatro reforços, missões diárias e semanais com baú de sequência, e um guarda-roupa de cosméticos. Premium opcional sem anúncios, com estrelas ×2 e presente diário.","card.blocklix.genre":"Puzzle","card.gridlix.desc":"Um quebra-cabeça de fusão 4×4 para Android. O Diário nasce da data, então todo mundo recebe o mesmo tabuleiro, avaliado em até três estrelas; uma sequência com escudos sobrevive a uma noite perdida, e um mês concluído vale uma medalha. Cinco reforços com três usos cada por partida, cinco temas de cor, vibração ajustada e um Premium opcional sem anúncios.","contact.btn":"Enviar um e-mail","contact.eyebrow":"Contato","contact.text":"Bugs, ideias, dúvidas de imprensa e propostas caem na mesma caixa. Se algo travou, informe o aparelho e a versão do Android.","contact.title":"Escreva, e uma pessoa responde","cta.play":"Disponível no Google Play","diff.eyebrow":"Seis níveis de dificuldade","diff.intro":"Só o gerador de peças muda. Pontuação, tabuleiro e patentes são iguais em todo degrau — mais difícil só quer dizer que as peças param de ajudar você.","diff.note":"Os degraus altos pagam mais estrelas por ponto. O Fácil paga menos, e nunca finge o contrário.","diff.title":"Escolha o tamanho da sua partida","f.boosters":"reforços","f.daily":"Diário com estrelas","f.difficulties":"dificuldades","f.languages":"idiomas","f.ranks":"patentes","f.themes":"temas","faq.a1":"Cancele em <strong>Google Play → Assinaturas</strong> ou pelo botão «Gerenciar» dentro do app — leva à mesma página. O cancelamento entra em vigor ao final do período de cobrança atual.","faq.a2":"O progresso fica no seu aparelho. No Blocklix, o backup do próprio Android o copia para a sua conta Google, então reinstalar com a mesma conta normalmente traz tudo de volta; no Gridlix:2048 esse backup está desligado, e ali o save se perde ao desinstalar, a não ser que você use o save na nuvem do Play Games. Nunca enviamos um save para um servidor nosso. O Premium se restaura sozinho assim que você reinstala e entra com a mesma conta Google.","faq.a3":"Nós não. Nosso código nem encosta nele — quem lê são os SDKs de anúncios dentro do app, para limitar a frequência dos anúncios e atribuir instalações. Com Premium, ou com a compra Remover Anúncios no Blocklix, ele deixa de ser usado para banners, intersticiais e anúncios app-open; ainda é processado se você escolher assistir a um vídeo recompensado. A <a href=\"./privacy-policy.html\">Política de Privacidade</a> nomeia cada SDK que o lê.","faq.a4":"Android 8.0 (API 26) e superior. Isso é de propósito: um celular que já passou por duas mãos ainda tem que rodar os jogos.","faq.a5":"O Blocklix sai em 12 idiomas: inglês, russo, alemão, espanhol, francês, italiano, japonês, coreano, português (Brasil), turco, árabe e chinês simplificado. O Gridlix:2048 cobre um conjunto menor. O idioma do sistema é detectado no primeiro arranque e pode ser trocado nas configurações.","faq.a6":"Escreva para <a href=\"mailto:vaslixofficial@protonmail.com\">vaslixofficial@protonmail.com</a> com uma descrição curta. Capturas e modelo do aparelho ajudam muito. Lemos cada mensagem.","faq.a7":"Não está no roteiro. Uma pessoa consegue manter dois jogos Android atualizados por anos; duas plataformas significariam que nenhum dos dois teria isso. Se o catálogo crescer a ponto de mudar essa conta, vai estar escrito aqui.","faq.a8":"Não. O Premium tira banners e intersticiais, dobra as estrelas de cada partida e adiciona um presente diário e os temas premium. Todo nível, patente e missão é igual para todo mundo.","faq.eyebrow":"FAQ","faq.q1":"Como cancelo minha assinatura?","faq.q2":"O que acontece com meu progresso se eu desinstalar?","faq.q3":"Quem lê o Advertising ID?","faq.q4":"Quais versões do Android são suportadas?","faq.q5":"Quais idiomas são suportados?","faq.q6":"Achei um bug ou quero sugerir um recurso.","faq.q7":"Haverá versão para iOS?","faq.q8":"O Premium muda como o jogo se joga?","faq.title":"Perguntas frequentes","footer.builtWith":"HTML escrito à mão. Sem rastreadores neste site.","footer.contactTitle":"Contato","footer.copyright":"© Vaslix Games · Estúdio Android independente","footer.games":"Jogos","footer.gamesAria":"Jogos","footer.made":"Feito em um quarto, jogado em doze idiomas.","footer.privacyLink":"Política de Privacidade","footer.replyTime":"Normalmente respondemos em cinco dias úteis.","footer.studio":"Estúdio","footer.studioAria":"Links do estúdio","g.blocklix.blurb":"Coloque formas num tabuleiro 8×8, limpe linhas e quadrados, encadeie combos para multiplicadores altos. Seis níveis de dificuldade, 38 temas, 60 patentes em 21 cadeias de conquistas, quatro reforços, missões diárias e semanais com baú de sequência, e um guarda-roupa de cosméticos. Premium opcional sem anúncios, com estrelas ×2 e presente diário.","g.blocklix.boosters.eyebrow":"Reforços","g.blocklix.boosters.intro":"Cada um é comprado com estrelas ganhas jogando. Nenhum é vendido por dinheiro separadamente.","g.blocklix.boosters.note":"As estrelas vêm de partidas concluídas, missões e patentes. O Premium dobra o que uma partida paga; não vende os reforços diretamente.","g.blocklix.boosters.title":"Quatro saídas de um tabuleiro ruim","g.blocklix.chip.1":"Tabuleiro 8×8","g.blocklix.chip.2":"Joga offline","g.blocklix.chip.3":"Sem conta","g.blocklix.difficulty.eyebrow":"Seis níveis de dificuldade","g.blocklix.difficulty.intro":"Só o gerador de peças muda. Pontuação, tabuleiro e patentes são iguais em todo degrau — mais difícil só quer dizer que as peças param de ajudar você.","g.blocklix.difficulty.note":"Os degraus altos pagam mais estrelas por ponto. O Fácil paga menos, e nunca finge o contrário.","g.blocklix.difficulty.title":"Escolha o tamanho da sua partida","g.blocklix.genre":"Puzzle","g.blocklix.how.1.d":"Três peças por vez. Qualquer uma vai onde couber; nada gira, nada cai.","g.blocklix.how.1.t":"Encaixe","g.blocklix.how.2.d":"Complete uma linha ou coluna e ela some. Complete as duas de uma vez e o tabuleiro avisa.","g.blocklix.how.2.t":"Limpe","g.blocklix.how.3.d":"Limpe em jogadas seguidas e o multiplicador sobe. Um tique discreto avisa quando uma linha está prestes a sair.","g.blocklix.how.3.t":"Combo","g.blocklix.how.eyebrow":"Como se joga","g.blocklix.how.intro":"O Blocklix é o 8×8 de encaixar e limpar que você já viu — ajustado até cada uma dessas três jogadas cair bem na mão.","g.blocklix.how.title":"Três jogadas que você já conhece","g.blocklix.openAria":"Abrir a página do Blocklix","g.blocklix.palettes.eyebrow":"38 temas","g.blocklix.palettes.free":"Grátis desde a instalação","g.blocklix.palettes.intro":"Quatro são seus desde a instalação. O resto se ganha com estrelas ou vem com o Premium — e cada um muda o céu, os blocos e o jeito que uma linha limpa acende.","g.blocklix.palettes.tap":"Toque em um tema para vestir o tabuleiro","g.blocklix.palettes.title":"Cada tabuleiro veste uma paleta","g.blocklix.playAria":"Blocklix no Google Play","g.blocklix.premium.1":"Banners, intersticiais e anúncios de abertura são desligados","g.blocklix.premium.2":"Uma partida paga o dobro de estrelas","g.blocklix.premium.3":"Um presente diário e os temas premium","g.blocklix.premium.4":"Todas as dificuldades, patentes e missões continuam iguais","g.blocklix.premium.eyebrow":"Premium","g.blocklix.premium.intro":"O Premium remove o que atrapalha e acelera o que você já ganha. Não desbloqueia nível, patente nem missão.","g.blocklix.premium.note":"Os vídeos premiados continuam opcionais para todos: só tocam quando você aperta o botão que os pede.","g.blocklix.premium.title":"O que o dinheiro muda — e o que ele nunca toca","g.blocklix.progress.eyebrow":"O jogo longo","g.blocklix.progress.families":"As quinze famílias","g.blocklix.progress.intro":"Tudo abaixo se ganha jogando. Nada disso está à venda.","g.blocklix.progress.missions.d":"Treze tipos diários que crescem com sua patente, dois semanais e um baú pela semana em que você não falha.","g.blocklix.progress.missions.t":"Missões diárias e semanais","g.blocklix.progress.quests.d":"Cinco passos cada, da primeira limpeza até as que quase ninguém alcança.","g.blocklix.progress.quests.t":"21 cadeias de conquistas","g.blocklix.progress.ranks.d":"Quinze famílias de quatro. Os pontos são a sua pontuação, ponderada pela dificuldade que você escolheu.","g.blocklix.progress.ranks.t":"60 patentes","g.blocklix.progress.title":"Uma estrada, não uma esteira","g.blocklix.tagline":"Encaixe três peças, limpe a linha, mantenha o combo vivo.","g.gridlix.blurb":"Um quebra-cabeça de fusão 4×4 para Android. O Diário nasce da data, então todo mundo recebe o mesmo tabuleiro, avaliado em até três estrelas; uma sequência com escudos sobrevive a uma noite perdida, e um mês concluído vale uma medalha. Cinco reforços com três usos cada por partida, cinco temas de cor, vibração ajustada e um Premium opcional sem anúncios.","g.gridlix.boosters.delete.d":"Remove uma peça que você apontar.","g.gridlix.boosters.eyebrow":"Reforços","g.gridlix.boosters.intro":"O limite é por partida, não por dia: um reforço é uma decisão dentro da corrida, não um recurso para estocar.","g.gridlix.boosters.note":"Para quem joga de graça, cada uso é pago com um vídeo premiado que você escolhe assistir; o Premium pula o vídeo e o contador. Não usar nenhum é a terceira estrela do Diário.","g.gridlix.boosters.shuffle.d":"Reorganiza o que já está lá, sem acrescentar nada.","g.gridlix.boosters.swap.d":"Troca duas peças de lugar.","g.gridlix.boosters.title":"Cinco, três usos cada","g.gridlix.boosters.undo.d":"Desfaz a última jogada, incluindo a peça que surgiu.","g.gridlix.boosters.value_clear.d":"Varre do tabuleiro todas as peças de um mesmo valor.","g.gridlix.chip.1":"Tabuleiro 4×4","g.gridlix.chip.2":"Diário + infinito","g.gridlix.chip.3":"Widget na tela inicial","g.gridlix.daily.eyebrow":"O Diário","g.gridlix.daily.intro":"Uma semente com a data monta a posição inicial e todo o fluxo de peças, então o tabuleiro que você encara é o mesmo de todo mundo.","g.gridlix.daily.seed.d":"A abertura é jogada de antemão por um bot roteirizado, e a contagem de jogadas dele define o par pelo qual você é medido. Várias tentativas por dia; vale a melhor.","g.gridlix.daily.seed.t":"Uma semente, um tabuleiro","g.gridlix.daily.star.1":"Alcance a peça-alvo dentro do limite de jogadas.","g.gridlix.daily.star.2":"Faça isso dentro do par — as jogadas do próprio bot.","g.gridlix.daily.star.3":"Dentro do par e sem tocar em nenhum reforço.","g.gridlix.daily.title":"O mesmo desafio que todo mundo","g.gridlix.genre":"Puzzle","g.gridlix.how.1.d":"Uma direção move todas as peças de uma vez. Não existe meio movimento.","g.gridlix.how.1.t":"Deslize","g.gridlix.how.2.d":"Duas peças iguais que se tocam viram uma do dobro. Uma peça funde uma vez por jogada.","g.gridlix.how.2.t":"Funda","g.gridlix.how.3.d":"No infinito, a meta é o seu recorde. No Diário, é uma peça definida dentro de um número definido de jogadas.","g.gridlix.how.3.t":"Alcance o alvo","g.gridlix.how.eyebrow":"Como se joga","g.gridlix.how.intro":"Não há nada a aprender além do deslize. O resto é aritmética e sangue-frio.","g.gridlix.how.title":"Um só gesto, até o fim","g.gridlix.month.eyebrow":"O mês","g.gridlix.month.intro":"Uma noite perdida não deveria apagar quatro meses. Os escudos absorvem uma falha, e o calendário mantém o mês inteiro à vista.","g.gridlix.month.legend.done":"Jogado","g.gridlix.month.legend.miss":"Perdido","g.gridlix.month.legend.shield":"Protegido","g.gridlix.month.medals.d":"Um mês concluído é avaliado uma vez, guardado para sempre e exibido na estante ao lado da sua melhor sequência.","g.gridlix.month.medals.t":"Medalhas mensais","g.gridlix.month.streak.d":"O escudo é gasto automaticamente no dia perdido e se recupera jogando. A sequência sobrevive a uma semana ruim comum.","g.gridlix.month.streak.t":"Escudos","g.gridlix.month.title":"Uma sequência que dá para manter","g.gridlix.openAria":"Abrir a página do Gridlix:2048","g.gridlix.playAria":"Gridlix:2048 no Google Play","g.gridlix.premium.1":"Sem banners nem intersticiais, em lugar nenhum","g.gridlix.premium.2":"Reforços sem assistir a nada antes","g.gridlix.premium.3":"Continuações quando o tabuleiro enche","g.gridlix.premium.4":"As quatro paletas bloqueadas se abrem","g.gridlix.premium.eyebrow":"Premium","g.gridlix.premium.intro":"Uma assinatura pelo Google Play, mensal ou anual, com teste grátis no plano anual. Cancele pelo Play quando quiser.","g.gridlix.premium.note":"O Diário, suas estrelas, a sequência e as medalhas funcionam igual, pagando ou não.","g.gridlix.premium.title":"Jogar sem interrupções","g.gridlix.tagline":"Um tabuleiro, um desafio diário — o mesmo para todos.","g.gridlix.themes.eyebrow":"Paletas","g.gridlix.themes.free":"Grátis","g.gridlix.themes.intro":"A paleta muda as peças, o acento e o brilho — nunca uma regra. Estas são as cores reais, tiradas do app.","g.gridlix.themes.premium":"Premium","g.gridlix.themes.title":"Cinco paletas, um tabuleiro","g.words.chip.1":"Palavras","g.words.chip.2":"Protótipo","g.words.tagline":"Um quebra-cabeça de palavras, ainda no papel. Mesma forma: pequeno, silencioso, offline.","g.words.when":"Ainda sem data","gd.blocklix.booster.bomb.desc":"Limpa uma área 3×3 na hora","gd.blocklix.booster.bomb.name":"Bomba","gd.blocklix.booster.hammer.desc":"Quebra qualquer bloco","gd.blocklix.booster.hammer.name":"Martelo","gd.blocklix.booster.lightning.desc":"Detona uma linha e uma coluna inteiras de uma vez","gd.blocklix.booster.lightning.name":"Raio","gd.blocklix.booster.shuffle.desc":"Troca suas peças por três novas","gd.blocklix.booster.shuffle.name":"Embaralhar","gd.blocklix.diff.easy.desc":"Partidas longas e tranquilas. Menos estrelas.","gd.blocklix.diff.easy.name":"Fácil","gd.blocklix.diff.expert.desc":"Cada nova leva de peças é um quebra-cabeça.","gd.blocklix.diff.expert.name":"Especialista","gd.blocklix.diff.hard.desc":"As peças grandes chegam antes.","gd.blocklix.diff.hard.name":"Difícil","gd.blocklix.diff.insane.desc":"Pura sorte. As peças podem nem caber.","gd.blocklix.diff.insane.name":"Insanidade","gd.blocklix.diff.master.desc":"Só os mais afiados sobrevivem. Nada de peças fáceis.","gd.blocklix.diff.master.name":"Mestre","gd.blocklix.diff.normal.desc":"Ritmo clássico: uns dez minutos.","gd.blocklix.diff.normal.name":"Normal","gd.blocklix.rank.bronze":"Bronze","gd.blocklix.rank.celestial":"Celestial","gd.blocklix.rank.cosmic":"Cósmico","gd.blocklix.rank.diamond":"Diamante","gd.blocklix.rank.emerald":"Esmeralda","gd.blocklix.rank.eternal":"Eterno","gd.blocklix.rank.gold":"Ouro","gd.blocklix.rank.grandmaster":"Grão-Mestre","gd.blocklix.rank.legend":"Lenda","gd.blocklix.rank.master":"Mestre","gd.blocklix.rank.mythic":"Mítico","gd.blocklix.rank.platinum":"Platina","gd.blocklix.rank.ruby":"Rubi","gd.blocklix.rank.silver":"Prata","gd.blocklix.rank.stone":"Pedra","gd.gridlix.booster.delete.name":"Apagar","gd.gridlix.booster.shuffle.name":"Embaralhar","gd.gridlix.booster.swap.name":"Trocar","gd.gridlix.booster.undo.name":"Desfazer","gd.gridlix.booster.value_clear.name":"Limpeza","gd.gridlix.medal.bronze":"Bronze","gd.gridlix.medal.gold":"Ouro","gd.gridlix.medal.silver":"Prata","gp.back":"Todos os títulos","hero.cta.games":"Nossos jogos","hero.cta.studio":"Sobre o estúdio","hero.kick":"Estúdio Android independente","hero.lede":"Dois jogos de puzzle, feitos por uma pessoa só. Sem contas, sem servidores nossos, doze idiomas — e um Premium que faz exatamente uma coisa: tira os anúncios.","hero.scroll":"Role","hero.t1":"Jogos pequenos.","hero.t2":"Feitos para durar.","how.eyebrow":"Como se joga","how.intro":"O Blocklix é o 8×8 de encaixar e limpar que você já viu — ajustado até cada uma dessas três jogadas cair bem na mão.","how.s1d":"Três peças por vez. Qualquer uma vai onde couber; nada gira, nada cai.","how.s1t":"Encaixe","how.s2d":"Complete uma linha ou coluna e ela some. Complete as duas de uma vez e o tabuleiro avisa.","how.s2t":"Limpe","how.s3d":"Limpe em jogadas seguidas e o multiplicador sobe. Um tique discreto avisa quando uma linha está prestes a sair.","how.s3t":"Combo","how.title":"Três jogadas que você já conhece","meta.blocklix.desc":"Encaixe três peças em um tabuleiro 8×8, limpe linhas e colunas, encadeie combos. 38 temas, 60 patentes, seis dificuldades, doze idiomas. Sem contas.","meta.blocklix.title":"Blocklix — um quebra-cabeça 8×8 de encaixar e limpar | Vaslix Games","meta.description":"Vaslix Games é um estúdio Android independente que publica jogos de puzzle compactos e cuidadosos. Gridlix:2048 e Blocklix já estão no Google Play.","meta.gridlix.desc":"Um quebra-cabeça de fusão 4×4 com um Diário idêntico para todos, escudos de sequência, medalhas mensais e cinco reforços. O modo infinito não acaba.","meta.gridlix.title":"Gridlix:2048 — um desafio diário igual para todos | Vaslix Games","meta.home.desc":"Vaslix Games é um estúdio Android independente que publica jogos de puzzle compactos e cuidadosos. Gridlix:2048 e Blocklix já estão no Google Play.","meta.home.title":"Vaslix Games — pequenos puzzles Android, feitos para durar","meta.notFound.desc":"Esse endereço não leva a lugar nenhum. A prateleira leva.","meta.notFound.title":"Página não encontrada — Vaslix Games","meta.press.desc":"Texto padrão, ficha técnica, ícones e contato para imprensa e parceiros. Resposta em cerca de cinco dias úteis.","meta.press.title":"Kit de imprensa — Vaslix Games","meta.privacy.desc":"Como a Vaslix Games trata dados no Gridlix:2048 e no Blocklix. Resumo em linguagem simples, política completa, o que cada jogo guarda e notas sobre GDPR/CCPA/COPPA.","meta.privacy.title":"Política de Privacidade — Vaslix Games","meta.studio.desc":"Uma pessoa, apps Android pequenos, sem contas e sem servidores nossos. O que fazemos, que regras mantemos e o que vem depois.","meta.studio.title":"Estúdio — Vaslix Games","meta.title":"Vaslix Games — pequenos puzzles Android, feitos para durar","nav.aria":"Navegação principal","nav.brand":"Vaslix Games","nav.games":"Jogos","nav.langLabel":"Mudar idioma","nav.menu":"Menu","nav.press":"Imprensa","nav.privacy":"Privacidade","nav.skip":"Ir para o conteúdo","nav.studio":"Estúdio","nav.theme.auto":"Mudar para tema automático","nav.theme.dark":"Mudar para tema escuro","nav.theme.light":"Mudar para tema claro","nf.body":"O endereço não leva a lugar nenhum. A prateleira continua onde você a deixou.","nf.eyebrow":"404","nf.games":"Ver a prateleira","nf.home":"Início","nf.title":"Esta casa está vazia","nums.accounts":"contas necessárias","nums.games":"jogos no Google Play","nums.langs":"idiomas","nums.person":"pessoa","nums.servers":"servidores nossos","nums.since":"publicando desde","nums.title":"O estúdio em números","p.changed.body":"Conferimos esta política contra o código-fonte dos dois apps e a corrigimos onde havia divergência. O Google AdMob não é mais citado: nenhum dos apps o inclui. A afirmação de que o ID do dispositivo Android é lido para verificar sua assinatura era falsa e foi removida. Os SDKs de publicidade que chegam dentro do pacote de mediação da Appodeal — Adjust, AppsFlyer, Meta Audience Network, Sentry e Yandex AppMetrica — agora estão nomeados no §2, assim como o Play Install Referrer, a consulta de apps instalados e as permissões do Privacy Sandbox. O §1a agora lista tudo o que os apps realmente guardam, incluindo o registro de moedas e o dos anúncios que foram exibidos a você. Backup e salvamento na nuvem diferem entre os dois jogos e agora são mostrados por jogo, em vez de afirmados para ambos. Apps de áudio e podcast não são mais descritos: nenhum existe.","p.changed.title":"O que mudou nesta revisão","p.hero.chip.billing":"Google Play Billing","p.hero.chip.gdpr":"Alinhada a GDPR / CCPA / COPPA","p.hero.chip.updated":"Última atualização","p.hero.eyebrow":"Resumo em linguagem simples; texto legal completo abaixo","p.hero.lede":"Como a Vaslix Games trata informações nos nossos apps Android. A política se aplica igualmente a tudo o que lançamos. Sem contas, sem servidores nossos, sem surpresas. <strong>Ela cobre Gridlix:2048 e Blocklix, os dois no Google Play — e o §1 mostra onde os dois diferem.</strong>","p.hero.title":"Política de Privacidade","p.sec1.backup":"<strong>O backup do próprio Android está ligado no Blocklix e desligado no Gridlix:2048</strong> — a tabela acima mostra qual é qual. Onde está ligado, e se o backup estiver ligado no seu aparelho, o Android copia os dados locais listados em 1a para a sua conta pessoal do Google e os restaura quando você reinstala na mesma conta. Essa cópia é sua: o Android a administra e a criptografa, e nós não podemos nem lê-la nem apagá-la. Você a controla em <em>Configurações do Android → Google → Backup</em>. Separadamente, os dois jogos têm salvamento na nuvem sobre o Google Play Games Saved Games: um arquivo no seu próprio armazenamento do Play Games, para o progresso acompanhar você entre aparelhos. Ele nunca funciona sem login no Play Games, carrega apenas progresso de jogo — nunca status de assinatura ou dados de compra — e é servido pelo Google, não por um servidor nosso. No Blocklix ele sai desligado e está sendo habilitado aos poucos. No Gridlix:2048 ele sincroniza sempre que você está conectado ao Play Games; esse app não tem logout próprio, então interrompê-lo significa sair do Play Games pelo app Google Play Games. O Gridlix:2048 também desbloqueia conquistas do Play Games e envia suas pontuações para dois placares do Play Games.","p.sec1.body1a":"Cada app armazena o seguinte em um banco de dados Room/SQLite local (ou um armazenamento local equivalente) no seu aparelho. Nunca enviamos isso a um servidor nosso; onde o backup do próprio Android está ligado para o app, isso pode ir parar na sua conta Google pessoal, como descrito em 1d:","p.sec1.body1b":"Os serviços de terceiros descritos abaixo podem coletar automaticamente informações técnicas e relacionadas a publicidade:","p.sec1.callout":"<strong>O que não fica armazenado localmente:</strong> dados de pagamento, tokens de compra e identificadores da conta Google. Nada disso sai do Google Play.","p.sec1.deviceIdCallout":"<strong>Por que divulgamos isso:</strong> o formulário de Segurança de dados do Google Play exige que toda leitura do Advertising ID e do ID do aparelho Android seja declarada, independentemente de o valor sair do seu aparelho. Você pode redefinir o Advertising ID a qualquer momento em <em>Configurações do Android → Privacidade → Anúncios</em>, e o Android ID é gerado novamente quando você restaura o aparelho para os padrões de fábrica.","p.sec1.firebase":"Os dois apps incluem <strong>Google Firebase Analytics</strong> e <strong>Firebase Crashlytics</strong>; o Blocklix inclui também o <strong>Firebase Remote Config</strong>. O Analytics coleta um ID aleatório de instância do app, informações de aparelho e sistema e eventos agregados dentro do app — partida concluída, compra realizada, anúncio exibido, junto com a receita e o nome da rede informados para aquela exibição — para entendermos o uso geral e equilibrarmos a economia do jogo. Não usamos isso para montar perfis de publicidade. O Remote Config baixa um pequeno conjunto de sinalizadores e números de balanceamento e não envia dados pessoais além dos metadados técnicos da requisição. O Crashlytics envia um relatório quando o app trava ou congela: o rastreamento de pilha, o modelo do aparelho, as versões do sistema e do app, e um identificador aleatório de instalação — o suficiente para achar o defeito, e nada do que você digitou ou jogou. O Crashlytics não é o único coletor de erros presente nas builds; veja o §2. Detalhes: <a href=\"https://firebase.google.com/support/privacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">firebase.google.com/support/privacy ↗</a>.","p.sec1.h3a":"1a. Armazenadas localmente no seu aparelho","p.sec1.h3b":"1b. Coletadas por terceiros em nosso nome","p.sec1.h3c":"1c. Análise, relatórios de falhas e configuração remota (Google Firebase)","p.sec1.h3d":"1d. Backup e salvamento na nuvem","p.sec1.intro":"Nossos apps não exigem criação de conta e não coletamos intencionalmente informações pessoais de forma direta. As informações se dividem em dois grupos.","p.sec1.list1a.1":"Estado do próprio app: o tabuleiro como você deixou, sua pontuação, boosters e continuações","p.sec1.list1a.2":"Seu histórico de melhores partidas e sua melhor pontuação, guardados apenas localmente","p.sec1.list1a.3":"Configurações do app: som ligado ou desligado, vibração ligada ou desligada, tema, notificações e preferências semelhantes","p.sec1.list1a.4":"Um marcador de primeira abertura, usado para levar você pela introdução na primeira vez que abre o app","p.sec1.list1a.5":"Um resumo em cache do status da sua assinatura — ativa ou não, qual plano, o ID do produto, se o teste gratuito já foi usado e quando expira — para o app aplicar seus direitos na abertura sem esperar a rede","p.sec1.list1a.6":"Seu progresso e a economia do jogo: o saldo de moedas e o registro completo das suas movimentações, missões diárias e semanais, conquistas, progresso de patente, sequências, temas e cosméticos desbloqueados, progresso por dificuldade, o resultado de cada Daily e as medalhas mensais","p.sec1.list1a.7":"Um registro dos anúncios que foram exibidos a você — de que tipo, quando, e os contadores diários que definem o ritmo — e, no Gridlix:2048, os horários em que você costuma jogar, para que um lembrete chegue em uma hora plausível e não ao acaso","p.sec1.list1b.1":"Google Advertising ID (GAID) — lido para que as redes de anúncios entreguem anúncios, limitem sua frequência e atribuam instalações. Enquanto o Premium ou o Remover Anúncios estiver ativo, ele não é usado para banners, intersticiais nem anúncios de abertura; ele ainda é processado quando você escolhe explicitamente assistir a um vídeo recompensado.","p.sec1.list1b.2":"Identificadores ligados ao aparelho, incluindo o ID de dispositivo Android (SSAID). Nosso próprio código não lê nem este nem o ID de publicidade; ambos podem ser lidos dentro dos SDKs de publicidade descritos no §2, para entrega, limite de frequência e sinais de tráfego inválido. Eles não participam da sua assinatura: esse direito vem direto do Google Play Billing.","p.sec1.list1b.3":"Endereço IP e localização geográfica aproximada derivada dele","p.sec1.list1b.4":"Modelo do aparelho, versão do sistema operacional, idioma e fuso horário","p.sec1.list1b.5":"Versão do app, carimbos de data/hora de sessão e diagnósticos de falhas","p.sec1.list1b.6":"Eventos de uso agregados e não identificáveis, usados apenas de forma agregada","p.sec1.list1b.7":"O Play Install Referrer — como você chegou à página do app na loja — lido para que a instalação possa ser atribuída à campanha que a gerou","p.sec1.list1b.8":"A lista de apps instalados no seu aparelho que podem ser abertos, e a verificação de um pequeno conjunto de pacotes conhecidos de gerenciamento de root. Nada disso é lido pelo nosso código: vem dos SDKs de publicidade incluídos na mediação, que usam essas informações para segmentação e para sinais de integridade do aparelho.","p.sec1.list1b.9":"Sinais do Android Privacy Sandbox — Topics, Attribution Reporting, Protected Audience e o serviço de Ad ID. Os apps declaram permissões para isso, de modo que os SDKs de publicidade usem dados de interesse e atribuição fornecidos pelo sistema operacional, em vez de reunidos por nós.","p.sec1.title":"Informações que coletamos","p.sec10.body":"Para dúvidas de privacidade sobre qualquer um dos nossos apps, escreva para <a href=\"mailto:vaslixofficial@protonmail.com\">vaslixofficial@protonmail.com</a>. Tentamos responder em um prazo razoável.","p.sec10.title":"Contato","p.sec2.appodeal1":"Usamos a <a href=\"https://www.appodeal.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Appodeal</a> como nosso principal parceiro de mediação de anúncios. A política de privacidade da Appodeal está em <a href=\"https://www.appodeal.com/privacy-policy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">appodeal.com/privacy-policy ↗</a>.","p.sec2.appodeal2":"A Appodeal intermedeia a demanda de um grande número de redes de anúncios, e o conjunto ativo muda conforme a Appodeal atualiza seu SDK e conforme alteramos nossa configuração de build. A lista atual e oficial é publicada pela Appodeal:","p.sec2.appodeal3":"Cada rede nessa página tem link para a própria política de privacidade. Dúvidas de privacidade específicas sobre personalização de anúncios podem ser levadas diretamente à Appodeal no mesmo site.","p.sec2.bundled":"O pacote da Appodeal traz mais do que redes de anúncios. Os componentes abaixo são compilados nas nossas builds de lançamento, registram seus próprios serviços e receivers e são iniciados pela Appodeal, não pelo nosso código — não os chamamos nem os configuramos. O formulário de Segurança de dados do Google Play pergunta o que é coletado, não quem inicializou, então eles são nomeados aqui por completo:","p.sec2.bundledList.1":"<a href=\"https://www.adjust.com/terms/privacy-policy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Adjust ↗</a> — atribuição de instalações","p.sec2.bundledList.2":"<a href=\"https://www.appsflyer.com/legal/services-privacy-policy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">AppsFlyer ↗</a> — atribuição de instalações, com seu próprio receiver de install referrer","p.sec2.bundledList.3":"<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/privacy/policy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Meta Audience Network ↗</a> — demanda publicitária e medição","p.sec2.bundledList.4":"<a href=\"https://sentry.io/privacy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sentry ↗</a> — relatórios de erro e travamento, enviados ao projeto da Appodeal e não a um nosso. É um segundo coletor de travamentos ao lado do Firebase Crashlytics (§1c).","p.sec2.bundledList.5":"<a href=\"https://yandex.com/legal/confidential/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yandex AppMetrica ↗</a> — analytics, que chega junto com o adaptador de publicidade da Yandex","p.sec2.callout":"<strong>Assinantes Premium — e, no Blocklix, quem comprou Remover anúncios — não veem banners, intersticiais nem anúncios de abertura.</strong> Vídeos premiados nunca são impostos a ninguém: grátis ou pagante, eles só começam após um toque explícito em uma oferta. Ainda ocorre um tráfego limitado de inicialização para os provedores de anúncios quando o app abre, antes de os seus direitos serem resolvidos.","p.sec2.h3a":"Mediação Appodeal","p.sec2.h3c":"O que vem dentro do SDK de mediação","p.sec2.intro":"Nossos apps exibem banners, anúncios intersticiais ocasionais e vídeos premiados que você escolhe assistir em troca de uma vantagem no jogo — um booster, uma continuação após perder, moedas extras e afins. O Blocklix exibe também anúncios ao voltar para o app; o Gridlix:2048 não. Uma assinatura Premium desliga banners, intersticiais e anúncios de abertura nos dois jogos, e no Blocklix a compra única Remover anúncios faz o mesmo. Os vídeos premiados continuam disponíveis para todos e só tocam depois que você toca na oferta.","p.sec2.title":"Parceiros de publicidade","p.sec3.intro":"Os dois apps oferecem uma assinatura Premium opcional, vendida e processada pelo Google via Google Play Billing. O Blocklix oferece planos de renovação automática semanal, mensal e anual; o Gridlix:2048 oferece mensal e anual. Novos assinantes elegíveis recebem um teste gratuito introdutório no plano anual. O Premium desliga banners, intersticiais e anúncios de abertura e libera recursos premium próprios de cada app — por exemplo x2 moedas e um presente diário. O Blocklix vende também produtos únicos: pacotes de moedas, um pacote inicial, o pagamento do cofrinho e um desbloqueio permanente de Remover anúncios com o mesmo alcance do Premium. O Gridlix:2048 não vende nenhum produto único.","p.sec3.list.1":"Todas as informações de pagamento, cobrança, conta e impostos são coletadas e processadas pelo Google. Não vemos, armazenamos nem transmitimos sua forma de pagamento, o e-mail da sua conta Google ou qualquer identificador governamental.","p.sec3.list.2":"O app recebe do Google apenas um sinal de direitos não identificável: se existe uma assinatura ativa para a sua instalação, qual é o produto e — no Blocklix — quais produtos únicos foram comprados. Esse sinal é armazenado em cache local conforme descrito no §1a.","p.sec3.list.3":"Gerenciamento da assinatura, cancelamento, pedidos de reembolso e datas de renovação são tratados inteiramente no Google Play. O botão \"Gerenciar\" dentro do app leva diretamente à página de assinaturas do Google Play.","p.sec3.list.4":"A política de privacidade do Google Play se aplica a todo o processamento relacionado a cobrança: <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">policies.google.com/privacy ↗</a>","p.sec3.title":"Assinaturas e compras no app (Google Play Billing)","p.sec4.body":"Se você está no EEE, no Reino Unido ou na Suíça, a base legal para o processamento relacionado a publicidade é o seu consentimento, coletado por meio de um diálogo do IAB Transparency &amp; Consent Framework (TCF). Esse diálogo é apresentado pelo próprio SDK de mediação da Appodeal, quando a sua região exige; não operamos nenhuma plataforma de consentimento própria. Você pode retirar ou alterar seu consentimento a qualquer momento. O Blocklix consegue reabrir o diálogo pelas configurações de privacidade dentro do app; o Gridlix:2048 não tem essa tela, então lá o caminho é limpar os dados do app (Configurações → Apps), o que exibe o diálogo de consentimento novamente na próxima abertura. A base legal para o processamento de dados de assinatura via Google Play Billing é a execução do contrato firmado quando você compra uma assinatura.","p.sec4.title":"Base legal e consentimento (GDPR / EEE, Reino Unido, Suíça)","p.sec5.body":"Se você é residente da Califórnia, ou de outro estado dos EUA onde se aplique, você tem o direito de recusar a \"venda\" ou o \"compartilhamento\" das suas informações pessoais para publicidade comportamental. O diálogo de consentimento dentro do app oferece essa recusa onde exigido. O processamento de assinaturas pelo Google Play não é uma \"venda\" de informações pessoais.","p.sec5.title":"CCPA / leis estaduais de privacidade dos EUA","p.sec6.body":"Nossos apps não são direcionados a crianças menores de 13 anos (ou a idade mínima equivalente na sua jurisdição). Não coletamos intencionalmente informações pessoais de crianças. A assinatura Premium é destinada a compradores adultos; compras no app exigem uma conta do Google Play com as permissões de compra adequadas.","p.sec6.title":"Privacidade de crianças (COPPA)","p.sec7.body":"Os dados locais descritos no §1a ficam no seu aparelho até você limpar os dados do app ou desinstalá-lo. Não guardamos informações pessoais em servidores nossos. Onde o backup do próprio Android está ligado — Blocklix, não Gridlix:2048 — a cópia que ele faz fica na sua conta do Google e é removida em Configurações do Android → Google → Backup. Um salvamento na nuvem do Play Games fica na sua conta do Play Games e é removido de lá. Os parceiros de publicidade e o Google Play retêm dados conforme as políticas deles.","p.sec7.title":"Retenção de dados","p.sec8.body":"Dependendo da sua jurisdição, você pode ter o direito de acessar, corrigir, apagar, restringir ou portar seus dados pessoais, e de apresentar uma reclamação a uma autoridade de controle. Como não detemos esses dados diretamente, as solicitações devem ser dirigidas ao parceiro de publicidade em questão ou — no caso de dados de cobrança — ao Google Play.","p.sec8.callout":"Para remover todos os dados locais de qualquer um dos apps, desinstale-o ou limpe o armazenamento dele nas configurações do aparelho (<em>Configurações → Apps → [o app] → Armazenamento → Limpar dados</em>). Isso apaga a cópia do aparelho. Um backup que o Android já tenha feito — apenas Blocklix — é removido em <em>Configurações do Android → Google → Backup</em>, e um salvamento na nuvem do Play Games, da sua conta do Play Games.","p.sec8.title":"Seus direitos","p.sec9.body":"Podemos atualizar esta Política de Privacidade de tempos em tempos — por exemplo quando adicionamos novos títulos, mudamos de parceiros de publicidade ou atualizamos a mecânica de assinatura. A data \"Última atualização\" no topo da página indica quando a mudança mais recente foi feita. Mudanças relevantes são refletidas no app na próxima abertura.","p.sec9.title":"Alterações nesta política","p.summary.1.desc":"Estado do jogo, configurações, melhores pontuações, seu saldo de moedas e um marcador de premium em cache. Nada disso chega a um servidor nosso. No Blocklix, o backup do próprio Android pode copiar tudo para a sua conta do Google (§1d).","p.summary.1.title":"O que fica no seu aparelho","p.summary.2.desc":"Dados de pagamento, o e-mail da sua conta Google, identificadores de conta, contatos, fotos ou localização além da estimativa por IP que as redes de anúncios usam.","p.summary.2.title":"O que nunca vemos","p.summary.3.desc":"Jogadores gratuitos veem banners e intersticiais pela mediação da Appodeal, e no Blocklix também anúncios de abertura. O Premium — ou, no Blocklix, a compra única Remover anúncios — desliga tudo isso. Vídeos premiados são opcionais para todos: só tocam quando você toca em uma oferta.","p.summary.3.title":"Anúncios vs Premium","p.summary.4.desc":"Os SDKs de publicidade podem ler seu Google Advertising ID e o ID de dispositivo Android para exibir anúncios e limitar a frequência. Nosso próprio código não lê nenhum dos dois, e nenhum tem relação com a sua assinatura. Ambos podem ser redefinidos nas configurações do Android.","p.summary.4.title":"Identificadores do aparelho","p.summary.heading":"A versão curta","p.table.cloud.onSignIn":"Ativo assim que você entra no Play Games","p.table.cloud.optional":"Opcional, desligado por padrão","p.table.col.what":"Recurso","p.table.fb.all":"Analytics, Crashlytics, Remote Config","p.table.fb.core":"Analytics, Crashlytics","p.table.intro":"Esta política cobre todos os apps que publicamos, e os apps não são idênticos. Onde diferem, diferem aqui; todo o resto deste documento vale para os dois.","p.table.no":"Não","p.table.oneTime.yes":"Pacotes de moedas, pacote inicial, cofrinho, Remover anúncios","p.table.plans.2":"Mensal, anual","p.table.plans.3":"Semanal, mensal, anual","p.table.row.appOpen":"Anúncios ao abrir o app","p.table.row.backup":"Backup do próprio Android","p.table.row.cloudSave":"Salvamento na nuvem do Play Games","p.table.row.firebase":"Google Firebase","p.table.row.oneTime":"Compras únicas","p.table.row.plans":"Planos de assinatura","p.table.row.settings":"Configurações de privacidade dentro do app","p.table.title":"No que nossos jogos diferem","p.table.yes":"Sim","p.toc.1":"1. Informações que coletamos","p.toc.10":"10. Contato","p.toc.2":"2. Parceiros de publicidade","p.toc.3":"3. Assinaturas e Play Billing","p.toc.4":"4. Base legal (GDPR)","p.toc.5":"5. CCPA / leis estaduais dos EUA","p.toc.6":"6. Privacidade de crianças","p.toc.7":"7. Retenção de dados","p.toc.8":"8. Seus direitos","p.toc.9":"9. Alterações nesta política","p.toc.aria":"Sumário","p.toc.title":"Nesta página","press.aboutBody":"Vaslix Games é um publisher Android independente fundado em 2025. Fazemos jogos de puzzle pequenos e focados com postura privacy-first: sem contas, sem servidores próprios guardando dados de usuário, sem analytics interno. Dois títulos estão no Google Play: Gridlix:2048 e Blocklix, um puzzle de blocos 8×8 com seis níveis de dificuldade, 38 temas e 60 patentes, localizado em 12 idiomas.","press.aboutEyebrow":"Press kit","press.aboutTitle":"Sobre o estúdio","press.assetBlocklix":"Ícone do Blocklix","press.assetGridlix":"Ícone do Gridlix:2048","press.assetLockup":"Logotipo com texto","press.assetLockupDark":"Logotipo para fundos escuros","press.assetMark":"Marca do estúdio","press.assetsEyebrow":"Downloads","press.assetsIntro":"Ícones e logotipo exatamente como são publicados. Use como estão — por favor, não recolora nem recorte.","press.assetsTitle":"Recursos de marca","press.contactEyebrow":"Press kit","press.contactTitle":"Contato de imprensa","press.copied":"Copiado","press.copyBtn":"Copiar texto","press.eyebrow":"Press kit","press.fact.contact":"Contato","press.fact.founded":"Fundado","press.fact.langs":"Idiomas","press.fact.money":"Modelo de negócio","press.fact.money.v":"Grátis com anúncios · Premium opcional via Google Play Billing","press.fact.people":"Equipe","press.fact.platform":"Plataforma","press.fact.studio":"Estúdio","press.fact.titles":"Títulos","press.factsEyebrow":"Ficha técnica","press.factsTitle":"Os números, já conferidos","press.lede":"Tudo o que a imprensa precisa, em um só lugar e livre para usar.","press.sla":"Quem responde é uma pessoa, normalmente em até cinco dias úteis. Diga o veículo, o prazo e o que você precisa — com isso a resposta já sai útil de primeira.","press.title":"Para imprensa e parceiros","principles.eyebrow":"Princípios","principles.intro":"Sai mais barato cumpri-las do que justificá-las, e é por isso que os apps continuam pequenos.","principles.title":"Quatro regras que não se mexem","privacy.eyebrow":"Seus dados","privacyCta.btn":"Ler a política","privacyCta.text":"Tudo o que um jogo sabe sobre você está no seu celular. A política diz exatamente o que é isso, quais redes de anúncios carregam para quem joga de graça e por que todo pagamento passa pelo Google, e não por nós.","privacyCta.title":"Não temos um único servidor","road.eyebrow":"O jogo longo","road.families":"As quinze famílias","road.intro":"Tudo abaixo se ganha jogando. Nada disso está à venda.","road.missionsD":"Treze tipos diários que crescem com sua patente, dois semanais e um baú pela semana em que você não falha.","road.missionsT":"Missões diárias e semanais","road.questsD":"Cinco passos cada, da primeira limpeza até as que quase ninguém alcança.","road.questsT":"21 cadeias de conquistas","road.ranksD":"Quinze famílias de quatro. Os pontos são a sua pontuação, ponderada pela dificuldade que você escolheu.","road.ranksT":"60 patentes","road.title":"Uma estrada, não uma esteira","roadmap.cta":"O roteiro completo","roadmap.eyebrow":"Roteiro","roadmap.intro":"Dois lançados, um no papel. Nada aqui sai do lugar enquanto o anterior não estiver pronto.","roadmap.note":"Datas não são prometidas aqui; a ordem é.","roadmap.r1.desc":"Disponível no Google Play. Um quebra-cabeça de fusão 4×4 com um Diário igual para todos, medalhas mensais, cinco reforços e um Premium opcional sem anúncios.","roadmap.r1.meta":"Lançado · 2026","roadmap.r1.title":"Gridlix:2048","roadmap.r2.desc":"Disponível no Google Play. Puzzle 8×8 de encaixar e limpar: seis níveis de dificuldade, 38 temas, 60 patentes, quatro reforços, missões diárias e semanais e Premium opcional sem anúncios.","roadmap.r2.meta":"Lançado · 2026","roadmap.r2.title":"Blocklix","roadmap.r3.desc":"Um puzzle de palavras, ainda no papel. Mesma forma dos outros dois: pequeno, offline, sem conta e com um Premium que só tira os anúncios.","roadmap.r3.meta":"Mais adiante","roadmap.r3.title":"Wordlix","roadmap.title":"Para onde vamos","shelf.count.idea":"no papel","shelf.count.live":"no Google Play","shelf.count.open":"vagas reservadas","shelf.count.soon":"em produção","shelf.eyebrow":"A prateleira","shelf.intro":"Um painel por título, na ordem em que foram feitos. O último está vazio de propósito: a prateleira foi medida para o que vem, não para o que já está.","shelf.more":"Abrir a página","shelf.next":"Próximo título","shelf.open.body":"Quando um título fica pronto, ocupa esta vaga no mesmo quadro e empurra a vazia adiante. A página não muda.","shelf.open.meta":"Ainda sem nome","shelf.open.title":"O próximo entra aqui","shelf.prev":"Título anterior","shelf.railAria":"A prateleira do estúdio","shelf.title":"Dois na prateleira. O lugar dos próximos está guardado.","status.dev":"Em produção","status.idea":"No papel","status.live":"No Google Play","status.open":"Vaga livre","story.eyebrow":"A versão curta","story.p1":"A Vaslix Games é uma pessoa. Isso não é uma história de sacrifício: é a restrição da qual decorre todo o resto. Um estúdio de um não consegue manter sistema de login, frota de servidores e suporte — então não os constrói, e os jogos melhoram com isso.","story.p2":"Sobra o que o jogador realmente toca: o tabuleiro, o ritmo, a sensação de uma peça se encaixando. Cada hora que iria para um cadastro vai para a curva de dificuldade.","story.p3":"O catálogo cresce devagar, de propósito. Um título sai quando está pronto, recebe atualizações por anos e nunca vira em silêncio um serviço com login.","story.title":"Por que os apps continuam pequenos","themes.eyebrow":"38 temas","themes.free":"Grátis desde a instalação","themes.intro":"Quatro são seus desde a instalação. O resto se ganha com estrelas ou vem com o Premium — e cada um muda o céu, os blocos e o jeito que uma linha limpa acende.","themes.tap":"Toque em um tema para vestir o tabuleiro","themes.title":"Cada tabuleiro veste uma paleta","trust.1.desc":"Não tem onde se cadastrar. Seu progresso não sai do celular onde foi feito.","trust.1.title":"Sem contas","trust.2.desc":"Quem recebe o pagamento é o Google Play. Seu cartão não chega até nós — ele nem passa por aqui.","trust.2.title":"Sem dados de pagamento","trust.3.desc":"Consentimento antes de o primeiro anúncio carregar, opt-out onde a lei exige e uma política que nomeia cada empresa envolvida.","trust.3.title":"GDPR · CCPA · COPPA","trust.4.desc":"O Premium desliga banners, intersticiais e anúncios app-open. Vídeos recompensados continuam disponíveis para todo mundo e só começam quando você toca em um. O trato é esse.","trust.4.title":"Premium tira os anúncios"},"zh":{"about.eyebrow":"关于","about.lede":"一个人，Google Play 上两款游戏，没有办公室。<strong>用心做的小型应用，尊重你的设备和你的注意力。</strong>没有账号要登录，你的东西不在我们的服务器上，也没有投资人来问商业化为什么这么安静。","about.stats.apps":"已发布应用","about.stats.langs":"支持语言","about.stats.people":"位成员","about.stats.since":"自何年起发布","about.title":"一家有长远眼光的小工作室","also.cta":"回到架子","also.eyebrow":"工作室其他作品","also.title":"架子上的其他","card.blocklix.desc":"在 8×8 棋盘上放置方块，消除整行整列，连击可获得高倍数。六个难度等级、38 种主题、21 条成就链中的 60 个段位、四种道具、带连续签到宝箱的每日与每周任务，以及一套外观衣橱。可选的无广告 Premium，双倍星星与每日礼物。","card.blocklix.genre":"益智","card.gridlix.desc":"一款 Android 上的 4×4 合并益智游戏。每日谜题由日期生成，全球玩家面对同一块棋盘，以三颗星评分；带护盾的连胜能扛过一个错过的晚上，完整走完一个月还能拿到奖牌。五种助力道具，每局各可用三次，五套配色主题、调校过的振动反馈，以及可选的无广告 Premium。","contact.btn":"发送邮件","contact.eyebrow":"联系","contact.text":"错误报告、想法、媒体提问和合作邀约都进同一个邮箱。若发生崩溃，请附上设备型号与 Android 版本。","contact.title":"写信来，回信的是人","cta.play":"在 Google Play 上获取","diff.eyebrow":"六个难度等级","diff.intro":"变化的只有出块规则。计分、棋盘和段位在每一级都一样——所谓更难，只是方块不再帮你而已。","diff.note":"高难度每分给的星星更多。简单给得少，也从不假装不是这样。","diff.title":"选择你这一局的长度","f.boosters":"种道具","f.daily":"每日评星","f.difficulties":"种难度","f.languages":"种语言","f.ranks":"个段位","f.themes":"款主题","faq.a1":"在 <strong>Google Play → 订阅</strong> 中取消，或使用应用内的「管理」按钮——它会跳转到同一页面。取消会在当前计费周期结束时生效。","faq.a2":"进度存在你的设备上。在 Blocklix 里，Android 自带的备份会把它复制到你的 Google 账号，所以用同一账号重装通常能找回；在 Gridlix:2048 里这项备份是关闭的，卸载就等于存档丢失，除非你用 Play Games 云存档。我们从不把存档上传到自己的服务器。重装并登录同一个 Google 账号后，Premium 会自己恢复。","faq.a3":"不是我们。我们自己的代码从不碰它——读它的是应用里的广告 SDK，用于限制广告频次和归因安装。开通 Premium，或在 Blocklix 里购买「去广告」之后，它不再用于横幅、插屏和冷启动广告；如果你自己选择看激励视频，它仍会被处理。<a href=\"./privacy-policy.html\">隐私政策</a>里列出了读取它的每一个 SDK。","faq.a4":"Android 8.0（API 26）及以上。这是刻意的：一台转手两次的手机，也该跑得动它们。","faq.a5":"Blocklix 支持 12 种语言：英语、俄语、德语、西班牙语、法语、意大利语、日语、韩语、葡萄牙语（巴西）、土耳其语、阿拉伯语和简体中文。Gridlix:2048 覆盖的语言较少。首次启动时自动识别系统语言，也可以在应用设置中切换。","faq.a6":"请写信到 <a href=\"mailto:vaslixofficial@protonmail.com\">vaslixofficial@protonmail.com</a>，附上简短描述。截图和设备型号会很有帮助。我们会阅读每一条消息。","faq.a7":"不在路线图上。一个人可以把两款 Android 游戏更新好几年；换成两个平台，两边都得不到这个待遇。哪天作品多到这笔账算得过来，这里会写出来。","faq.a8":"不会。Premium 去掉横幅和插屏广告，让每局的星星翻倍，并附带每日礼物和高级主题。每个难度、段位和任务对所有人都一样。","faq.eyebrow":"FAQ","faq.q1":"如何取消订阅？","faq.q2":"卸载应用后游戏进度怎么办？","faq.q3":"谁在读取 Advertising ID？","faq.q4":"支持哪些 Android 版本？","faq.q5":"应用支持哪些语言？","faq.q6":"发现了 bug 或想提建议。","faq.q7":"会有 iOS 版本吗？","faq.q8":"Premium 会改变游戏玩法吗？","faq.title":"常见问题","footer.builtWith":"手写 HTML，本站没有任何跟踪器。","footer.contactTitle":"联系","footer.copyright":"© Vaslix Games · 独立 Android 工作室","footer.games":"游戏","footer.gamesAria":"游戏","footer.made":"在一个房间里做出来，用十二种语言玩。","footer.privacyLink":"隐私政策","footer.replyTime":"通常五个工作日内回复。","footer.studio":"工作室","footer.studioAria":"工作室链接","g.blocklix.blurb":"在 8×8 棋盘上放置方块，消除整行整列，连击可获得高倍数。六个难度等级、38 种主题、21 条成就链中的 60 个段位、四种道具、带连续签到宝箱的每日与每周任务，以及一套外观衣橱。可选的无广告 Premium，双倍星星与每日礼物。","g.blocklix.boosters.eyebrow":"助力道具","g.blocklix.boosters.intro":"每一个都用游戏中赚到的星星购买，没有任何一个可以单独用现金买。","g.blocklix.boosters.note":"星星来自完成的对局、任务和段位。Premium 会让每局收益翻倍，但不会直接出售道具。","g.blocklix.boosters.title":"四种脱困办法","g.blocklix.chip.1":"8×8 棋盘","g.blocklix.chip.2":"离线可玩","g.blocklix.chip.3":"无需账号","g.blocklix.difficulty.eyebrow":"六个难度等级","g.blocklix.difficulty.intro":"变化的只有出块规则。计分、棋盘和段位在每一级都一样——所谓更难，只是方块不再帮你而已。","g.blocklix.difficulty.note":"高难度每分给的星星更多。简单给得少，也从不假装不是这样。","g.blocklix.difficulty.title":"选择你这一局的长度","g.blocklix.genre":"益智","g.blocklix.how.1.d":"一次三块。哪块放得下就放哪里；不会旋转，也不会下落。","g.blocklix.how.1.t":"放置","g.blocklix.how.2.d":"填满一行或一列，它就消失。同时填满两者，棋盘会告诉你。","g.blocklix.how.2.t":"消除","g.blocklix.how.3.d":"连续几步都消除，倍数就往上涨。当一条线即将消失时，会有一声轻轻的提示。","g.blocklix.how.3.t":"连击","g.blocklix.how.eyebrow":"怎么玩","g.blocklix.how.intro":"Blocklix 就是你见过的那种 8×8 放置消除——只是打磨到这三个动作每一个都顺手为止。","g.blocklix.how.title":"三个你早已熟悉的动作","g.blocklix.openAria":"打开 Blocklix 页面","g.blocklix.palettes.eyebrow":"38 种主题","g.blocklix.palettes.free":"安装即免费","g.blocklix.palettes.intro":"四种从安装起就属于你。其余的用星星换取，或随 Premium 一起到来——每一种都会改变天空、方块，以及一条线被消除时点亮的方式。","g.blocklix.palettes.tap":"点一下主题，给棋盘换装","g.blocklix.palettes.title":"每块棋盘都有自己的配色","g.blocklix.playAria":"在 Google Play 查看 Blocklix","g.blocklix.premium.1":"横幅、插屏与开屏广告全部关闭","g.blocklix.premium.2":"每局获得双倍星星","g.blocklix.premium.3":"每日礼物，以及 Premium 专属主题","g.blocklix.premium.4":"所有难度、段位与任务原封不动","g.blocklix.premium.eyebrow":"Premium","g.blocklix.premium.intro":"Premium 只移除碍事的东西，并加快你本就能赚到的收益。它不会解锁任何关卡、段位或任务。","g.blocklix.premium.note":"激励视频对所有人都是自愿的：只有你主动点按钮才会播放。","g.blocklix.premium.title":"花钱能改变什么，又永远不会碰什么","g.blocklix.progress.eyebrow":"长线游戏","g.blocklix.progress.families":"十五个家族","g.blocklix.progress.intro":"下面的一切都靠玩来获得。这里没有任何东西出售。","g.blocklix.progress.missions.d":"十三类随段位成长的每日任务、两个每周任务，以及坚持一整周的宝箱。","g.blocklix.progress.missions.t":"每日与每周任务","g.blocklix.progress.quests.d":"每条五步，从第一次消除到几乎没人到达的那些。","g.blocklix.progress.quests.t":"21 条成就链","g.blocklix.progress.ranks.d":"十五个家族，每族四阶。积分就是你的得分，按所选难度加权。","g.blocklix.progress.ranks.t":"60 个段位","g.blocklix.progress.title":"一条路，而不是跑步机","g.blocklix.tagline":"放下三块，消掉一行，别让连击断掉。","g.gridlix.blurb":"一款 Android 上的 4×4 合并益智游戏。每日谜题由日期生成，全球玩家面对同一块棋盘，以三颗星评分；带护盾的连胜能扛过一个错过的晚上，完整走完一个月还能拿到奖牌。五种助力道具，每局各可用三次，五套配色主题、调校过的振动反馈，以及可选的无广告 Premium。","g.gridlix.boosters.delete.d":"移除你指定的一块方块。","g.gridlix.boosters.eyebrow":"助力道具","g.gridlix.boosters.intro":"上限按每局计，而非每天，所以道具是一局之内的决定，而不是可囤积的资源。","g.gridlix.boosters.note":"免费玩家每次使用需观看一段自愿的激励视频；Premium 会跳过视频和次数限制。一个都不用，正是每日的第三颗星。","g.gridlix.boosters.shuffle.d":"重排已有的方块，不会新增任何东西。","g.gridlix.boosters.swap.d":"交换两块方块的位置。","g.gridlix.boosters.title":"五种，各三次","g.gridlix.boosters.undo.d":"撤销上一步，连同新生成的方块。","g.gridlix.boosters.value_clear.d":"清掉棋盘上所有同一数值的方块。","g.gridlix.chip.1":"4×4 棋盘","g.gridlix.chip.2":"每日 + 无尽","g.gridlix.chip.3":"桌面小组件","g.gridlix.daily.eyebrow":"每日谜题","g.gridlix.daily.intro":"以日期为种子生成开局与全部新方块序列，所以你面前的棋盘就是所有人面前的棋盘。","g.gridlix.daily.seed.d":"开局由脚本机器人预先走完，它的步数就是衡量你的标准杆。每天可尝试多次，取最好的一次。","g.gridlix.daily.seed.t":"一个种子，一块棋盘","g.gridlix.daily.star.1":"在步数上限内做出目标方块。","g.gridlix.daily.star.2":"并且在标准杆内完成——也就是机器人的步数。","g.gridlix.daily.star.3":"在标准杆内完成，且全程一个道具都没用。","g.gridlix.daily.title":"和所有人同一道题","g.gridlix.genre":"益智","g.gridlix.how.1.d":"一个方向同时推动棋盘上所有方块，没有半步。","g.gridlix.how.1.t":"滑动","g.gridlix.how.2.d":"两块相同且相邻的方块合成一块，数值翻倍。每步每块只合并一次。","g.gridlix.how.2.t":"合并","g.gridlix.how.3.d":"无尽模式里目标是你自己的纪录；每日模式里则是规定步数内做出规定的方块。","g.gridlix.how.3.t":"达成目标","g.gridlix.how.eyebrow":"怎么玩","g.gridlix.how.intro":"除了滑动，没有别的要学。之后全是算术和定力。","g.gridlix.how.title":"从头到尾只有一个动作","g.gridlix.month.eyebrow":"整月","g.gridlix.month.intro":"错过一个晚上，不该抹掉四个月。护盾会吸收一次缺席，日历把整个月都摆在眼前。","g.gridlix.month.legend.done":"已完成","g.gridlix.month.legend.miss":"缺席","g.gridlix.month.legend.shield":"护盾抵挡","g.gridlix.month.medals.d":"一个月结束后评定一次，永久保留，与你的最佳连胜一同陈列在奖杯柜里。","g.gridlix.month.medals.t":"月度奖牌","g.gridlix.month.streak.d":"缺席当天护盾自动消耗，之后靠继续游玩赚回。普通的糟糕一周不会终结连胜。","g.gridlix.month.streak.t":"护盾","g.gridlix.month.title":"真的守得住的连胜","g.gridlix.openAria":"打开 Gridlix:2048 页面","g.gridlix.playAria":"在 Google Play 查看 Gridlix:2048","g.gridlix.premium.1":"任何地方都没有横幅和插屏广告","g.gridlix.premium.2":"使用道具无需先看视频","g.gridlix.premium.3":"棋盘填满时可以续玩","g.gridlix.premium.4":"四套锁定配色随之解锁","g.gridlix.premium.eyebrow":"Premium","g.gridlix.premium.intro":"通过 Google Play 订阅，可选按月或按年，年度方案含免费试用。随时可在 Play 取消。","g.gridlix.premium.note":"每日谜题、星级、连胜和奖牌，无论付费与否都完全一样。","g.gridlix.premium.title":"不被打断地玩","g.gridlix.tagline":"一块棋盘，一道每日谜题——全世界同一道。","g.gridlix.themes.eyebrow":"配色","g.gridlix.themes.free":"免费","g.gridlix.themes.intro":"配色只改变方块、强调色与光晕，从不改变规则。这些是直接取自应用的真实颜色。","g.gridlix.themes.premium":"Premium","g.gridlix.themes.title":"五套配色，一块棋盘","g.words.chip.1":"文字游戏","g.words.chip.2":"原型","g.words.tagline":"一款文字益智游戏，仍停留在纸上。同样的形态：小、安静、离线。","g.words.when":"暂无日期","gd.blocklix.booster.bomb.desc":"瞬间炸掉 3×3 区域","gd.blocklix.booster.bomb.name":"炸弹","gd.blocklix.booster.hammer.desc":"一锤敲掉棋盘上任意一个方块","gd.blocklix.booster.hammer.name":"锤子","gd.blocklix.booster.lightning.desc":"一击清空整行加整列","gd.blocklix.booster.lightning.name":"闪电","gd.blocklix.booster.shuffle.desc":"立刻换上三块全新方块","gd.blocklix.booster.shuffle.name":"洗牌","gd.blocklix.diff.easy.desc":"悠闲的长局，星星少一些。","gd.blocklix.diff.easy.name":"简单","gd.blocklix.diff.expert.desc":"每一批新方块都是一道谜题。","gd.blocklix.diff.expert.name":"专家","gd.blocklix.diff.hard.desc":"大方块来得更早。","gd.blocklix.diff.hard.name":"困难","gd.blocklix.diff.insane.desc":"全凭运气，方块可能根本放不下。","gd.blocklix.diff.insane.name":"疯狂","gd.blocklix.diff.master.desc":"只有高手才能活下来，没有简单方块。","gd.blocklix.diff.master.name":"大师","gd.blocklix.diff.normal.desc":"经典节奏，大约十分钟。","gd.blocklix.diff.normal.name":"普通","gd.blocklix.rank.bronze":"青铜","gd.blocklix.rank.celestial":"天界","gd.blocklix.rank.cosmic":"宇宙","gd.blocklix.rank.diamond":"钻石","gd.blocklix.rank.emerald":"祖母绿","gd.blocklix.rank.eternal":"永恒","gd.blocklix.rank.gold":"黄金","gd.blocklix.rank.grandmaster":"宗师","gd.blocklix.rank.legend":"传奇","gd.blocklix.rank.master":"大师","gd.blocklix.rank.mythic":"神话","gd.blocklix.rank.platinum":"铂金","gd.blocklix.rank.ruby":"红宝石","gd.blocklix.rank.silver":"白银","gd.blocklix.rank.stone":"岩石","gd.gridlix.booster.delete.name":"删除","gd.gridlix.booster.shuffle.name":"打乱","gd.gridlix.booster.swap.name":"交换","gd.gridlix.booster.undo.name":"撤销","gd.gridlix.booster.value_clear.name":"清理","gd.gridlix.medal.bronze":"铜牌","gd.gridlix.medal.gold":"金牌","gd.gridlix.medal.silver":"银牌","gp.back":"全部作品","hero.cta.games":"我们的游戏","hero.cta.studio":"关于工作室","hero.kick":"独立 Android 工作室","hero.lede":"两款益智游戏，一个人做的。没有账号，没有我们自己的服务器，十二种语言——还有一个只做一件事的 Premium：去掉广告。","hero.scroll":"向下滚动","hero.t1":"小而精的游戏。","hero.t2":"为长久而做。","how.eyebrow":"怎么玩","how.intro":"Blocklix 就是你见过的那种 8×8 放置消除——只是打磨到这三个动作每一个都顺手为止。","how.s1d":"一次三块。哪块放得下就放哪里；不会旋转，也不会下落。","how.s1t":"放置","how.s2d":"填满一行或一列，它就消失。同时填满两者，棋盘会告诉你。","how.s2t":"消除","how.s3d":"连续几步都消除，倍数就往上涨。当一条线即将消失时，会有一声轻轻的提示。","how.s3t":"连击","how.title":"三个你早已熟悉的动作","meta.blocklix.desc":"在 8×8 棋盘上放置三块方块，消除整行整列，连成连击。38 款主题、60 个段位、六种难度、十二种语言。无需账号。","meta.blocklix.title":"Blocklix — 8×8 放置消除益智游戏 | Vaslix Games","meta.description":"Vaslix Games 是一家独立 Android 工作室，专注开发紧凑、用心的益智游戏。Gridlix:2048 与 Blocklix 均已在 Google Play 上线。","meta.gridlix.desc":"4×4 合并益智游戏：每日谜题全球统一，连胜护盾、月度奖牌与五种助力道具。无尽模式永不结束。","meta.gridlix.title":"Gridlix:2048 — 全球同一道每日谜题 | Vaslix Games","meta.home.desc":"Vaslix Games 是一家独立 Android 工作室，专注开发紧凑、用心的益智游戏。Gridlix:2048 与 Blocklix 均已在 Google Play 上线。","meta.home.title":"Vaslix Games — 小而耐玩的 Android 益智游戏","meta.notFound.desc":"这个地址不通向任何地方，架子上却有东西。","meta.notFound.title":"页面未找到 — Vaslix Games","meta.press.desc":"供媒体与合作方使用的简介、事实清单、图标与联系方式。约五个工作日内回复。","meta.press.title":"媒体资料包 — Vaslix Games","meta.privacy.desc":"Vaslix Games 如何处理 Gridlix:2048 与 Blocklix 中的数据。通俗摘要、完整政策、每款游戏各自存储的内容，以及 GDPR/CCPA/COPPA 说明。","meta.privacy.title":"隐私政策 — Vaslix Games","meta.studio.desc":"一个人，小而专注的 Android 应用，无账号、无自有服务器。我们在做什么、坚持什么规则、接下来做什么。","meta.studio.title":"工作室 — Vaslix Games","meta.title":"Vaslix Games — 小而耐玩的 Android 益智游戏","nav.aria":"主导航","nav.brand":"Vaslix Games","nav.games":"游戏","nav.langLabel":"切换语言","nav.menu":"菜单","nav.press":"媒体","nav.privacy":"隐私","nav.skip":"跳到主要内容","nav.studio":"工作室","nav.theme.auto":"切换到自动主题","nav.theme.dark":"切换到深色主题","nav.theme.light":"切换到浅色主题","nf.body":"这个地址不通向任何地方。架子倒还在原处。","nf.eyebrow":"404","nf.games":"看看架子","nf.home":"回到首页","nf.title":"这一格是空的","nums.accounts":"个账号需要注册","nums.games":"款游戏上架 Google Play","nums.langs":"种语言","nums.person":"个人","nums.servers":"台自有服务器","nums.since":"自何年起发布","nums.title":"数字里的工作室","p.changed.body":"我们将本政策与两款应用的源码逐条核对，并修正了不一致之处。不再提及 Google AdMob——两款应用均未集成。“读取 Android 设备 ID 以验证订阅”的说法有误，已删除。随 Appodeal 聚合 SDK 一同打包的广告类 SDK——Adjust、AppsFlyer、Meta Audience Network、Sentry 与 Yandex AppMetrica——现已在 §2 中列明，Play 安装来源、已安装应用查询与 Privacy Sandbox 权限亦然。§1a 现已列出应用实际存储的全部内容，包括金币流水与向你展示过哪些广告的记录。备份与云存档在两款游戏中并不相同，现按游戏分别说明，而非笼统地对两者作出承诺。不再描述音频与播客应用：它们并不存在。","p.changed.title":"本次修订的变更","p.hero.chip.billing":"Google Play 结算","p.hero.chip.gdpr":"遵循 GDPR / CCPA / COPPA","p.hero.chip.updated":"最近更新","p.hero.eyebrow":"通俗摘要在前，完整法律文本在后","p.hero.lede":"Vaslix Games 如何处理我们 Android 应用中的信息。本政策对我们发布的一切一视同仁地适用。无需账号、没有我们自己的服务器、没有意外。<strong>它涵盖 Gridlix:2048 与 Blocklix，两者均已上架 Google Play——§1 说明二者的差异所在。</strong>","p.hero.title":"隐私政策","p.sec1.backup":"<strong>Android 自带备份在 Blocklix 中启用，在 Gridlix:2048 中关闭</strong>——上方表格标明了各自情况。在启用的一侧，且你的设备也开启了备份时，Android 会把 1a 所列的本地数据复制到你个人的 Google 账号，并在你用同一账号重装时恢复。该副本属于你：由 Android 保管并加密，我们既无法读取也无法删除。你可在 <em>Android 设置 → Google → 备份</em> 中管理它。此外，两款游戏都有基于 Google Play Games Saved Games 的云存档：文件保存在你自己的 Play 游戏空间中，让进度跟随你在设备间迁移。它必须登录 Play 游戏才会运行，只携带游戏进度——绝不包含订阅状态或购买数据——且由 Google 提供服务，而非我们的服务器。在 Blocklix 中它默认关闭并正逐步开放。在 Gridlix:2048 中，只要你登录了 Play 游戏它就会同步；该应用没有自己的退出入口，因此需要在 Google Play 游戏应用中退出登录才能停止。Gridlix:2048 还会解锁 Play 游戏成就，并把你的成绩提交到两个 Play 游戏排行榜。","p.sec1.body1a":"每款应用都会在你设备上的本地 Room/SQLite 数据库（或等效的本地存储）中保存以下内容。我们绝不会将其上传到我们的任何服务器；在为该应用启用了 Android 自带备份的情况下，这些内容可能被复制到你的个人 Google 账号中，详见 1d：","p.sec1.body1b":"下文所述的第三方服务可能会自动收集技术信息及与广告相关的信息：","p.sec1.callout":"<strong>不会在本地存储的内容：</strong>支付信息、购买令牌与 Google 账号标识。这些都不会离开 Google Play。","p.sec1.deviceIdCallout":"<strong>我们为何披露这一点：</strong>Google Play 的「数据安全」表单要求申报每一次对广告 ID 与 Android 设备 ID 的读取，无论该值是否离开你的设备。你可以随时在<em>Android 设置 → 隐私 → 广告</em>中重置广告 ID；Android ID 会在设备恢复出厂设置时重新生成。","p.sec1.firebase":"两款应用均包含 <strong>Google Firebase Analytics</strong> 与 <strong>Firebase Crashlytics</strong>；Blocklix 另有 <strong>Firebase Remote Config</strong>。Analytics 收集随机的应用实例 ID、设备与系统信息，以及聚合的应用内事件——一局结束、购买完成、广告展示（含该次展示上报的收入与网络名称）——以便我们了解总体使用情况并平衡游戏经济。我们不用它构建广告画像。Remote Config 下载少量功能开关与数值配置，除请求的技术元数据外不发送任何个人数据。Crashlytics 在应用崩溃或卡死时发送报告：调用栈、设备型号、系统与应用版本，以及一个随机安装标识——足以定位缺陷，不包含你输入或游玩的内容。构建中并非只有 Crashlytics 一个错误上报器；见 §2。详情：<a href=\"https://firebase.google.com/support/privacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">firebase.google.com/support/privacy ↗</a>。","p.sec1.h3a":"1a. 本地存储在你的设备上","p.sec1.h3b":"1b. 由第三方代我们收集","p.sec1.h3c":"1c. 分析、崩溃报告与远程配置（Google Firebase）","p.sec1.h3d":"1d. 备份与云存档","p.sec1.intro":"我们的应用无需创建账号，我们也不会有意直接收集个人信息。信息分为两类。","p.sec1.list1a.1":"应用自身状态：你离开时的棋盘、分数、道具与续关次数","p.sec1.list1a.2":"你的最佳对局记录与最高分，仅保存在本地","p.sec1.list1a.3":"应用设置：声音开关、触感反馈开关、主题、通知，以及类似的应用内偏好","p.sec1.list1a.4":"首次启动标记：首次打开应用时据此引导你完成新手流程","p.sec1.list1a.5":"订阅状态的本地缓存摘要——是否有效、何种方案、产品 ID、是否已用过免费试用及到期时间——以便应用启动时立即生效，无需等待网络","p.sec1.list1a.6":"你的进度与游戏内经济：金币余额及其完整流水、每日与每周任务、成就、段位进度、连续游玩记录、已解锁主题与外观、难度进度、每天的每日挑战结果以及月度奖牌","p.sec1.list1a.7":"向你展示过的广告记录——类型、时间，以及控制频次的每日计数——以及在 Gridlix:2048 中你通常游玩的时段，以便提醒通知在合理的时间送达，而不是随机出现","p.sec1.list1b.1":"Google 广告 ID（GAID）——读取它是为了让广告网络投放广告、限制频次并归因安装。当 Premium 或「去广告」生效时，它不再用于横幅、插屏或冷启动广告；如果你主动选择观看激励视频，它仍会被处理。","p.sec1.list1b.2":"与设备绑定的标识符，包括 Android 设备 ID（SSAID）。我们自己的代码既不读取它，也不读取广告 ID；两者都可能在 §2 所述的广告 SDK 内部被读取，用于投放、频次控制与无效流量识别。它们与你的订阅无关：该权益直接来自 Google Play Billing。","p.sec1.list1b.3":"IP 地址及由此推算的大致地理位置","p.sec1.list1b.4":"设备型号、操作系统版本、语言与时区","p.sec1.list1b.5":"应用版本、会话时间戳与崩溃诊断信息","p.sec1.list1b.6":"聚合的、不可识别个人身份的使用事件，仅以聚合形式使用","p.sec1.list1b.7":"Play 安装来源（Install Referrer）——你是如何到达应用商店页面的——用于将安装归因到带来它的推广活动","p.sec1.list1b.8":"设备上可启动的已安装应用清单，以及对少数已知 root 管理软件包的检测。这些都不是我们的代码读取的：它们来自随聚合 SDK 打包的广告 SDK，用于定向投放与设备完整性判断。","p.sec1.list1b.9":"Android Privacy Sandbox 相关信号——Topics、Attribution Reporting、Protected Audience 与 Ad ID 服务。应用为此声明了权限，使广告 SDK 能够使用由操作系统提供的兴趣与归因数据，而不是由我们自行汇集。","p.sec1.title":"我们收集的信息","p.sec10.body":"关于我们任一应用的隐私问题，请发送邮件至 <a href=\"mailto:vaslixofficial@protonmail.com\">vaslixofficial@protonmail.com</a>。我们会尽量在合理时间内回复。","p.sec10.title":"联系方式","p.sec2.appodeal1":"我们使用 <a href=\"https://www.appodeal.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Appodeal</a> 作为主要的广告聚合合作方。Appodeal 的隐私政策见 <a href=\"https://www.appodeal.com/privacy-policy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">appodeal.com/privacy-policy ↗</a>。","p.sec2.appodeal2":"Appodeal 聚合了大量广告网络的需求，实际启用的网络会随着 Appodeal 更新其 SDK 以及我们调整构建配置而变化。当前的权威列表由 Appodeal 发布：","p.sec2.appodeal3":"该页面上的每个网络都链接到各自的隐私政策。与广告个性化相关的具体隐私问题，可直接在同一网站向 Appodeal 提出。","p.sec2.bundled":"Appodeal 的软件包中不只有广告网络。以下组件会被编译进我们的发布版本，注册各自的服务与接收器，并由 Appodeal 而非我们的代码启动——我们既不调用也不配置它们。Google Play 的“数据安全”表单问的是收集了什么，而不是谁初始化的，因此这里将它们逐一列明：","p.sec2.bundledList.1":"<a href=\"https://www.adjust.com/terms/privacy-policy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Adjust ↗</a> —— 安装归因","p.sec2.bundledList.2":"<a href=\"https://www.appsflyer.com/legal/services-privacy-policy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">AppsFlyer ↗</a> —— 安装归因，自带安装来源接收器","p.sec2.bundledList.3":"<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/privacy/policy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Meta Audience Network ↗</a> —— 广告需求与效果衡量","p.sec2.bundledList.4":"<a href=\"https://sentry.io/privacy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sentry ↗</a> —— 错误与崩溃上报，发送至 Appodeal 的项目而非我们的项目。它是 Firebase Crashlytics（§1c）之外的第二个崩溃上报器。","p.sec2.bundledList.5":"<a href=\"https://yandex.com/legal/confidential/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yandex AppMetrica ↗</a> —— 分析统计，随 Yandex 广告适配器一同引入","p.sec2.callout":"<strong>Premium 订阅者——以及在 Blocklix 中购买过\"去广告\"的用户——不会看到横幅、插屏或打开广告。</strong>激励视频从不强加于人：无论免费还是付费，都只在你明确点击奖励入口后才开始。应用启动时、在你的权益确认之前，仍会有少量面向广告服务商的初始化流量。","p.sec2.h3a":"Appodeal 聚合","p.sec2.h3c":"聚合 SDK 内部随附的组件","p.sec2.intro":"我们的应用会展示横幅广告、偶尔的插屏广告，以及你主动选择观看以换取游戏内奖励（道具、失败后续关、额外金币等）的激励视频广告。Blocklix 还会在你返回应用时展示打开广告；Gridlix:2048 没有。Premium 订阅会在两款游戏中关闭横幅、插屏与打开广告，在 Blocklix 中一次性购买\"去广告\"效果相同。激励视频对所有人开放，且只有在你点击其入口后才会播放。","p.sec2.title":"广告合作方","p.sec3.intro":"两款应用都提供可选的 Premium 订阅，由 Google 通过 Google Play Billing 销售与处理。Blocklix 提供周付、月付与年付自动续期方案；Gridlix:2048 提供月付与年付。符合条件的新订阅者可在年付方案上获得首次免费试用。Premium 会关闭横幅、插屏与打开广告，并解锁该应用特有的高级功能——例如双倍金币与每日礼物。Blocklix 另外销售一次性商品：金币包、新手礼包、存钱罐提取，以及与 Premium 覆盖范围相同的永久\"去广告\"。Gridlix:2048 完全不销售一次性商品。","p.sec3.list.1":"所有支付、账单、账户与税务信息均由 Google 收集和处理。我们不会看到、存储或传输你的支付方式、Google 账号邮箱或任何政府身份标识。","p.sec3.list.2":"应用仅从 Google 收到一个不可识别身份的权益信号：你的安装是否存在有效订阅、是哪一个产品，以及在 Blocklix 中购买了哪些一次性商品。该信号按 §1a 所述在本地缓存。","p.sec3.list.3":"订阅管理、取消、退款申请与续订日期全部在 Google Play 中处理。应用内的「管理」按钮会直接跳转到 Google Play 订阅页面。","p.sec3.list.4":"Google Play 的隐私政策适用于所有与结算相关的处理：<a href=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">policies.google.com/privacy ↗</a>","p.sec3.title":"订阅与应用内购买（Google Play 结算）","p.sec4.body":"如果你身处欧洲经济区、英国或瑞士，与广告相关的处理的法律依据是你的同意，通过 IAB Transparency &amp; Consent Framework（TCF）对话框收集。该对话框由 Appodeal 聚合 SDK 自行在你所在地区需要时弹出；我们并不运营自己的同意管理平台。你可以随时撤回或更改同意。Blocklix 可从应用内隐私设置中重新打开该对话框；Gridlix:2048 没有该界面，因此需清除应用数据（设置 → 应用），下次启动时同意对话框会再次出现。通过 Google Play Billing 处理订阅数据的法律依据，是你购买订阅时订立的合同的履行。","p.sec4.title":"法律依据与同意（GDPR / 欧洲经济区、英国、瑞士）","p.sec5.body":"如果你是加利福尼亚州居民，或位于其他适用的美国州，你有权拒绝为行为广告目的「出售」或「共享」你的个人信息。应用内的同意对话框会在法律要求的地方提供这一拒绝选项。Google Play 对订阅的处理不构成个人信息的「出售」。","p.sec5.title":"CCPA / 美国州级隐私法","p.sec6.body":"我们的应用并非面向 13 岁以下儿童（或你所在司法辖区的同等最低年龄）。我们不会有意收集儿童的个人信息。Premium 订阅面向成年购买者；应用内购买需要具备相应购买权限的 Google Play 账号。","p.sec6.title":"儿童隐私（COPPA）","p.sec7.body":"§1a 所述的本地数据会保留在你的设备上，直到你清除应用数据或卸载应用。我们不在自有服务器上保留个人信息。在启用了 Android 自带备份的一侧——Blocklix，而非 Gridlix:2048——它所生成的副本存放在你自己的 Google 账号中，可在 Android 设置 → Google → 备份 中删除。Play 游戏云存档存放在你的 Play 游戏账号中，从那里删除。广告合作方与 Google Play 依据各自的政策保留数据。","p.sec7.title":"数据保留","p.sec8.body":"根据你所在的司法辖区，你可能有权访问、更正、删除、限制或转移你的个人数据，并向监管机构提出投诉。由于我们并不直接持有这些数据，相关请求应提交给对应的广告合作方，或——对于结算数据——提交给 Google Play。","p.sec8.callout":"要删除任一应用的全部本地数据，请卸载它，或在设备设置中清除其存储（<em>设置 → 应用 → [该应用] → 存储 → 清除数据</em>）。这会清除设备上的副本。Android 已经生成的备份——仅 Blocklix——可在 <em>Android 设置 → Google → 备份</em> 中删除；Play 游戏云存档则从你的 Play 游戏账号中删除。","p.sec8.title":"你的权利","p.sec9.body":"我们可能会不时更新本隐私政策——例如新增作品、更换广告合作方或调整订阅机制时。页面顶部的「最近更新」日期表示最近一次变更的时间。重大变更会在下次启动时在应用内体现。","p.sec9.title":"本政策的变更","p.summary.1.desc":"游戏状态、设置、最高分、你的金币余额，以及缓存的 Premium 标记。这些都不会到达我们的任何服务器。在 Blocklix 中，Android 自带备份可能把它们复制到你自己的 Google 账号（§1d）。","p.summary.1.title":"留在你设备上的内容","p.summary.2.desc":"支付信息、你的 Google 账号邮箱、账号标识、联系人、照片，或除广告网络基于 IP 的粗略估算之外的位置信息。","p.summary.2.title":"我们永远看不到的内容","p.summary.3.desc":"免费玩家会通过 Appodeal 聚合看到横幅与插屏广告，在 Blocklix 中还有打开广告。Premium——或在 Blocklix 中一次性购买\"去广告\"——会关闭它们。激励视频对所有人都是自愿的：只有点击奖励入口后才会播放。","p.summary.3.title":"广告与 Premium","p.summary.4.desc":"广告 SDK 可能读取你的 Google 广告 ID 与 Android 设备 ID，用于投放广告与控制频次。我们自己的代码两者都不读取，且它们与你的订阅毫无关系。两个标识符均可在 Android 设置中重置。","p.summary.4.title":"设备标识符","p.summary.heading":"简短版本","p.table.cloud.onSignIn":"登录 Play 游戏后即启用","p.table.cloud.optional":"可选，默认关闭","p.table.col.what":"功能","p.table.fb.all":"Analytics、Crashlytics、Remote Config","p.table.fb.core":"Analytics、Crashlytics","p.table.intro":"本政策适用于我们发布的每一款应用，而各应用并不相同。差异之处集中在此处；本文件其余内容对两款均适用。","p.table.no":"无","p.table.oneTime.yes":"金币包、新手礼包、存钱罐、去广告","p.table.plans.2":"月付、年付","p.table.plans.3":"周付、月付、年付","p.table.row.appOpen":"应用打开广告","p.table.row.backup":"Android 自带备份","p.table.row.cloudSave":"Play 游戏云存档","p.table.row.firebase":"Google Firebase","p.table.row.oneTime":"一次性购买","p.table.row.plans":"订阅方案","p.table.row.settings":"应用内隐私设置","p.table.title":"我们的游戏之间有哪些差异","p.table.yes":"有","p.toc.1":"1. 我们收集的信息","p.toc.10":"10. 联系方式","p.toc.2":"2. 广告合作方","p.toc.3":"3. 订阅与 Play 结算","p.toc.4":"4. 法律依据（GDPR）","p.toc.5":"5. CCPA / 美国州级法律","p.toc.6":"6. 儿童隐私","p.toc.7":"7. 数据保留","p.toc.8":"8. 你的权利","p.toc.9":"9. 本政策的变更","p.toc.aria":"目录","p.toc.title":"本页内容","press.aboutBody":"Vaslix Games 是一家成立于 2025 年的独立 Android 发行工作室。我们做小而专注的益智游戏，坚持隐私优先：无需账号、没有我们自己的服务器存储用户数据、没有内部分析。Google Play 上已发布两款作品：Gridlix:2048 与 Blocklix——一款 8×8 方块拼图，含六个难度等级、38 种主题与 60 个段位，已本地化为 12 种语言。","press.aboutEyebrow":"媒体资料","press.aboutTitle":"关于工作室","press.assetBlocklix":"Blocklix 图标","press.assetGridlix":"Gridlix:2048 图标","press.assetLockup":"带文字的标志","press.assetLockupDark":"深色背景版标志","press.assetMark":"工作室标记","press.assetsEyebrow":"下载","press.assetsIntro":"图标与标志与上架版本一致。请原样使用，不要改色或裁切。","press.assetsTitle":"品牌素材","press.contactEyebrow":"媒体资料","press.contactTitle":"媒体联系","press.copied":"已复制","press.copyBtn":"复制简介","press.eyebrow":"媒体资料","press.fact.contact":"联系方式","press.fact.founded":"成立","press.fact.langs":"语言","press.fact.money":"商业模式","press.fact.money.v":"免费含广告 · 可选 Premium，通过 Google Play 结算","press.fact.people":"团队","press.fact.platform":"平台","press.fact.studio":"工作室","press.fact.titles":"作品","press.factsEyebrow":"事实清单","press.factsTitle":"已核对的数字","press.lede":"撰稿人需要的一切，集中一处，可自由使用。","press.sla":"回信的是人，通常在 5 个工作日内。写清媒体、截稿时间和你要什么——这样第一封回复就能用得上。","press.title":"面向媒体与合作方","principles.eyebrow":"原则","principles.intro":"遵守它们比为它们找借口更省事，这也是这些应用始终保持轻量的原因。","principles.title":"四条不会动摇的规则","privacy.eyebrow":"你的数据","privacyCta.btn":"阅读政策","privacyCta.text":"游戏对你的了解，全都在你手机里。政策写清楚了那到底是什么、免费玩家会加载哪些广告网络，以及每一笔付款为什么走 Google 而不经过我们。","privacyCta.title":"我们一台服务器都没有","road.eyebrow":"长线游戏","road.families":"十五个家族","road.intro":"下面的一切都靠玩来获得。这里没有任何东西出售。","road.missionsD":"十三类随段位成长的每日任务、两个每周任务，以及坚持一整周的宝箱。","road.missionsT":"每日与每周任务","road.questsD":"每条五步，从第一次消除到几乎没人到达的那些。","road.questsT":"21 条成就链","road.ranksD":"十五个家族，每族四阶。积分就是你的得分，按所选难度加权。","road.ranksT":"60 个段位","road.title":"一条路，而不是跑步机","roadmap.cta":"完整路线图","roadmap.eyebrow":"路线图","roadmap.intro":"两款已上线，一款还在纸上。前一件没做完，后一件就不会开工。","roadmap.note":"这里不承诺日期，只承诺顺序。","roadmap.r1.desc":"已在 Google Play 上架。4×4 合并益智游戏，配有全球统一的每日谜题、月度奖牌、五种助力道具，以及可选的无广告 Premium。","roadmap.r1.meta":"已发布 · 2026","roadmap.r1.title":"Gridlix:2048","roadmap.r2.desc":"已在 Google Play 上线。8×8 放置消除拼图：六个难度等级、38 种主题、60 个段位、四种道具、每日与每周任务，以及可选的无广告 Premium。","roadmap.r2.meta":"已发布 · 2026","roadmap.r2.title":"Blocklix","roadmap.r3.desc":"一款文字解谜，还停在纸上。形式和另外两款一样：小巧、离线、无账号，Premium 只负责去掉广告。","roadmap.r3.meta":"稍后","roadmap.r3.title":"Wordlix","roadmap.title":"我们的方向","shelf.count.idea":"在纸上","shelf.count.live":"已上架","shelf.count.open":"预留位置","shelf.count.soon":"制作中","shelf.eyebrow":"架子","shelf.intro":"每款作品一块面板，按完成顺序排列。最后一块是刻意留空的——架子是按将来的作品量的，不是按现有的。","shelf.more":"打开页面","shelf.next":"下一款","shelf.open.body":"新作准备好后就占下这一格，用同一套框架，把空格再往后推。页面本身不用改。","shelf.open.meta":"尚未命名","shelf.open.title":"下一款会落在这里","shelf.prev":"上一款","shelf.railAria":"工作室的架子","shelf.title":"架上有两款，位置为后来者留着。","status.dev":"制作中","status.idea":"仍在纸上","status.live":"已上架","status.open":"空位","story.eyebrow":"简短版本","story.p1":"Vaslix Games 只有一个人。这不是苦情故事，而是决定其他一切的约束条件。一人工作室维护不了登录系统、服务器集群和客服团队，所以干脆不做——游戏反而因此更好。","story.p2":"剩下的正是玩家真正接触的部分：棋盘、节奏、方块落位的手感。本会花在注册流程上的每一小时，都花进了难度曲线。","story.p3":"目录有意地慢慢生长。一款作品做完才发布，之后维护数年，绝不会悄悄变成一个需要登录的服务。","story.title":"为什么应用一直很小","themes.eyebrow":"38 种主题","themes.free":"安装即免费","themes.intro":"四种从安装起就属于你。其余的用星星换取，或随 Premium 一起到来——每一种都会改变天空、方块，以及一条线被消除时点亮的方式。","themes.tap":"点一下主题，给棋盘换装","themes.title":"每块棋盘都有自己的配色","trust.1.desc":"没什么可注册的。进度不会离开打出它的那台手机。","trust.1.title":"无需账号","trust.2.desc":"付款由 Google Play 收。你的卡到不了我们这里——它根本不经过我们。","trust.2.title":"不存付款数据","trust.3.desc":"第一条广告加载前先征得同意，法律要求的地方给出退出选项，政策里点名每一家相关公司。","trust.3.title":"GDPR · CCPA · COPPA","trust.4.desc":"Premium 关掉横幅、插屏和冷启动广告。激励视频对所有人保留，只有你点了才播。就这么多。","trust.4.title":"Premium 去除广告"}};
